\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Ruby\cell There we go! I've put 'earts over the \lquote I\rquote s and little kiss marks, just like wot Roxy does. Give this to that moon-eyed guard and watch it work its magic!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the forged love letter!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Ruby\cell I know I ain't one to talk, but you keep yerselves out o' trouble, alright? I'd 'ate to see you thrown in jail.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Ruby\cell Go on\emdash go an' give that love letter to the guard. 'E'll never guess in a million years I wrote it! Heh heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Ruby\cell So, did me little love letter do the trick? I'll bet it got his heart poundin' ten to the dozen! Ahh, you blokes ain't 'alf gullible!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A sudden gust of wind blows the love letter away!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know what you're skulking about for\emdash there's no way I'm letting the likes of you through here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wot d'you want? Can't you tell I'm busy?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You wot? Yer tryin' to come up wiv a way to get past the guard, and yer finkin' o' usin'...a dog!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are you bleedin' mad!? If 'e gets wind o' you tryin' any funny business, you'll be straight in the dungeons!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wot you need is a foolproof plan. ...An' I just so 'appen to 'ave one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I do a little bit o' tunnel-buildin' on the side, see. An' it just so 'appens that me latest creation is just about finished.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I've only gone an' broken the flintstone I've been usin' to dig wiv. I was so close, an' all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you could sort me out wiv a new one, well...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I might find it in me 'eart to let you be the lucky devil who gets to...test me little passage through the wall, if you know wot I mean. Heh heh. Well? You up for it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Come on, don't be like that! This is a once in a lifetime opportunity, mate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So come on, wot d'you reckon? You gonna take me up on me little offer or not?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! That's the spirit! I knew you'd see sense! After all, you'd be a fool to pass up a chance like this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon if you search round town, you'll turn up a bit o' flintstone in the end. Smash a few pots, see what you can find, innit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First bloke through the wall! Talk about an honour! And that, my friend, could be you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon if you search round town, you'll turn up a bit o' flintstone in the end. Smash a few pots, see what you can find, innit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh ho! Wot've we got 'ere then? Looks like a nice piece o' flintstone to me! So, are you gonna give it 'ere, or wot?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh!? \lquote No\rquote !? Are you kiddin' me!? Don't mess me about, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Much obliged! Now I can finally finish me tunnel! Gimme just a second 'ere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, one last push! Hup! Not far now... Hup! That's it, go on, my son... Hup! I can see light! One more biggun... HUP!!!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I did it! Me masterpiece is finished at last!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's beautiful! Just beautiful! An' I couldn't've done it wivout ya! You little beauty! Heh heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, don't let no one say I ain't a man o' me word\emdash go on, through you go. First dibs is all yours.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Tunnels, eh? Nuffink else quite gives you that magical feelin' o' goin' from one place to anuvver wivout 'avin' to go round. Well, use it as much as you like!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It seems to be a tunnel linking this part of Heliodor to an alley in the upper part of town. Go through it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not so fast, you! There's no way you're coming through here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Roxy's worth 'er weight in gold, she really is. She's the most famous dancer in the city, so everyone's 'eard of 'er, rich and poor. Which means she always packs the place out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When she first told me she wanted to work 'ere, my jaw nearly 'it the floor! You don't find talent like that every day, I'm tellin' ya.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: N-Nooo! Not a dog! Anything but that! Eeek!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I can't be standing here on sentry duty at a time like this! No, when love calls, one must answer!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Mmm, Roxy... My darling Roxy...! We'll be together...mmm...forever... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: All's well in Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not so fast, you! There's no way you're coming through here!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Of course, there is one way to get me to change my mind. I'm talking about cold hard cash, and lots of it\emdash 2000 gold coins, to be precise. So, what do you say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, in that case there's nothing doing. May I suggest you make yourself scarce? Sharpish!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pah! Do you think I can't count or something? Come back when you've got enough!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... (sniff) Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: 'Ello, 'andsome! You're new! Let me guess\emdash come from somewhere out in the sticks to see yours truly strut 'er stuff, 'ave ya? Tee hee! Thought so! Well, enjoy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I ain't short on fans, ya know. Even the little nippers love me! There's this one in particular, but 'e ain't around at the mo. Prob'ly off playin' 'ide-and-seek...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'E's quite a character, that one. Got all these...'idey-'oles all around town, 'e 'as. Sits in 'em an' earwigs on all the latest gossip, the cheeky little toerag.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What is it, love? Did you wanna ask me somefink?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hee hee! Just 'ere to watch me strut me stuff then, eh? Well, tonight I'm gonna give it me all, so enjoy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? You want me to distract the guard wiv me good looks an' winnin' personality? Sorry love, can't 'elp you there, I'm afraid.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When yer a stunner like me, you soon learn not to mess wiv blokes' feelings. Never ends well, believe me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An' besides, if I start doin' special favours for you, all the fans'll be askin'. Not worth the 'assle, love. Sorry.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This place is legend'ry! It's filthy, it's got no roof and the food's bleedin' awful. But the drinks're cheap, and the dancers...heh, they're out o' this world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll bet yer 'ere for an eyeful o' Roxy an' all, ain'tcha?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, your loss, mate. Trust me, she's the bee's knees\emdash an' then some!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, yer out o' luck I'm afraid. Ol' Roxy don't get 'ere till the sun goes down.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that she's been back for a while. I've been waitin' for 'er for days now... Aww, I can't wait to see 'er again! Come on, Rox...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Roxy darlin', you rock my world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Nobody does it better than Roxy! No, I'll never get tired o' watchin' 'er do 'er stuff, not in a million years, mate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to downtown 'Eliodor, the grimy little secret the posh folks over the wall don't want you to know about! Heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You ain't from round 'ere, eh? Well, if you ain't got a reason to stick around, I wouldn't bovver.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Wossat? Yer lookin' to get over the other side of the wall?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now you mention it, I did 'ear a rumour about some bloke diggin' a tunnel. Dunno 'oo, though. Or where...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ello, love. 'Ave you seen all the nippers playin' 'ide-and-seek round town? It's all the rage wiv the littluns these days. Word is, young Cammo's the sneakiest of the lot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An' the ears on the boy! There ain't a bit o' gossip 'e don't catch. Told me the other day he'd got somefink juicy on the guard down at the gate there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You wot? You want a word wiv 'im, you say? Well, last I saw, 'e was up in the walkways somewhere.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hanging out here jamming is all well and good, but I can't help feeling I'd like to play in front of some slightly bigger crowds...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that would mean hitting the nice part of town, and I don't have the money or contacts to get past the checkpoint. If only there was a way of sneaking through...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Cor, I dunno wot I'd do wivout Roxy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All me problems, all me worries, they just disappear when she starts dancin'. Ahh, she's the best!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It seems to be a tunnel linking this part of Heliodor to the slums. Go through it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Wait! The guards'll spot us! It's too risky!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell If we need to leave, we'll have to do it from downtown.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hold up, <pc>. The guards aren't going to let us past, so we'll need to find another way to get to Derk's shop.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hey! If the guards spot us now, this will all have been for nothing. We need to get to Derk's shop!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Wanted: The Darkspawn\par
This dangerous fugitive is believed to be at large in Heliodor.\par
If you see him, alert the authorities immediately.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: With Heliodor's crack troops on the case, those fugitives don't stand a chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? You know, I have the strangest feeling I've seen your face somewhere before...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't sleep at night thinking about those terrifying fugitives who've escaped from the castle. I hope they catch them soon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that those criminals who escaped were being kept in the deepest dungeon in the castle before they broke out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If they were locked up down there, it must mean they were the worst of the worst. Brrr! I just hope I don't run into them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard about the Darkspawn? Apparently, they had him locked up in the dungeons, but he managed to escape.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know much about him, but he's supposed to have this grudge against the world which makes him want to destroy everything. Sounds like a pretty sinister character to me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm sure I've seen your ugly mug somewhere before...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just wish I could remember where it was...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, never mind. I can't let myself be distracted\emdash I need to stay focused on finding the Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If they're sending all these soldiers to catch two fugitives, they must be some seriously scary individuals.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What is all this kerfuffle? Whatever in the world is going on?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not sure what's going on, but all I know is that with Sir Hendrik on our side, we'll be safe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, one of the fugitives is a nasty little thief by the name of Erik. The last I heard, he broke into the royal treasure rooms in search of loot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If he'd known what was good for him, he'd have stayed in his cell and had a good think about what he'd done. But oh no! He had to go and break out, the rotter!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those fugitives might think they're clever, but our men are going to catch up with them! Justice will be done, you mark my words!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The best thing to do is show them the old Heliodorian spirit. Keep calm and carry on, that's what I say!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone's making a fuss about these fugitives, but I'm just going to have a nice, refreshing drink and leave it all to the brave guards of Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It was quite a sight to see Sir Jasper ride by with his troops! He's just so... So dashing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just can't wait for him to catch those awful outlaws and return. Rest assured, I'll be here to cheer him on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Apparently, the two criminals who broke out of the dungeon are stone-cold killers without an emotion between them. I just pray I can stay out of their way...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm too young to die...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew! Ah-phew!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every soldier in town is running around saying some character called the Darkspawn is on the loose. I can't make head nor tail of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I know is they've got me too het up to enjoy my food! Honestly, what is the world coming to?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that the fugitives were trying to find a way to sneak out of town.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I were you, I wouldn't go wandering around\emdash you never know who you might bump into.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A colleague of mine told me that the fugitives were cornered while they were escaping, and ended up jumping off a cliff.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They must have survived though, otherwise they wouldn't have us out looking for them. I hope we find them soon...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wherever you're going, whatever you're doing, don't even think about setting off without perusing my fine wares!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Is this Derk's shop? Well, I'm very flattered, but I'm afraid not. No, his is in a much more exclusive location up by the castle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Is this Derk's shop? Well, I'm very flattered, but I'm afraid not. No, his is in a much more exclusive location up by the castle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've got the Darkspawn on the loose and more and more monsters roaming round the place. Something's seriously wrong with the world...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Darkspawn\rquote ... \lquote Darkspawn\rquote ... Brrr! Just saying the word is enough to send shivers down my spine!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're saying that the Darkspawn is destined to revive some kind of evil spirit. Well, all I know is that I don't want to run into him in a dark alley!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? What's that? What kind of evil spirit? I haven't got the foggiest, I'm afraid. I'm just repeating something a soldier told me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allow me to give you some free financial advice: if you've managed to save some money, you're best off putting it in the bank. No ne'er-do-wells will be able to nobble it there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You're looking for a shop run by someone called Derk? Hmm... I've got a feeling there's someone by that name who lives in a big mansion by the castle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're heading up to that part of town, take my advice and use the rope up on the roof of this house. You'll be there much quicker.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just one word of advice: you'll need to be able to jump to get up there. You can do that by pressing , in case you didn't know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This soldier just told me this was no place for kids, and that I should get home before the Darkspawn catches me. Whatever...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I heard some grown-ups talking. They said the Darkspawn has a grudge against everyone in the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But why? What did we ever do to him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: From what I hear, this Darkspawn fellow can't be a human being. He's clearly some kind of monster!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The other fugitive is some thief by the name of Erik. He's definitely human as far as I know\emdash so what does he think he's doing associating with that...thing!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This Darkspawn bloke is bad news. They say 'e's gonna trigger a calamity that'll end life as we know it. Don't sound too good, does it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mind you, 'owever bad 'e is, 'e can't be as frightenin' as my muvver-in-law!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The guards really slipped up, it seems. The last person you want escaping from the dungeons is someone hell-bent on reviving a terrifying evil spirit.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've never seen Heliodor in such a state of panic and confusion. I really, really hope this will all blow over soon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I wouldn't go near the castle unless you want to be slung in the cells again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, hello. Charmed, I'm sure. You must be Erik. One is lucky enough to be married to the magnificent Derk. He has told us such an awful lot about you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One understands that you are quite the most light-fingered gentleman in all the realm. Fascinating... It's an honour to meet such a...rogue.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So apparently, someone told the authorities they'd spotted someone who looked just like the Darkspawn. That's why everyone's on high alert.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just saw a whole troop of soldiers racing toward the gates. I daresay they must have spotted these escaped prisoners everyone's been talking about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're ever heading to the nicer part of town, take my advice and use the rope up on the roof of this house. You'll be there in no time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell A little bird tells me that 'Endrik an' 'is men took that orb to the Kingsbarrow, an' it's been under lock an' key there ever since.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell Don't envy the poor mugs that little journey. You 'ave to go round by the Manglegrove to get there\emdash an' that place is every bit as nasty as it sounds...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Couldn't've come at a better time, mate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I do a little bit o' tunnel-buildin' on the side, see. An' it just so 'appens that me latest creation is just about finished.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I've only gone an' broken the flintstone I've been usin' to dig wiv. I was so close, an' all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you could sort me out wiv a new one, well...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I might find it in me 'eart to let you be the lucky devil who gets to...test me little passage through the wall, if you know wot I mean. Heh heh. Well? You up for it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Come on, don't be like that! This is a once in a lifetime opportunity, mate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So come on, wot d'you reckon? You gonna take me up on me little offer or not?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! That's the spirit! I knew you'd see sense! After all, you'd be a fool to pass up a chance like this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon if you search round town, you'll turn up a bit o' flintstone in the end. Smash a few pots, see what you can find, innit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First bloke through the wall! Talk about an honour! And that, my friend, could be you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon if you search round town, you'll turn up a bit o' flintstone in the end. Smash a few pots, see what you can find, innit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh ho! Wot've we got 'ere then? Looks like a nice piece o' flintstone to me! So, are you gonna give it 'ere, or wot?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh!? \lquote No\rquote !? Are you kiddin' me!? Don't mess me about, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Much obliged! Now I can finally finish me tunnel! Gimme just a second 'ere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, one last push! Hup! Not far now... Hup! That's it, go on, my son... Hup! I can see light! One more biggun... HUP!!!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I did it! Me masterpiece is finished at last!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's beautiful! Just beautiful! An' I couldn't've done it wivout ya! You little beauty! Heh heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, don't let no one say I ain't a man o' me word\emdash go on, through you go. First dibs is all yours.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Tunnels, eh? Nuffink else quite gives you that magical feelin' o' goin' from one place to anuvver wivout 'avin' to go round. Well, use it as much as you like!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come on, mister! You ain't busy or nuffink! Come an' play 'ide-and-seek wiv us!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wanted to keep playin', but that old night watchman told me to clear off and go 'ome! 'E's stupid! An' really old!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to downtown 'Eliodor, the grimy little secret the posh folks over the wall don't want you to know about! Heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You ain't from round 'ere, eh? Well, if you ain't got a reason to stick around, I wouldn't bovver.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You wot? Yer plannin' on goin' to the Manglegrove? Well, I'd strongly recommend you don't, but if you insist, it's due south of 'ere.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come off it, will you? If you want to play, play with kids your own age!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why would I want to play hide-and-seek? I'm a grown man! Now get out of my hair, will you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it sounds a bit weird, but I gave my house to a bunch of local brats to look after. Well, I didn't need it any more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A house is somewhere to live with a family. It's not a place to rattle round in on your own. The way things turned out, I realised I was better off getting rid of it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ello, love. 'Ave you seen all the nippers playin' 'ide-and-seek round town? It's all the rage wiv the littluns these days. Word is, young Cammo's the sneakiest of the lot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An' the ears on the boy! There ain't a bit o' gossip 'e don't catch. Told me the other day he'd got somefink juicy on the guard down at the gate there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh! You'll never guess what! We only own this 'ouse!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yeah! That bloke over there went an' gave it to us! Pretty generous, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm gonna find you, Cammo! I'm gonna find you if it's the last fing I do! Come out, come out, wherever you aaare!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's 'ard livin' wivout grown-ups to look after us, but it 'appens a lot round 'ere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, at least we got our mates an' a roof over our 'eads. Could be worse, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I couldn't find Cammo anywhere, but never mind that\emdash I found a well juicy mushroom down the dump! I'm gonna eat it for me tea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Mummm... Dad... Found you... Zzz... Where were you...'idin'...?\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24\lang1033 1.04 Manglegrove\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\f2\lang9\cell *: It's your lucky day! I'm a travelling salesman, and to celebrate us running into each other like this, I'm going to offer you some special discounts! Have a look...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, it's you! Thanks again. If it wasn't for you, I'd never have made it over here. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Here, let me give you some of the ingredients you need for those recipes I gave you. Maybe you could try forging yourself a weapon or something...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So you finished your first-ever forging session, huh? Nice. Did everything go according to plan?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Not so good, huh? Well, don't worry too much\emdash it takes a while to get used to. Just keep trying, and you'll get there in the end!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Nice work! You must be a natural! Don't rest on your laurels just yet, though\emdash this is a deep, deep art we're talking about here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Oh, by the way, you can bust out the Fun-Size Forge any time you want\emdash you just have to head to a campsite or dig it out of your bag.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Alright, I think it's time to call it a day. We've been through a lot. Better grab some rest while we can...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Up and at 'em, champ! The sun's high in the sky already\emdash time for us to head to Cobblestone.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sniff sniff)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Is it just me, or do you get the feeling there's something funny going on up ahead? Let's follow that path by the cabin.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Gah! Somebody smashed up the bridge! How are we meant to get across now?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I guess we're just gonna have to find another way. Let's take a look around...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mark on <pc>'s hand is glowing. It seems to be responding to the curiously shaped plant. Hold your hand out to it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, you have returned to the haven of the church. You are always welcome here, my child.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But please do be careful out there\emdash the fugitives remain at large, it seems. Now, let me offer you what succour I can...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Flint\cell Remember that if you're ever at a loss as to where to go next, it's a good idea to seek out one of the World Tree's roots.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Flint\cell Chances are, you'll get some hints on what you need to do.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Flint\cell After all, you're one of the special ones\emdash chosen by Yggdrasil. And by golly, that hair... Life just isn't fair...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hey, we need to watch our step. We're wanted men, remember?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell It's probably a good idea to avoid Heliodor Castle until the heat dies down a little...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hold up, <pc>\emdash the castle will be crawling with guards searching for us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I don't know about you, but I'm in no hurry to get thrown back in the dungeon. We need to give this place a wide berth.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A pair of dangerous criminals have escaped from the castle dungeons, so we're combing the town for them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You look like you're from out of town, so I'll give you some advice\emdash walking round with your faces covered like that is only going to make people suspicious.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you're a visitor to Heliodor, are you? Well, I've got to say, your timing's not great.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We've got dangerous fugitives hiding somewhere in the city. You'd be well advised to come back some other time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You mark my words\emdash Sir Hendrik always gets his man! They don't call him the Hero of Heliodor for nothing\emdash he's basically an all-round legend!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's only a matter of time before he tracks down those fugitives!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. It's just a corpse. But something's been hurriedly scrawled in the dust next to it...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote To the altar... Hurry... The Orb...\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The writing trails off after that. The poor soldier must have run out of strength...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahoy there! We don't get too many visitors round these parts. You've come to see the Kingsbarrow, I'll wager?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hoohoo! Pull the other one, sonny! 'Course you're here to see it! Why else would you drag your hide all the way out here?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, you'll find it off to the west there\emdash can't miss it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aye, I thought as much. No point dragging your hide all the way out here otherwise.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The doors won't budge an inch.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The doors won't budge an inch, and the Keystone seems to have no effect.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A mysterious glowing barrier blocks the way.\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\f1\fs24\lang1033 1.05 Cobblestone (Flashback)\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\f2\lang9\cell It looks like a child has scrawled something on the sign...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote By orders uv the King! <pc> is a verry gud boy an if you see him youve got to giv him lots uv sweeties!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's rare to see travellers here in Cobblestone! I hope you enjoy your stay...though we don't have an inn or anything, I'm afraid...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But what we do have is Amber\emdash she's always very hospitable, and I'm sure she'll be happy to put you up if you ask nicely. She lives over on the east side of the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the fastest filly in the village! But she won't be doing much running for a while\emdash she's about to become a mother!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll bet her foal will be even quicker on its feet than she is!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ooh, just look at you! You must have been on quite the journey\emdash your clothes are filthy! I've a good mind to make you strip off and give them a scrub!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mmm! Get a sniff o' that! There's a lovely smell o' stew waftin' from Amber's window. Ahh, I'd kill for a bowlful!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Reckon if I ask nicely, she might 'ave a little goin' spare. It's worth a try, innit? There's nuffink like a little 'ome-cooked dinner every now an' then!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Cobblestone! Not a lot goes on here, but I hope you enjoy your visit!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You were born here? Har har! Yeah, sure you were! And I'm the King of Heliodor! Har har har!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The big tree in the middle of town is truly a wonder. Come drought or disaster, it just keeps on growing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, I walked past it this morning and the leaves all seemed to be rustling, even though there wasn't a breath of wind! It almost felt like it was trying to tell me something...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Make sure you watch out for young <pc>. He's always up to some mischief or other!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, he played a trick on the poor old woman in the shop and now she's on the warpath!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, they grow up so fast! I just saw young Gemma running past with Sandy. To think\emdash it seems like only yesterday that she was a babe in arms!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sorry, my dad told me not to talk to strangers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh no! I talked to a stranger! My dad's going to be so mad! This is all your fault! Why did you have to go and speak to me!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Stop talking to me! ...Ach! I did it again! I spoke to a stranger!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmph! We were supposed to be playing hide-and-seek, but it looks like Gemma's found something better to do.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll bet she's off somewhere with <pc>. Why does she always want to play with just him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hmm... <pc> is a good boy, and we should give him lots of sweeties, eh? And it's an order from the King, no less...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That <pc> is an absolute menace! Just look at this sign! It's ruined!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (munch gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That cheeky so-and-so! You'll never believe his latest trick\emdash he hid a frog in a jug of water, and when I took the lid off, it jumped out at me! I almost died of shock!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And that's not all! I went and dropped the jug, and now the floor's soaking wet! When I catch that <pc>, I'll have his guts for garters!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? What's that? You're <pc>, you say? Oh, don't be so silly! There's no use you covering for him, you know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? What's that? You're <pc>? Would you cut that nonsense out? You must think I was born yesterday!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mmm! My old mum must be the greatest cook in Cobblestone! What do you say? Fancy trying a little bit of her delicious food?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oops! What am I saying!? There isn't any left to offer you\emdash I've gone and scoffed it all! Wah hah hah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wish that useless son of mine would stop sitting round stuffing his face and go and find himself a wife! I want some grandkids before I cark it! Is that too much to ask?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Eek! What are you doing standing there!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't you know it's bad manners to interrupt a lady at prayer? Honestly, some people!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Well now, we don't get many visitors here. You're very welcome, of course. The name's Dunstan, and it's my very great honour to be mayor of this here village of Cobblestone.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell ...What's that you say? You knew that already? Interesting... Have I bumped into you somewhere before? I'm not normally the forgetful type, but I can't for the life of me think where we might have met.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dunstan\cell Hmm... So we've met somewhere before, have we? I'm not normally the forgetful type, but I can't for the life of me think where...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, my poor Gemma. She puts a brave face on it, but I know how sad it makes her that her old mum's too frail to leave the house. Ahh, I've put her through so much...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, at least she has <pc>, eh? Playing with him always puts the smile back on her face. What would we do without him, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dearie me! I am sorry! I shouldn't be burdening you with all my worries! You're just visiting, after all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wouldn't normally be so forthcoming, but there's something strangely familiar about you. I wonder what it could be...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Where can he be? He told me he had something important to tell me, and now he's nowhere to be seen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Please, Father! Pray for me! I have to do this! I have to strike while the iron's hot! She's not going to wait forever! I have to pop the question!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Have faith, my child. The Spirit of the Land is watching over you. Gather your courage and do what you have to do. You are meant to be together.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, hello there! I'm a little bit busy at the moment. And by the looks of things, I will be for a little while yet...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come now, my child. Gather your courage and do what you must do! Have faith in the power that watches over you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're travelling alone, are you? Ahh, that's the best way to see the world! You never know what you're going to discover, or what new friends you're going to meet!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, I never expected to find love on the open road, but then I went and met my wife-to-be, and the rest is history! Ho ho!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just visiting Cobblestone, are you? You know, it's strange\emdash I could swear I've met you somewhere before...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (snort) Neeeigh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A curious power emanates from the root wrapped around the tree...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I could have sworn that was Amber I heard screaming. I hope nothing untoward's going on...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are you alright? You look a little pale.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just 'eard a blood-curdlin' shriek! I 'ope nuffink funny's goin' on...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S-Something terrible's happening! I just heard a woman screaming! Someone has to help her, whoever she is!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Amber\cell\par
You again! Look, I warned you! I want you out of my house this instant! Don't make me tell you again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: (sniff) M-My headscarf! I'll never get it back... (sob)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
