\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sandy\cell Woof! Woof woof!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wanted to show off in front o' me girl, but it didn't 'alf backfire! I thought it'd be easy enough\emdash just beat ol' Chalky in a fishin' contest and watch 'er swoon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Turns out the sly old devil knows wot 'e's doin'. 'E just kept reelin' 'em in, non-stop! Made me look like a proper numpty, I tell ya!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Keep following this path and you'll reach Cobblestone Tor. It's where the Spirit of the Land lives, or so they say.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's very special to us, but I expect to an outsider it probably just looks like a big old lump of rock, doesn't it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Neigh! Neeeigh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
