\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc>'s old bed still looks comfortable enough. Lie down for a rest?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
