\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a travelling priest. I heard a terrible rumour that this village was to be razed to the ground, and rushed from Heliodor to try to reason with the troops. Alas, it seems I was too late...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: King Carnelian ordered that the entire place be destroyed for its role in raising the accursed Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But did the people of Cobblestone really deserve this? Seeing such terrible devastation, one wonders who the real sinners are...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At least the troops did not destroy the church. That is something. And inside, you will find a bed where a traveller may yet rest his weary bones.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, though things may look bleak, one may still find comfort in the age-old rituals...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fortunately, the Heliodorian forces did not destroy the church. That is something at least. And inside, you will find a bed where a traveller may yet rest his weary bones.\par
