\pard\intbl\cell *: What's that, now? You're looking for the Door of Departure, you say? Well, I couldn't be certain, but there's an old building out east of here with a big set of doors on it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you've a mind to go traipsing out to far-flung ruins, you could do worse than go and take a look. You never know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
