\pard\intbl\cell *: Then I am afraid I cannot allow you to pass. You must seek an audience with His Excellency and request that he grant you free passage.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
