\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Once you have passed through the cave, you will arrive in the Laguna di Gondolia. The road will then lead you to Gondolia itself\f2\emdash\f1 the world's greatest trading port!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Laguna di Gondolia boasts lush vegetation\f2\emdash\f1 and lots of rain. You must remain vigilant, for the wet weather brings out strange and dangerous beasts...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! You're going to Gondolia? Lucky you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Laguna di Gondolia is totally different to the desert. Everything's green and leafy, and it rains all the time. You're in for a pleasant surprise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Did I see a merchant come this way with some kind of colourful branch? As a matter of fact I did. He was heading for Gondolia, no doubt about it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The merchant with the colourful branch passed through here a while ago. He was heading for Gondolia, no doubt about it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Now listen, honey, Gondolia's a long, long way away. You'd better take this, otherwise you'll be trudging through the desert for days!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives a horse hailer!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Just give that a tinkle, and a horse will come a-galloping, no matter where you happen to be! Well, unless you're inside a town or a dungeon... Still, it's going to save you a LOT of time, I promise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell The Ringmaster gave it to me to make sure I never missed a show, but your need is greater than mine right now, so it's all yours!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Alright! Now that's settled, let's make our way to Gondolia, shall we? Our vessel awaits!\cell\row 
