\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The fountain is full of crystal-clear water.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Prego, prego! You want the pretty cat suit, s\'ec? Is very cheap!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah! You are interested? Bene. One cat suit, ten thousand gold coins. We have the deal, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh!? You are no interested!? Then you no waste my time! Arrivederci! But you regret this, I promise...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uffa! Is a joke, s\'ec!? You no have enough money! Arrivederci!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bene, bene! Here is your cat suit. You no regret this, signore!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the cat suit!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Allora! Is great style for you. But you look even more bellissimo if you also buy the cat hat from the armour shop! Prego, prego!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bene, bene! Here is your cat su\f2\emdash\f1  Uffa! Signore, what you are thinking!? You are on the Draconian Quest! You can no buy the items!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...This mean I must give to you for free! I rather do that than make everyone think I fail as a merchant!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Prego, prego! You want the pretty cat suit, s\'ec? Is very cheap!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Eh!? My brother, he offer you the cat suit for 9800 gold coins!? Ahim\'e8, he is too generous... Troppo generoso!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, then I make the special deal for you. One cat suit, only 9000 gold coins! You want, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Aha ha! I am the much better salesman than my brother, no? One cat suit for you. Prego, prego!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Che spavento! Is a big shock! My brother, he sell the cat suit for only 8000 gold coins!? Uffa... Who he think he is, eh!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora! I make you the very special deal. I sell to you for half price. 4000 gold coins. You must accept this offer, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Santo cielo! Goodness gracious! He sell for two thousand gold coins!? Then I sell for...one thousand! One thousand gold coins, only for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I no go lower than this, signore! You take this incredible offer, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Prego, prego! My shop is an house of many bargains! Much cheaper than the shop of my brother!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia! Welcome to our town! Here you can buy the famous products from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You want to visit the dock? Is in the west part of the city. Maybe is better to check a map, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a seller of weapons from all over the whole world! Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You take the sea journey? Ahim\'e8, the ocean, is a dangerous place. You must buy the armour from my shop, s\'ec? Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm glad I managed to get away from Heliodor for a bit. That whole Darkspawn escaping thing has sent the place into a right old panic.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which is great for weapon sales, of course. I'm going to snap up a few bargains here and take them back home. Should be able to turn a tidy profit.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You are the visitatore, no? A guest in our town? You take the ride in the gondola yet? Is our most popular tourist attraction!<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No!? Then you must! You can board under the stairs. Once you are in the boat, you can use the canal to go to anywhere in the city!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The streets of Gondolia, they are molto complicato. Very complicated indeed. The canal, is the fastest and easiest way for travelling around!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have? Bene, bene! Ahh, to glide upon the peaceful waters... Is bellissimo, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door won't budge. It must be locked from the inside.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My friend, he is the best merchant in Gondolia. Always he buy the treasures of Gallopolis and sell them here for an huge profit!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Where is he now? Scusa, I no have any idea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is almost time for la competizione! The great Signor Universo competition! Is why there are the many muscoloso men here in Gondolia now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see the stage in the north of the city, s\'ec? Is where the contest happens. Is a spectacle molto splendido!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've come to Gondolia at the right time\f2\emdash\f1 the Signor Universo contest will be starting soon. Be sure to check out all the stalls on the main street. They're a real treat!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, il mare... The sea... So many mysteries. For example, what are the columns of light we sometimes see on its surface, hm?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Le leggende\f2\emdash\f1 the legends\f2\emdash\f1 they say is the power of the god of the sea, bursting from below the waves... Could this be true...? Hmm... (mutter)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, scusa. My shop, is no ready for business yet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When Signor Universo starts, I make the grand opening. Come back at that time, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Povero me... I am so pitiful... The work of the sailor, is much harder than they tell me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I take this work so I can send money to mia madre\f2\emdash\f1 my mother\f2\emdash\f1 back in the village. Ahh, but is such an hard job...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, the cold drink after an hard day of work is the best! Bellissimo! This pleasure, is worth all the pain!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Presto, presto! If you no work faster, we no finish before the night-time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Hm? You talk to me? Scusa, I have no work for you. Already I have enough people.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fresh fish and fine wine after an hard day of work\f2\emdash\f1 is the best! La dolce vita!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My ship, always she bring the barrels of wine into Gondolia. You must taste\f2\emdash\f1 is delizioso!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I worry for Placido, the son of Doge Rotondo. He look like he is sick. I must make him the food that is molto nutriente...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Each year, I think I must make the stall for la competizione, Signor Universo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But is already so, so many stalls. Without the very special idea, the competizione is too much...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora! You see the rope between the roofs, s\'ec? One year, little Benigno, he walk the whole way along! Is incredibile, no!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but Benigno, he no do things like that any more. Maybe he become the adulto at last...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No... Do not come near... You will destroy me! You will destroy us all! Begone with you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sound of the waves reminds me... A story I heard when I was a boy...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An underwater kingdom, ruled by sea creatures... Deep beneath the waves... One day... One day I shall venture there...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That man, they say he come from Zwaardsrust. But that city, is totally destroyed now. He no have an home to return to.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? The location of Zwaardsrust? Is north-east of here, across the ocean. But is only the pile of rubble now, I heard.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The story of Zwaardsrust is molto tragico. In the past, is a wealthy and prosperous kingdom. Then is attacked by monsters, and...poof! Finito.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The rumours, they say is the work of the Darkspawn. But is very old story now. No one remember this time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prego, prego! You want a beautiful cat suit, s\'ec? I have the most beautiful cat suits in all of Gondolia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, I sell you one for 12000 gold coins. Is the bargain! You buy one, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahim\'e8, is a shame. But maybe you come back again, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie mille! Here you\f2\emdash\f1  Un minuto, signore! You are on the Draconian Quest, s\'ec? Then you can no buy any items!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But if you leave with the empty hands, everyone think I am the terrible merchant. Allora, I must give to you for free! Take it, per favore! Prego, prego!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Peccato... Is a pity, but you no have enough money! Come back after you go to the banca, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie mille! Here you are, signore!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the cat suit!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Allora! Is great style for you. But you look even more bellissimo if you also buy the cat hat from the armour shop! Prego, prego!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prego, prego! You want a beautiful cat suit, s\'ec? I have the most beautiful cat suits in all of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, I sell you one for 12000 gold coins. Is the bargain! You buy one, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Eh!? My brother, he offer the same cat suit for 10000 gold coins!? Uffa... Always he do this to me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: But he no beat me this time! Bene! I sell to you for 9800 gold coins! Is too good to refuse, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Grazie mille! Here you are, signore!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prego, prego! You want the beautiful cat suit, s\'ec? I have the most beautiful cat suits in all of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Che spavento! Such a shock! My brother, he offer you the same cat suit for 9000 gold coins!? Is ridicolo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Allora, then I give you the special price...8000 gold coins! What you say? You buy, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: My brother, he offer you for 4000 gold coins!? Santo cielo...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Bene! He no beat me this time! I sell you the cat suit for 2000 gold coins! You take it, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Mamma mia! He offer you for 1000 gold coins!? Per carit\'e0...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Scusa, I can go no lower than 2000. But perhaps...you buy from me anyway?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: One day, signore. One day, I beat my brother! Is a promise!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I make the shoes here in Gondolia for many, many years. And is all thanks to Doge Rotondo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He understand the world of business. Is the reason why he become so wealthy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Because of him, Gondolia is the best place in the world to be the merchant. Always I think, \lquote Grazie Mille, Doge Rotondo\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuto! Come, try the best cakes of Gondolia, all freshly baked!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sponge is so light, the cream is so creamy... Is simply delizioso! You must try!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are here to buy the cakes? Scusa, but is closed now. Come back tomorrow, per favore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're travellers too, are you? And you don't have a ship of your own? That can't be easy... Then again, speed isn't everything, I suppose.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm always on the move on account of my husband's job. It'd be nice to take things a little more slowly from time to time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I should never have promised my daughter a ride on the gondola. Now she refuses to go to sleep...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I tried to speak to a local boy on the bridge earlier, but he didn't say a single word in return. He must be ever so shy...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I really, REALLY, want to ride the gondola again! The way they move, it's like swimming\f2\emdash\f1 without being in the water! Hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is strange. The boat from Heliodor, she should be here now. But we have no sign of her.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If is too late, we cannot load the cargo in time. Allora, I consult with Doge Rotondo. Always he know what to do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The boat from Heliodor, she no come today. I hope she is no attacked by the monsters...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now we no have time to load the cargo. Allora, I consult with Doge Rotondo. Always he know what to do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: .........\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What you look at!? If you no want something, go away!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A little while ago, I see a merchant, he is carrying a stick with all the colours of the rainbow. Molto colorato!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Where he go? Ah, scusa. I did not see. But I hear that he take the ship, so I think he go somewhere far away, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mamma and pap\'e0, they are killed by the monsters when I am just a little bambino. People say is fault of the Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So if I see the Darkspawn here in Gondolia, I capture him and I make him say to me the truth! Always I am vigilante for him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My name is Hercules! I am the greatest! My muscles, they feel is time for the Signor Universo! I win this year also! Is garantita!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell Liu Za, he is the only one who come close to me\f2\emdash\f1 close, but no sigaro! I wish I have more rivals. Is making la competizione more fun!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Buongiorno! Salute! My name is Sartori, and I am the organiser of Signor Universo. In this moment, I make the final adjustments to the schedule.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell This year's competizione, is biggest ever. Molto grande! Is all because of the hard work of Doge Rotondo. He is an hero of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Santo cielo! Is already time for Signor Universo!? I feel is only yesterday when Hercules win last year's competizione!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Which one is Hercules? He is the one who look like the sailor, with the big muscles and a scarf on his head.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My son, Benigno, he do nothing to help prepare for la competizione. Is important event here in Gondolia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Per carit\'e0! For heaven's sakes! He play with the boy Placido again, is certain!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I try to teach him how to be a man of the sea, but always he run away. He never listen...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, Luciano. He sing so beautifully. His song soothe my heart. Is like riding the gentle waves...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But Luciano, he is no the only contestant who steal my heart. Hercules is so big and strong\f2\emdash\f1 molto fortissimo! I cannot decide who to cheer for!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! But I think you know nothing of the Signor Universo. I am correct, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Signor Universo is a competizione where men from the whole wide world come together to see who is the best one! Is so much fun! You really enjoy, I promise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then you are here to take part, perhaps? Mmm... S\'ec! I think maybe you have a chance! If you enter, I support!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I think you know nothing of the Signor Universo. I am correct, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Signor Universo is a competizione where men from the whole wide world come together to see who is the best one! Is so much fun! You really enjoy, I promise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then you are here to take part, perhaps? Mmm... S\'ec! I think maybe you have a chance! If you enter, I support!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (cough cough) Uffa... Salute. I am Luciano. I am the singer, but my throat, is no so good today.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell But I hear about this birdsong nectar. They say is the best for soothing the sore throat.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I loshe my job, sh\'ec? And you know who ish to blame? Ish the Darkshpawn! Piccolo Diavolo! Devil!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If he no eshcape from Heliodor, the monstersh no come, and I no loshe my job! Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The secret of the fishing? Is all about pazienza. Always pazienza. You need only to wait.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody, they are always in an hurry, but me, I wait for my big catch. Is coming, I know is coming...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come out now! I cannot find you! Is my turn to hide!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come out now... (snore) Is my turn... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Shhh! Silenzio, per favore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you make the noise, my sister, she find me! So you no talk to me, capisce?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You no find me... (snort) Never you find me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Povero me... I am so pitiful... My Benigno, never he do anything to help me! I wish he is like Placido, the son of Doge Rotondo...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh! I no see you there. Scusa, you must ignore me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuto! This is the first time for you here in Gondolia, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Scusa, Maybe I forget your face... Allora, stay for the drink, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, then I give you an history of the city. Now Gondolia is the biggest trading port in the whole world, but in the past, is just a little fishing village.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo is the reason things have changed so much. He make the trading agreements with all the different kingdoms, and Gondolia, she go \lquote boom\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If there is no Doge Rotondo, I cannot make the living with my bar. I owe him everything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie mille for choosing my shop! I get bored if I have no customers. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You are an holidaymaker, s\'ec? Bene! I have the cakes for all tastes! Local favourites and treats from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is okay to look at the cakes for as long as you like, but you no eat, capisce? No unless you pay first!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You are an holidaymaker, s\'ec? Scusa, but my shop is closed now. Come back tomorrow morning, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prego! Here is the home of the best cakes in all of Gondolia! Molto delizioso! No one can resist!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, maybe you look for the item shop instead? Allora, is downstairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes, I hear people talk about something called \lquote birdsong nectar\rquote . They say is best thing for the sore throat. Maybe I can use as an ingrediente, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mm? You want the item shop? Is downstairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Interested in a pair of wandering wizards for hire? Look no further! We've just completed our last assignment\f2\emdash\f1 guard duty for a local merchant.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We had been meaning to move on to the next place, actually, but the cakes and drinks here are so tasty, we've decided to stick around for a while.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Interested in a pair of wandering wizards for hire? Look no further! We've just completed our last assignment\f2\emdash\f1 guard duty for a local merchant.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We had been meaning to move on to the next place, actually, but the cakes and drinks here are so tasty, we've decided to stick around for a while.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Say, you've heard of the Darkspawn, haven't you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Really? Everybody's talking about him, you know. I suppose I'd better fill you in. It all started when a kingdom called Dundrasil was destroyed. It was the Darkspawn who did it, you see.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not surprised\f2\emdash\f1 everybody's been talking about him. About how he turned up in Heliodor, but then managed to escape...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, the King of Heliodor's sent both Sir Hendrik and Sir Jasper after him. They're his top knights\f2\emdash\f1 that must mean this Darkspawn's a pretty fearsome character...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You hear about the tentacular who cause so much havoc around the harbour, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Ahim\'e8, is terrible! My husband, he tell me all about him. Is a giant monster who attack our ships!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And my husband, he say is becoming more and more vicious\f2\emdash\f1 molto vizioso! If you go out onto the ocean, be careful, s\'ec?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec? Ah, naturalmente. You are the traveller. Of course you know of the dangerous creatures of the sea. And recently, they become more dangerous, no? Molto pericoloso...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband, he is a sailor. He travel all over Erdrea, so he often tell me about what happen in the faraway kingdoms.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yesterday, he tell me about a prisoner who escape from Heliodor. He say Sir Hendrik is looking for him. This prisoner, he must be very dangerous\f2\emdash\f1 molto pericoloso!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Look, it's only right that an artist of your stature is surrounded by the very finest finery. It's good for your image.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, why don't you have a look at this incredible crystal? It was found in some ruins near Phnom Nonh. Isn't she a beauty?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't have much luck with my sales today. Still, I am supposed to be on holiday. I'll give it another go tomorrow. No rush.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You flatter, but is far too expensive for me. I am the poor artist!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Also, I no like crystals and jewellery. I like the plants, animals...living things, capisce?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ey! Why you come in here in the night! Is my private workshop!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Ah, but is okay. I no mind. I have the painter's block. Maybe you can be my ispirazione, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The paintings of my master\f2\emdash\f1 once, they sell like the hot cakes. But now...niente. Nothing. Perhaps his career is finito...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The paintings of my master\f2\emdash\f1 once, they sell like the hot cakes. But now...niente. Nothing. Perhaps his career is finito...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Placido is the very good boy\f2\emdash\f1 kind and polite. Doge Rotondo, he must be very proud.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He follow his father and become the successful merchant one day, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Molto grande, molto magnifico... There is an huge ship in the dock, and they say is the property of \lquote the Great Sylvando\rquote , the circus performer.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I believe them. The big, shiny superstar, he need the big, shiny ship, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You ask where is the dock? Is the big building over there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The enormous ship in the dock is the property of Sylvando, the one they call the Wandering Wonder.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is no many people in Erdrea can buy this kind of ship. For me, is impossible. Povero me, I feel the envy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa. The dock is closed. Signor Universo will begin soon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe Doge Rotondo, he can open the dock for you. You speak to him, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He have an house\f2\emdash\f1 a big house\f2\emdash\f1 to the east of the main street. Check a map if you no find, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You look for your friends? They are upstairs. Is first time for them in the big city, no? Aha ha. S\'ec, they shop like the tourists...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps you think Signor Universo is silly contest for the men with muscles for brains? No, no, no! Is actually the molto importante part of the history of Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, Gondolia is the busy port, s\'ec? Is gathering place for the young men for centuries.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And Signor Universo is an humble attempt to keep this tradition alive.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Friend\f2\emdash\f1 you see this tall man? This one standing over there? He is the Great Sylvando, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No!? Then I make the mistake. But he have the aura of the grande talento!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec! Naturalmente! He is the only one who have the glamour to be the owner of that ship!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia! Welcome to our town! Here you can buy the famous products from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? The house of the Doge? Is the grande palazzo in the east of the city. Maybe is better to check a map, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In this moment, I try to think of the food to make little Placido feel better. Doge Rotondo, he worry so much about his boy, but never he tells me what food he likes. Hmm...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Where is the house of the Doge? Is easy to find\f2\emdash\f1 is direct in front of you after you cross over the bridge.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell\par
It's so frustrating! I tried to buy some new shoes, but all the ones I liked were far too big for me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell And all the children's ones are ridiculous! What's wrong with these stupid people?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Look, <pc>! Don't those cakes look delicious! We don't have anything like that back home!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell\par
They look just like little clouds...but I wonder how they taste... They'd probably be too sweet for me, wouldn't they? Yes, I'll leave it for now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Today, I have this little girl in the shop, but she only try the adult shoes! Poor little thing... All children, they want to be grown up, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Benvenuto! Come and try the best cakes in Gondolia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh, signora! I give you the free sample, s\'ec? Is molto delizioso, I promise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
And you say anyone can enter? Oh, honey, tell me more...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
<pc>, darling\f2\emdash\f1 perfect timing! Have I got some juicy news for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell It turns out that anyone can enter this Signor Universo contest, as long as they love the sea! Can you believe it? Where do I sign up?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
It turns out that anyone can enter this Signor Universo contest, as long as they love the sea! Can you believe it? Where do I sign up?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He say he have the interest in Signor Universo. Bene! I hope is true. He make the good rival for me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell ...Doge Rotondo? He is at home, I am sure. Is on the side of the canal. Just cross the bridge, and is in front of you. Molto facile\f2\emdash\f1 easy-peasy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell The Doge, he is molto gentile. Very kind. He give you the warm welcome, is certain.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell ...! ......!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell He seems to be trying to say something, but no words are coming out...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I steal your staff. Scusa, is bad, I know... But Placido, he is like my brother! I have to help him! I have to get his voice back!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell The cave I hear about, is west of the city. They say there is the special, pure water, and you can use this water to make the birdsong nectar.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell This nectar, is the only hope for Placido! Per favore, you must bring some for him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps Doge Rotondo, he can open the dock for you. You speak to him, s\'ec? He have an house\f2\emdash\f1 a big house\f2\emdash\f1 to the east of the main street.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh!? Doge Rotondo, he refuse to help you!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Incredibile... No, you make the mistake. The Doge is molto gentile. Very kind indeed. I think perhaps he is just very busy because of la competizione...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The Doge, he is very busy because of la competizione, I think. Perhaps you wait until is finished, then he help you, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? What you say? Clean water? Cave?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: West of the city, eh? Hmm... I live in Gondolia since I was the bambino, but never I hear about such a cave...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benigno, he run away from the little bambina in the red clothes. He make the mischief again, I think.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It remind me of the time he walk across the rope on the roof. Uffa, my heart, it almost explode!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see a little girl chase a little boy. They go to the lighthouse. Is nice to see the children play, no? Always I smile when I see it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec, when I was the age of them, I play the same way! Aha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia! Welcome to our town! Here you can buy the famous products from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but per favore, be careful if you travel to the west. This merchant, he nearly die in a cave over there...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uffa! You must listen! I am lucky to be alive! Allora, I go to the Grotta della Fonte, a cave to the west, to find the clean water...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But the Grotta is full with monsters! I am the merchant, no the warrior, so I turn and run back to the city! Mamma mia...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You need the special water to make the birdsong nectar?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, I no hear about special water. But if you need the special signora, is me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo, he refuse to allow the visitatori into his house. I cannot understand why.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think they say something rude to him. Is the only explanation. The Doge, he is molto gentile! He never refuse to help!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh, you know, you look familiar. I think I hear about someone, he look like you... Uffa, I cannot remember where...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Eh, you know, you look familiar. I think I hear about someone, he look like you... Uffa, I cannot remember where...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The little girl, first she look at the adult shoes in my shop, and now she chase the little boy around. Is some kind of game, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is so nice to see the children live an happy life.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuto! Come and try the best cake in all Gondolia! Is popular with the tourists from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sponge is so light, the cream is so creamy... Is simply delizioso! You must try!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Where's that quiet boy gone? I really wanted to play with him...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your friend with the stripy costume, he ask me about Signor Universo. He have the real aura around him, no? Much more than most men. But not more than me, naturalmente. Not more than Hercules!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell La competizione will prove this\f2\emdash\f1 I am the most manly of them all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell Ah! You meet with Doge Rotondo, s\'ec? He is such an humble, helpful man!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell ...What!? He refuse to help you, and he tell you to leave!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell Ahim\'e8... I never hear such things about the Doge before... Maybe you say something rude to him?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell\par
Doge Rotondo, he is kind and tolerant. Molto gentile. I no believe he refuse to help you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait! The gondolas, they all are booked up for the entirety of la competizione! Scusa, scusa!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia! Welcome to our town! Here you can buy the famous products from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And in this moment, the city, it is even more lively than usual. Is time for Signor Universo at last!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh!? You return from the Grotta della Fonte? And you are unharmed? You are tougher than you look, s\'ec? Aha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is simple: if you wish to win la competizione, you must buy your weapons from me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you seek the armour, you are in the right place! Everybody know, this is the best armour shop in Gondolia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This contest thing does sound like a lot of fun\f2\emdash\f1 and it's a good time to be away from Heliodor too, what with the Darkspawn on the loose and all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You wish for the ride in the gondola?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bene. Is no possibile in this moment, anyway. You must wait for la competizione to finish.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, is no possible in this moment. You must wait for la competizione to finish.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Contests and tournaments please me... They bring back memories... Memories of childhood...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You wish to pass? Scusa, but is impossibile. They prepare for la competizione now. Maybe you find the different path?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahim\'e8... All the people, they gather on the main street! Is no one around here! How I can attract more customers, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is time for the ship from Heliodor to arrive, but no! Is no sign! And now is time for la competizione...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Why I choose this place for my stall? Is obvious, no? I draw the short straw when we pick the locations!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is too quiet around here. Uffa, I wish I had the stall on the main street...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell\par
I'm sure Placido was around here when we left him. Where has he run off to?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Well, I'd better go and look for him. It can't be easy, not being able to speak. I'm so looking forward to hearing the sound of his little voice!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell\par
You find us a nice spot for the contest, <pc>. We'll catch up with you later and we can all watch it together!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa. The dock, it is closed. Signor Universo will begin soon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Usually Doge Rotondo, he open the dock for you, but he is very busy in this moment preparing for la competizione.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why you no sit and enjoy the show while you wait? Is good, I promise! Molto interessante!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You look for the two young boys? Allora, the young girl with the blonde hairs is over there, but I no see any boys. Scusa.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you should stop looking for the children and enjoy la competizione instead! Everybody, already they gather in the piazza!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Most times, this area is full of the people, but today everybody is in the piazza. They wait for the start of la competizione.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh, is okay. Sometimes is nice to have no customers. Maybe I sleep a little...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
Placidooo! Honey, where did you go? It's okay, there's nothing to be scared of\f2\emdash\f1 it's me, Sylv!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
Don't worry, darling. We'll find Placido and give him a gulp or two of birdsong nectar.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You and Erik head over to the piazza and get us a good spot for the show!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell\par
Don't worry, darling. We'll find Placido and give him a gulp or two of birdsong nectar.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You and Erik head over to the piazza and get us a good spot for the show!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The men, each year they come from all over the whole world to enter Signor Universo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This year, is a lot of talk about Liu Za, from Octagonia. He sounds molto interessante, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The whole of Gondolia, they help to prepare for Signor Universo\f2\emdash\f1 even me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Today is the day we forget about the Darkspawn, no? He no show himself here in front of so many people, surely?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Santo cielo! Is nearly time for Signor Universo, and I cannot find Benigno anywhere! I say to him I want an helping hand, but then he disappear!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahem... Scusa. You no need to listen to my complaints...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are the new face for me. Is your first Signor Universo contest, s\'ec?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Scusa, scusa... Well, I hope we have another good one this year, eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aha ha! Then you have the grande curiosit\'e0 about what happen, no? Ahim\'e8, is difficult for me to explain. Is better if you watch it and find out for yourself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is my first Signor Universo contest. I no enter, but still I feel molto nervoso. Is why I hide away inside here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But the more I hide away, the more nervoso I become. Maybe I cannot even bring myself to go to the piazza...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Shignor Universho ish the besht contesht in the whole world! Hic!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know why? Hic! Ish becaushe everybody in Gondolia have an holiday! Aha ha! Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gondolia is filled with the people because of la competizione, but no people come in my shop. Povero me\f2\emdash\f1 poor me. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our cakes, they are popular with visitatori from all over the whole world. Always we are very busy during Signor Universo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is why I cannot take part in la competizione. I must make cakes the whole day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Today we have the customer with the very, very long tongue. He buy every cake in the shop! Who he is, I wonder...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We weren't planning on staying around here for so long\f2\emdash\f1 we are supposed to be wandering wizards, after all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But when we heard about this Signor Universo thing, we thought we'd stick around for a while to see what it's all about.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh! What you want, hm!? Now I am thinking of the new ideas for paintings. You no disturb me in this moment!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wish to be out in the piazza with the other people, but my maid, she no allow it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, my master, he no receive any the guests until he make a new painting! Already he spend all his family fortune.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If he no sell the new paintings, I no receive my salary. Is why I must force him to work!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All the commozioni outside... Is time for Signor Universo again, no? I wonder how many years we have held la competizione now...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec, I remember the day when Doge Rotondo, he propose la competizione for the first time. It feels like only yesterday!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Haven't you got us a spot for the contest yet? Well, you'd better get moving, otherwise all the good ones will be gone!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell ...What? You don't know where the contest is being held? Well, I'd say the big stage in the middle of the city square would be a pretty safe bet, wouldn't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell\par
I'd say it's a safe bet that the contest is being held on the big stage in the square to the north of here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell\par
I can't say I've got any idea where Placido's got to, though...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I do hope we find him soon. Imagine how awful it would be, not being able to speak!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is a mystery... Un grande mistero... Why so many people are here? Why so many stalls?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? You say is because of Signor Universo? Is first time I hear of this event. Is rare for the scholar like me. Usually, I know of everything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: But still, un grande mistero remains\f2\emdash\f1 Signor Universo, why he bring so many people and stalls here, hm?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa, scusa! I need just a little more time to prepare my shop! I will open before la competizione begins, I promise it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuto! Is my first time to have the stall, so I prepare many, many bargains to beat the competition!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And the numero uno bargain...is me! S\'ec, I sell myself! Is unique item, no? You buy?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? You are sure? I give you a good price for this healthy and handsome specimen! Ah ha ha!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah ha ha! Scusa, scusa. Is only the joke! The famous Gondolian humour, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is always many, many stalls here during Signor Universo. Always.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But this year, I think is even more than usually! Perhaps is because la competizione become more and more famous around the whole world!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So many people everywhere... Is big surprise for you, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec, the first time visitors, always they have the shock when they see the crowds for la competizione. Allora, I hope you have fun!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot decide who to support. The champion of last year, Hercules, or Luciano with the beautiful voice.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Prego, prego! I have the special Signor Universo products! You like this wooden box, s\'ec? Is limited edition!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Put it on your ship, and you are safe from every storm! Is guaranteed!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This street is my walking route! Now is full of stalls, I cannot go through!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Shlurrrp! Thish plashe ish full of tashty food! (slobber) I want to eat everything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The contest's starting any moment, but this guy can't stop thinking about food. Why did I even bring him along?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bah, guess it doesn't make much difference\f2\emdash\f1 these locals don't look like much. One of us is gonna win this easy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a huge fan of the Signor Universo contest. I live miles away, but I chartered a boat to bring me here specially.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I don't suppose you're taking part, are you? You certainly look like you have what it takes! I'll be rooting for you if you are!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are Signor Universo!?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uffa... Is shame. Now is many men from all over the whole world here in Gondolia\f2\emdash\f1 and one of them is Signor Universo! I wish to meet him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec!? Mamma mia! Then you must go onto the stage! Presto! I cheer for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is nearly the time for la competizione! So many big, strong men on the stage! I cannot wait!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah ha ha! My muscles, they grow every time I hear the crowd shout the name \lquote Hercules\rquote ! I cannot wait to climb onto the stage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell In this moment, you have the special preview of the winner of this year's contest, up close and personal! You are lucky!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is almost the time for Signor Universo to begin! Is so exciting, I want to do an happy dance! Hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahim\'e8, but I cannot decide who to support. I love the voice of Luciano, but also I love the muscles of Hercules...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell Is time for la competizione to begin. I no know if I have the chance to win, but I try my best.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door is locked from the inside.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A voice can be heard coming from within. Whoever's in there sounds frightened, and seems to be hiding from the Darkspawn...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: W-Wait! You cannot pass! Is my duty to defend Gondolia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Jump down?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> jumps down from the bridge!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Uh-uh-uhhh, I don't think sooo! Everyone loves a hero, darling, but if we charge in head first this time, we're finished.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Let's take a gondola round to the north-west, then we can sneak up to the stage from behind.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Y-You are the D-D-Darkspawn! Santo cielo... Always I know you are no normal!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Per amor del cielo\f2\emdash\f1 in the name of all that is good in this world\f2\emdash\f1 do no kill me! P-P-Per favore...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Per amor del cielo\f2\emdash\f1 in the name of all that is good in this world\f2\emdash\f1 do no kill me! P-P-Per favore...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: D-Darkspawn! You kill my mamma and pap\'e0, but you kill no more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is my duty to defend this city! I no let you pass!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Signor Darkspawn! S\'ec, s\'ec, I s-s-sell you the weapons! Per favore, do no kill me! Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia. Is bad time for us here now. The Darkspawn, he appear just before Signor Universo begin.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Probably he still hide somewhere in the city. You must leave, presto!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper, he give us the description of the Darkspawn. Is no so different from you, you know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if you are the Darkspawn, then you no stroll around the city in this free and easy manner, s\'ec? Of course not! Aha ha!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I sell you everything! Il tutto! Per favore, do no hurt me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You no fool me with the innocent face, Darkspawn! Never I let you ride my gondola! Never!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In this moment, I focus on my study, but still I notice the atmosphere is strange...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even I see someone use an high rope to escape from the building... What is happening, hm?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no understand... Why everybody run away? Why they no close up their stall first?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Naturalmente, I will not go anywhere. Is always better to keep the calm and carry on, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Open the door! Is me! Is no the Darkspawn! Per favore, let me in!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hm hm hm... Of course! The gondola! If the Darkspawn attack me, I escape on the canal!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: AIEEE! D-D-D-Darkspawn! P-Per favore, do no kill me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You take the gondola? S\'ec, per favore! I-Is yours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You sure is okay for you to be here, friend? Sir Jasper, he search for the Darkspawn near the stage in the piazza. Is the very tense atmosphere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Why I no run away? Allora, I never run. Always is better to wait. Is the lesson of fishing and of life!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Naturalmente, you must also be vigilant. Just because I wait, this does not mean I sleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hnghhh... Darkshpawn... (snort) Hm? Hic! Who are you...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Aieee! D-D-Darkshpawn! I, I no let you passh! No, no, no!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I no let you passh, Darkshpawn! No, no, no!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Scusa... I no have the problem with you, but...the customers, is scary for them. Please, you must leave...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Help! HELP! Salvami! I no want to die!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: P-Per favore, I let you go. I no say nothing. Just...do no hurt me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You may be the Darkspawn, but we are all equal in the eyes of the heavens. If you wish to pray, prego...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eek! Th-The Darkspawn! Well now I've completely lost my appetite...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The eyes of heaven have witnessed your foul deeds, Darkspawn! You must be punished! Turn yourself in!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The eyes of heaven have witnessed your foul deeds, Darkspawn! You must be punished! Turn yourself in!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody, they run around, desperate to find somewhere to hide...and still no one come in my shop! Is ridicolo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no care if you are the Darkspawn, you are the only customer I have today. Any business is good business! Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You wish to sleep here? Now? ...Bene. Is important to help people who are in need, no? Always they teach me this when I was a little bambina...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You come here to steal from me, s\'ec, Darkspawn? Bene! I no care! Take the money! Take all the money! Is no mine anyway!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh? You wish to use the bank? A-As the customer? Uh, s\'ec... Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no reply. She seems to be too frightened to speak.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, what's a \lquote Darkspawn\rquote ? And why's everybody afraid of it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Actually, don't tell me. It's probably boring. I'll tell you what isn't\f2\emdash\f1 I found a secret way out of this place! It's up on the third floor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mummy won't let me use it, though. She says it's too dangerous.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Benvenuti a Gondolia! Welcome to our town! Here you can buy the famous products from all over the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is good you come at this time. A little before, the Darkspawn, he appear in the city. We had to cancel our Signor Universo competizione! Such a tragedy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo, he tell everybody about you. You have the sense of justice and the pure heart, s\'ec? Is the pleasure to serve you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... Is no the first time we see each other, s\'ec? I feel we meet somewhere before... Bah, probably is my imagination. Bene...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! I remember you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, though. Doge Rotondo's been going round explaining what happened. Everyone knows there's nothing evil about you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There are still lots of Heliodorian soldiers on the prowl, though. I'd get out of the city as soon as I could, if I were you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper told me to stay here and keep an eye out for the Darkspawn in case he comes back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Speaking of which, your hair...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's so smooth and shiny! I wish mine was like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sir Jasper told me to stay here and keep an eye out for the Darkspawn in case he comes back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't see him sauntering into town when it's still crawling with soldiers, though. If you ask me, we'd be better off going home to Heliodor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper was furious. I bet he can't believe he let the Darkspawn get away like that...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I wouldn't like to be in the Darkspawn's shoes. He's made enemies of both Sir Jasper and Sir Hendrik\f2\emdash\f1 and they're the finest soldiers in all of Heliodor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My friend, the one who buy the treasures of Gallopolis, he have the dream\f2\emdash\f1 he want to build an house in Puerto Valor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is no so strange a wish, of course\f2\emdash\f1 Puerto Valor is the sunny seaside town. Everybody, they want to have an house there!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My client, he say he want the magic key, the one which can open the very special sealed doors.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The rumours say that this key, it is kept in a village somewhere with many old ruins. And they say too that is no easy to go there...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uffa... So annoying! First he say he want the special water, now he say he want the magic key! Always, he change his mind!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper, he was here! Here in Gondolia! Ahh, he is such an handsome man! I thought this is just rumour, but no! Is true!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After Signor Universo is cancelled and I no see any beautiful boys there, this is wonderful compensazione for me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you are no come to see the Signor Universo contest. Scusa, but is cancelled.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is because of an horrible creature with the name of the Darkspawn! First he come here, then Sir Jasper follow. Is total chaos!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tentacular, he make an appearance, s\'ec? Mmm... He is causing the trouble here for many, many years, but never he enter the shallow water before...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It must be a special reason why he comes so close to land... Maybe something happen out in the sea? Mmm... Is strange... Molto curioso...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Darkspawn, he appear before I can open my shop! So I sell nothing! Niente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, at least I have a year now to prepare for the next competizione. Perhaps I begin now...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ugh... I really, really can't stand boats... But Sir Jasper told me to guard the waterways, so I don't have much choice.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought I'd get used to it, but nope\f2\emdash\f1 I just feel seasick all the time. It's the...swaying... (retch) Ugh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Alright! That's the stuff!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know what Sir Jasper's worried about. There's no way the Darkspawn's going to come back here after all that kerfuffle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, at least I get to knock off when the sun goes down. I can't wait to get a drink or two down me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now this is what I call a tavern! They've got tipples from every corner of Erdrea! I suppose that's the beauty of being a trading port.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I really don't know why Sir Jasper's kept us here, though. There's no way the Darkspawn's going to come back after all that kerfuffle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before, Benigno is nothing but trouble, but now I hear he help his father. Ahh, the little bambini, they change so fast, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not having much luck selling my wares around here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose there's just no market for this stuff in Gondolia. I've decided to move on to Puerto Valor. Maybe I can sell to some of the local knights there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're probably quite a serious lot, but at least I'll be able to negotiate with them properly. That's what my sales sense is telling me, anyway...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband has decided that we're going to Puerto Valor\f2\emdash\f1 he thinks he can sell more of his wares there\f2\emdash\f1 and now he's trying to rush us into leaving.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I don't want to go yet! We haven't even tried any of the local food!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband's job means we're always travelling around from town to town. It's hard for my poor daughter to make any friends her own age.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I did hear someone somewhere mention a boarding school for little girls her age.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe it would be good for her to go somewhere like that. She'd meet some other children, at least...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, I know you! You're the one they were calling the Darkspawn! The one they were shouting about out in the square!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But then they started saying you were some kind of hero! Is that true? Are you really, really amazing?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, don't be boring! If you're a hero, you must be amazing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it! I mean, you look so big and strong, you must be a real hero!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
She's fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper, he is no happy after Doge Rotondo help the Darkspawn to escape from that horrible monster.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is making trade more difficult for us, but is okay. You help little Placido, so we help you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote If the Darkspawn returns, apprehend the worm immediately, and do not allow him to wriggle free again!\rquote  Those were my orders from Sir Jasper.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's not coming back though, is he? Why would he after giving Sir Jasper the slip the first time? Nope, I won't see any action here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Eh? Are you...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see you somewhere before, no? You are the famous person?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Ah, scusa. But you have this...special air about you. If you are no famous now, you are sure to be some day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, s\'ec! Naturalmente! I knew it! You have the special air about you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, is you. Doge Rotondo, he tell me everything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you must be careful, s\'ec? Sir Jasper, he have guards on the patrol everywhere here still...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The soldiers, they think you are the Darkspawn, s\'ec? But Doge Rotondo, he tell us who you really are. Is okay, we no tell them about you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But how this misunderstanding happen in the first place, hm? This I would like to know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Is him! Is the\f2\emdash\f1  Ahem! Scusa... I, er, I talk to myself...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahim\'e8, the truth is...Sir Jasper, he order me very sternly to tell him if I see the Darkspawn. But I cannot take the pressure\f2\emdash\f1 now I think everybody is the Darkspawn!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But he no come back here. Is obvious\f2\emdash\f1 molto evidente! Why would he make such a risk? Is no need for me to check everybody!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't believe how peaceful it is around here already\f2\emdash\f1 it only seems like five minutes since that commotion with the Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I'm not complaining. Makes my life nice and easy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell You escape? Bravo! I worry about you! Eh, you hear this, s\'ec? My voice, is better than ever!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Some days ago, I play outside the town, and I observe Sir Jasper talking to the monster.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Is scary, so I make a little scream. He hear me, and curse my voice so I cannot speak about what I see! It was orribile!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell I know he is the important knight from Heliodor but me, I hate him! He is the bad man! Certamente!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell\par
You are the very good person...but now Sir Jasper, he chase you again, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Placido\cell Allora, I pray every day that he no catch you! And I hope you come back here sometime, when is safe for you. Buona fortuna! Good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell Is incredibile! You escape from Sir Jasper and all his soldiers! Molto stupendo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I no understand the situazione, but I know you helped Placido, so for sure you are no bad people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benigno\cell I pretend I no see you today. And I hope you continue your journey without the trouble! I cheer for you always!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My Benigno, he help his friend\f2\emdash\f1 is very happy thing for me. And now he even say he want to help me with my work!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You help my boy also. You make him brave. Grazie mille!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, Luciano. He sing so beautifully. His song soothe my heart. Is like riding the gentle waves...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He speak sometimes of the wonderful and mysterious voice people hear out in the sea, but for me, it is him who have the best voice in the world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mamma and pap\'e0, they are killed by the monsters. Monsters who are controlled by the Darkspawn. Is always what I believe, since I was the little bambino.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now, Doge Rotondo, he tell me the Darkspawn is an hero. So I am wrong? My whole life?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, if is no the Darkspawn who control the monsters, then who? Another evil creature?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Signor Universo contest is cancelled, s\'ec? Well, two contestants, they decide to make the show anyway.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is molto incredibile! They simply light up the stage, no? Allora, is magnifico! Ah ha ha!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell\par
Santo cielo! Is you! The one Sir Jasper is chasing! You must no stand here in the piazza! Everybody, they can see you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell I no want them to catch you. Doge Rotondo, he explain to me a little. I no understand everything, but I know you are no this evil one they say.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell\par
Doge Rotondo, he explain to me a little. I no understand everything, but I know you are no this evil one they say. I no want them to catch you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell ...Mm? The contest is cancelled, s\'ec. Is a shame after we make so many preparations.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Signor Sartori\cell But allora, is okay! Hercules and Luciano, they put on the show anyway! You watch, okay?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: La competizione is cancelled. Is because of the Darkspawn and Sir Jasper and...everything. So the name \lquote Hercules\rquote  will not appear on the trophy until the next year.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hercules\cell But is okay! Is chance for me to prepare even more! Next time, I have the even more beautiful muscles! Grandi muscoli!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Liu Za and the Abominable Showman, I hear they go back to Octagonia. There, they enter the fighting tournament.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have the muscoli, but I cannot fight. If I can fight, I go to Octagonia also for sure. Certamente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell Signor Universo is cancelled. Is shame. It would be the perfect chance for all the people to hear my beautiful voice.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell Speaking of a beautiful voice, the sailors, they talk about a voice they hear out in the sea. They tell me is simply bellissimo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell But the people who hear it, they fall asleep. And while they sleep, an horrible monster attack their ship, and drag her down into the water.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luciano\cell Is scary, no? But if I am honest, I still wish to hear it. Is no possible it can be more beautiful than mine!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo, now he shay the Darkshpawn ish no sho bad... Hic! But alwaysh, I know he ish good!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ish evidente! Ish all the plan of the molto, molto powerful evil! Shertamente! Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Shhh! You no talk to me! I hide here, s\'ec? You talk to me, he find me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You no talk to me! I hide here, s\'ec? You talk to me, he find me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... He no find me...here...! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mia sorella\f2\emdash\f1 my sister\f2\emdash\f1 you have seen her? She has become too good at the hiding. I cannot find her!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah-phew... Where...you are...? Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no know why, but Benigno, suddenly he want to help me. Is no much, but is a start, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, scusa! You no need to hear my news. Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The soldiers of Heliodor, they look for you, s\'ec? But you choose to come here to Gondolia regardless?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no want you to go, of course, but probably is wise to leave, no? Otherwise the soldiers, they catch you.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahim\'e8, now we have no Signor Universo, I have even fewer customers! I cannot live like this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I no care if you are the Darkspawn, you are the only customer I have today. Any business is good business! Allora...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our cakes, they are popular with visitatori from all over the whole world. Always we are very busy during Signor Universo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Baking the cakes is the easy way for one man to make many, many people happy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see the man with the long tongue? Is the contestant in Signor Universo. He buy so many cakes from us!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He say he come from Octagonia. I hear is a town with no sunlight. I cannot imagine...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We're supposed to be wandering wizards, but we really like it here, so we've decided not to go anywhere for a while.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What about you? Will you be moving on soon? If you're into fighting, Octagonia's supposed to be really fun.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've heard they've got this massive arena where they hold martial arts tournaments. It's got to be worth checking out, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came face-to-face with the Darkspawn. Yes, right here. But it traumatised me so badly, I've completely forgotten what he looked like.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll tell you what though, he was lucky to give Sir Jasper the slip. I wonder where he's scurried off to...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Signor Universo is cancelled, but the stall of my husband and me is an huge success!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now we have enough money to take an holiday in Puerto Valor! Magnifico!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo, he tell me the one they call Darkspawn is no a bad person after all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But still I no understand\f2\emdash\f1 if he is no bad, why the soldiers of Heliodor chase him?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? What you want? You no disturb me now! I have the idea for the new painting! The special painting! Stupendo! Fantastico! The image of Signor Jasper, on an hunt for the Darkspawn!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, you leave. Presto! I must work!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hm? Still you are here? Ah, but wait... You look like someone, no? Who I think of...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uffa, no! Is only my immaginazione. Now, get out! Andare!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finalmente! At long last! My master, he have the idea! He is working for the first time in so many years!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe he pay me all the money he owe me now. Is good news! Happy news!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Always I think the Darkspawn is evil, but now I see is an huge mistake. Doge Rotondo, he explain everything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But why I believe in the first place, eh? Who fill my head with such things? You know, I cannot remember...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell Salute, mio amico! You return to Gondolia! Already, I tell everybody what you do for my Placido.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell We all believe the rumour\f2\emdash\f1 the Luminary is the Darkspawn, he bring the destruction... But is a big, big mistake.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell We first hear this rumour many years ago. Is when the mighty kingdom of Dundrasil is destroyed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Doge Rotondo\cell So if they say you are the Darkspawn, then you have the connection to Dundrasil, no? S\'ec, certamente...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! Is you who help my boy, Placido, s\'ec? He tell me so much about you! We are all very grateful to you! Grazie mille!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When Placido stop talking, my husband, he say is because of the Darkspawn. He say the Darkspawn always bring the tragedy and destruction.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I no believe him. Placido is merely being a little rebel. A rascal. Is so fortunate you came here to help him! Grazie, grazie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Placido, he have his voice back\f2\emdash\f1 and I think is better than before! Molto sereno, molto puro!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe he become the singer in the future... Per carit\'e0! Goodness, listen to me! I must no put the pressure on him!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sir Jasper is an handsome man, and a famous knight, so he have many admirers. But me, I never like him. Always he look nasty to me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And allora\f2\emdash\f1 I am correct, no? He steal the voice of little Placido! He is the evil man for sure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Letting those prisoners escape from the dungeon was a bit embarrassing for us guards. That's why we're all determined to catch them now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But never mind all that. Your hair looks ever so familiar... Have we come across each other before?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Fair enough. Do you know, now that I mention it, this Darkspawn we're looking for has the same kind of hair...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, that's probably why I thought I recognised you. We're so desperate to get our hands on him, we're seeing him everywhere we look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm? I've bumped into you on my rounds, have I? Yes, I suppose that must be it. I have to confess, for one mad moment I thought you might actually be the Darkspawn! You know, what with that hair and all...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But let's face it, he isn't going to be coming back here. He's supposed to be some evil demigod, not that kind of blithering idiot who returns to the scene of the crime!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell\par
Blimey Charlie! Erik, me old mucker, it's you! And yer new pal an' all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell Listen, though... It's not that I ain't glad to see ya, but you really shouldn't 'ang about 'round 'ere. These streets are crawlin' wiv soldiers on the lookout for ya!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell If I was you, I'd wait for the 'eat to die down a bit an' then come back. In the meantime, why not 'ave a bit of a travel around an' see what the rest of old Erdrea's got to offer, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell\par
Listen, mate, it ain't that I ain't glad to see ya, but you really shouldn't 'ang about 'round 'ere. These streets are crawlin' wiv soldiers on the lookout for ya!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Derk\cell If I was you, I'd wait for the 'eat to die down a bit an' then come back. In the meantime, why not 'ave a bit of a travel around an' see what the rest of old Erdrea's got to offer, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to downtown 'Eliodor, the grimy little secret the posh folks over the wall don't want you to know about! Heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ang about... You've been 'ere before ain'tcha? Then why the 'eck 'ave you come back!? This ain't no place for sightseers! Clear off!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Word is that the tea leaf 'oo broke out o' the dungeons went an' pinched some posh jewel or somefink that belonged to the King. No wonder the guards are all over downtown like a rash.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you ask me, yer better off findin' some other place to be for a bit...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The sea gates are closed. You can't proceed any further.\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.09 Zwaardsrust\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings. You must be tired after your long journey. Fear not. There is an inn but a short distance along the road where you can rest your weary bones.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zwaardsrust used to be known as the Kingdom of Flowers. It was such a beautiful place. But then the monsters came and destroyed it all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, there may be nothing left of it now, but a city as grand as Heliodor once stood right here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tired after your journey, traveller? Then you have come to the right place!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose you're wondering why we named this place the Warrior's Rest?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, it's named in honour of Drustan, the Warrior King. He was a great man who fought alongside the Luminary back in the Age of Heroes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He was actually the one who founded the kingdom of Zwaardsrust, which used to stand just to the north of here. It's all in ruins now, though.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zwaardsrust was founded by Drustan, the Warrior King. It's also where Sir Hendrik was born.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's quite a pedigree, eh? Which makes it even sadder that those monsters came and destroyed it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband and I came away on holiday together, but the minute we get here, he goes off on his own! Makes me wonder why he married me in the first place...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew I should have put my foot down and insisted we go to Octagonia to see the Masked Martial Arts tournament.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was half hoping I'd get to put a mask on and give him a beating myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to Octagonia! My daddy's fighting in the tournament, and I'm going to cheer him on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? Where's Octagonia? Umm... I think Daddy said it was to the north...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: O fair land of Zwaardsrust, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
From whose earth tulips thrust, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Home of the brave, the just! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Purple Orb's protection, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Spreads peace in all directions, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Come, worship its perfection! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: That's an old song from Zwaardsrust. They say that the purple orb it mentions is still around somewhere...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to the Warrior's Rest, where wanderers from all over Erdrea stop to share a tale or two while they take a break from their travels!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it's a well-earned break for most. After all, the old kingdom of Zwaardsrust is enormous.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm studying the history of Zwaardsrust, so I'm keen to take a look at the ruins north-west of here. The problem is, I can't get in. There's a red door with a strange symbol on it in the way.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: According to this book, it's opened with something called the magic key.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Where can you find this key? Ha! How should I know? Sorry, you'll have to go and look for it yourself.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm studying the history of Zwaardsrust, so I'm keen to take a look at the ruins north-west of here. The problem is, I can't get in. There's a red door with a strange symbol on it in the way.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: According to this book, it's opened with something called the magic key.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You've got the magic key? Ha! Of course you have. And I suppose you're going to pop up there and open the door for me too, are you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The closest town is many miles away. I suggest you rest at the inn here and say a few prayers before continuing your journey...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought since I happened across this place on my travels, I might as well help my fellow guests by selling them a few essentials. Why don't you take a look...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell A mysterious force seems to be keeping the door tightly shut.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tsk! What a total waste of time! I came to Zwaardsrust because I heard there was some kind of legendary treasure hidden in the ruins.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I've turned over every piece of rubble in the place and there's nothing here! Not a sausage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's why I've decided to call it quits and head over to Octagonia for the Masked Martial Arts tournament. The prizes this year are meant to be incredible.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hold on\f2\emdash\f1 don't tell me you've found the treasure? Ach, I don't believe it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't suppose you'd sell it to me, would you? I'll give you 10000 gold coins for it. What do you say?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Fair enough. Legendary treasures don't come cheap, I suppose.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What!? Really!? Oh, I\f2\emdash\f1  I, umm... I haven't got that kind of money, I'm afraid. I suppose you'll be holding onto it for now, then...\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.10 Octagonia\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You want a Golden Boy autograph too? Well, you're just going to have to join the queue, I'm afraid. I really should be getting ready for the fight, though... But I can't help being popular, can I?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just need the right partner, that's all. Everyone keeps saying once I find someone who really understands me, I'll finally be able to win this thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Octagonia, y'all! This is where the world's best fighters come to duke it out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aw, shucks! I've already given you my spiel, ain't I, honey? So, you gonna join in the fightin' fun?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are, you better mosey on over to the registration counter and get your name down. It's right over there, under the statue of Sir Hendrik!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'll betcha there's a real nice view of Sir Hendrik's statue from up there. I'm gonna try climbing up one day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The whole of Octagonia's gearing up for the MMA tournament, so why do I gotta work, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Man, I wish I could just kick back with a cold one and watch the fighting. Maybe I'll just quit this job and get another one when the tournament's done...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You wanna know a shecret? Hic! I knocked off work early today and went drinking in the bar upshtairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only had a couple, but my old lady got mad, and now she won't let me in the houshe... Hic! Oh, man...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You wanna know who's gonna win the tournament? That's easy\f2\emdash\f1 Vince Vanquish all the way!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He won last year, so the whole of Octagonia'll be rooting for him. With that to spur him on, he's got it in the bag for sure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: MMA stands for Masked Martial Arts, did ya know that? Yup. Fighters put masks on, form up into pairs and beat the bejesus outta each other!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's kind of a tradition here in Octagonia. It's a big part of our culture.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know about Vince, right? The champ? He's, like, the most famous guy in Octagonia!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say he was born and raised in the orphanage. Guess that's why he spends so much time looking after the kids there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ain't seen you around here before. In town to take part in the MMA tournament?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well alright, but if you didn't register yet, I'd head over to the desk right now. There sure are a lotta folks taking part this year.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Best seats in the house, okay? Guaranteed. And at this price? Pal, I'm practically givin' 'em away\f2\emdash\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! What's the big idea!? This is a private conversation! Scoot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This here inn of ours is favoured by some of the world's finest fighters! It's the best place to get a taste for the real Octagonia\f2\emdash\f1 and you'll want to come back!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh man, I didn't sleep at all last night! I was too pumped about the tournament! Still, gotta try and stay focused on my work till it's time...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Golly, hello there! I suppose you're on holiday here too, hm? Jolly hard to find one's way around, what? Well, these stairs lead down to a residential area. The bars are all upstairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, and if it's the fighter's registration desk you're looking for, it's under the statue of Sir Hendrik!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dash it all... I promised my beloved son and heir that I'd bring him a little souvenir of Octagonia, but it's nigh on impossible to decide what to get! There's far too much bally choice! Far too much!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I suppose the only thing for it is to buy the whole lot. The little rascal can't be disappointed then!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Golly! The biceps on the statue of Sir Hendrik\f2\emdash\f1 they're frighteningly...realistic, aren't they?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that the rest of his assets aren't equally handsomely sculpted, of course. As in the clay, so in the flesh, what? Aha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha! I just came to town to catch the tournament, but I've got to say, there's some really nice folks around here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Like this dude! He's gonna get me a ticket for the best seat in the arena! And my tutu back on the island\f2\emdash\f1 my grandma\f2\emdash\f1 she gave me just enough money to pay for it too! Sweet!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One! Two! Three! Four! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Who's the one we all adore? \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Golden Boy! Goooooo Golden Boy! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you! Golden Boy's got a fight to be getting ready for! Quit getting in his way, will you? He's sensitive to that kinda stuff, you know.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I heard about the fighting tournament so I thought I'd come and take a look, but I didn't expect this many people! Am I even going to be able to get a seat?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've heard that the prize for this year's tournament is the best ever! They say the Mayor broke the bank to buy it from some travelling merchant.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was hoping to take a look at it myself, but I don't stand a chance with all these people around.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you wanna know what I like about the MMA tournament? It's the luck of the draw, man. Your chances of winning all hang on which partner gets picked for you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even the best fighter can't do much if he winds up paired with a chump. That's what makes the system so cool.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm what you might call an expert on female fighters. I know everything there is to know about all of 'em. I'll bet I know some of 'em better than they know themselves! Heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door is locked tight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince said I'd make a good priest, so I'm practising hard. Alright, let's see if I can remember how this goes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You're a stranger! Uncle Vince said we ain't supposed to talk to strangers!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hi, mister. Are you here to see Uncle Vince?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's gone to work\f2\emdash\f1 that means the arena!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a little older than the other orphans, so I take care of 'em when Uncle Vince ain't around.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're all super naughty when it's just me, but it's a different story when Vince gets home. They worship that guy.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! Quit running around like that! You're gonna fall flat on your face!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I told these kids a thousand times it ain't good to sleep out in the cold, but they don't listen to a word I say...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Think I ran around a little too much today... My head's kinda spinny...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince is stronger and kinder than anyone in any book! He's a real hero!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Everybody thinks he's just the mild-mannered guy from the orphanage, but when he steps into the arena, he's a real champ!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He'll keep fighting for the little guy for as long as it takes! His name is...Vince Vanquish!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... His heart is the size of his fist...! (snort) Biff! Pow! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey, no fair! You always get to be Uncle Vince! It's my turn now! I wanna be the champ!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... He's down... It's all over... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Haven't seen you around here before, mister... You don't look like a thief, though. No, you seem kinda nice...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well hello, friend, and welcome to Octagonia! I'm the mayor of this beautiful town.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm guessing you're here to take part in the MMA tournament? Heh. Why am I even asking\f2\emdash\f1 I can tell just by looking at you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yep, when you've been doing this as long as me, you get a feeling for these things. Well, good luck\f2\emdash\f1 and don't get hurt!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always get a little misty-eyed when the tournament comes around. See, you might not think it to look at me now, but I used to be a pretty well-known fighter myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yep, I knocked plenty of chumps on their rear ends in my time, let me tell you. Matter of fact, that's how I met my husband! Heh heh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband gets a little carried away when it comes to these big events. He already headed out to \lquote prepare\rquote  for the MMA tournament. Guess I won't be seein' him for a while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband still ain't home! If he likes these tournaments so much, he should think about signin' up and makin' us a little money!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So it's MMA time again, huh? That means a bunch more tourists\f2\emdash\f1 and a bunch more troublemakers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Say, you look like you're from outta town. Don't you go causing any trouble now, you hear?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phoo... Ah-phoo...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's been an almighty racket coming from upstairs these past few days. I hope it ain't no rat...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Stop it...! Zzz... Dirty rats...! No! (snort) Get outta my...house...! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, sweetie! Don't tell me you're a fan of mine too? Awww... Aren't you just the cutest?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You'll be rooting for me in the tournament, I hope? I'll be sure to give you a wave!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there. My name's Whambelina. Sorry if I look flustered. I just arrived here in Octagonia to fight in the MMA tournament... It's really not easy finding your way around, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Whambelina\cell Thank goodness I'm friends with Sinderella. Without her, I wouldn't even be able to find my way to the arena! Tee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Shlurrrp... Thish food ish delishoush! I'm going to shcoff ash much ash I can before the tournament shtartsh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm shtill hungry! And everything looksh sho delishoush! Shlurrrp!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Wot're you sayin'!? Vince's merch is nearly sold out, but no one wants any o' my stuff!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, yer displayin' it all wrong, ain'tcha!? Don't you know nuffink about salesmanship?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ere, you can't beat a front row seat, can ya? That's why I make sure they reserve this one specially for me, see. Bah ha ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Would you mind not disturbing me? I'm trying to focus before the fighting starts...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Hm!? Uh, ommm...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, folks. The bleachers are right this way, but they're not open to the public unless there's an event on.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a bar and a bunch of concessions on this floor. The tourists who come for the fighting seem to like it up here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes we even get famous fighters stopping by. They get all kinds of fired up before a fight. You gotta be careful what you say to those guys...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I ain't ashamed to tell you, my profits double during MMA season, what with all the thirsty tourists and fighters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, if you wanna drink what the stars are drinking, you gotta try the Fighting Juice. Don't ask what's in it, though\f2\emdash\f1 it's a trade secret!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there, handsome. You'll be stickin' around till the evenin', won't you? I'll be dancin' right there on that stage. The name's Janice, by the way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whoa there, handsome! I know I've probably got you all excited, but you can't come up on stage when Janice is dancin'!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! Lemme tell ya 'bout a real tough guy! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
The Hero of Heliodor, the Lord of the Fly! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
He beat the monsters, gave 'em one in the eye! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They call him Siiir, Siiir Hendrik! Ooh! Alright! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Siiir, Siiir Hendrik! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
He's the maaan, the man with the big statue! Ooh! Alright! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: We're singin' 'bout the guy they made that big statue of downstairs. Sir Hendrik. The Mayor had 'em make it 'cause of some cool thing he did or somethin'.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Think it was somethin' to do with Dundrasil, back when the monsters trashed the place... Hey, don't ask me. I'm just a rock singer, man.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey, babe. Wanna split a pitcher of Fighting Juice? I can show you how we Octagonians get down...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come on, man! It ain't a big deal! Quit making a scene, you're scaring my customers away!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! Will you quit licking everything! That stuff's not even edible! Jeez... All the freaks come out for the MMA, huh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
