\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Man, I just know they got my number. They've figured out this stuff is all junk. They're gonna run me outta town, I can feel it... (gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
