\pard\intbl\cell *: What a day! Talk about bringing in the big bucks! If I can do the same tomorrow, I'm gonna be rich, rich, rich! Here's to that! (glug)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
