\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Would you look at this guy? It's pathetic! He's just staring at Sinderella and Whambelina like some kinda love-struck fool!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You! Quit staring at my girls, will you? Leave 'em alone!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see that man over there making trouble? That's the Underdigger. He's a fighter\f2\emdash\f1 a real tough customer.\par
