\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I don't just mean in the ring. I'd steer clear if I were you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you see that man meditating over there? That's Liu Za. He's a famous fighter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's been there for hours, and he hasn't moved a muscle. That's focus for you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I, I don't believe it! It's the Abominable Showman! Now there's a character with hidden depths.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I bet you think he's just some slobbering idiot, don't you? Well, you're dead wrong\f2\emdash\f1 underestimate the Showman, and he'll crush you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, look at him! Can't you feel his aura from here? He's a real fighter. A true warrior.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: This Janice girl, she's just the best! Woo yeah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I have no need of material possessions. And yet it is interesting to imagine how I might feel were I to acquire such trinkets...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is merely an exercise in visualisation, of course. I will not be buying anything. Oh no. ...Ahem.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Mmm. The martial artists of the big city are...intriguing. Perhaps it would be...spiritually interesting to spend some time in their company...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I must focus... I must control my emotions... My urges... I must follow my master's shining example...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Once again, I am full of admiration for my master. How can he retain his ascetic focus in the company of such...diverting people?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's the big idea, huh!? Callin' me a poser! What I do with my muscles is my business, okay!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You and me...w-we undershtand each other, man. Hic! C'mon, let'sh get another round!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you believe this guy? Who the heck does he think he is, callin' me puny!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Heh heh! Hic! Shure, why not? You know...you ain't sho bad! Heh heh... (burp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is that branch really all the winners're getting this year? I mean, it's pretty, I guess...\par
