\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I'm sure the Mayor knows what he's doing. I mean, he must have bought it from that merchant for a reason, right?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
