\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's the Rainbough, which will be the first prize in the MMA tournament. It's giving off a mysterious glow.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's the golden sphere that will be the second prize in the MMA tournament. It's giving off a lovely warm glow.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there! Welcome to Octagonia! If you want to throw your hat into the ring and take part in the MMA tournament, you've come to the right place\f2\emdash\f1 this is the registration desk!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The rules are simple: each fight is between two pairs of fighters, and everybody has to wear a mask. Fighters are paired off at random.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And that's what makes it fun\f2\emdash\f1 the luck of the draw! It's what keeps folks coming back every year!\par
