\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This time around, we've got some very special prizes indeed\f2\emdash\f1 and the best one of all is the Rainbough! You won't believe the lengths the Mayor went to to get hold of that thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, you look to me like you've got some fight in you. So\f2\emdash\f1 how about it? You wanna give the MMA tournament a try?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
