\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives a mask and a draw number. It's number eleven! He's now ready to enter the MMA tournament!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
