\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alrighty then. I'll show you to your room. You rest up good for tomorrow, now!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Okay, you just lemme know when you're ready. There's no charge, remember, so don't you worry yourself about that.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't care what happens in the rest of the tournament\f2\emdash\f1 I've already won. Did you see who I've been paired with?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Isn't he amazing! And he really, really gets me. We're going to do great things together, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Octagonia, y'all! This is where the world's best fighters come to duke it out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But you must already know that, 'cause it looks like you're takin' part! Well, I surely hope you have yourself a great tournament.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You're Vince Vanquish's partner! I tell you, this is shaping up to be one of the best MMA tournaments ever! We even had ourselves a little drama during the draw there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I never saw anyone get their partner changed before. How did that old guy fix it so he could be with that chick, huh? He must be real important.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The way I heard it, Octagonia used to be full of hot-headed kids, just fighting each other all the time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So some bright spark came up with the idea of holding a tournament. That way, they'd have someplace to use up all that excess energy. Pretty smart, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So it seems that eight teams make it through from this first round of fights, and the losing teams get knocked out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It sounds pretty exciting! I mean, if you can't afford to lose even one match, everyone's going to be trying their best from the start!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tension around town goes up a couple notches when the fighting's about to start. It's fun to talk to the locals and watch 'em get all worked up.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, but you're gonna be fighting tomorrow, right? You should get some rest, man.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know the Octagonia Inn lets fighters stay for free? You should totally take advantage of that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, there'll always be a place in my heart for Sinderella... And Whambelina's just as sweet as pie too...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I'll tell you who's really turned my head this time around\f2\emdash\f1 the girl with the long black hair! She's got a whole lotta mystery about her, and I like that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Hey, partner! I'm lookin' forward to tomorrow, man! You and me, we're gonna smash this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Go check in at the inn, and I'll come get you in the morning, okay? Don't stay out all night or nothin'! Heh heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! It's Uncle Vince's partner! Are you staying here tonight?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, <pc>! You here looking for Uncle Vince?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's downstairs in the garden. Guess he's done working for the day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We're all big fans of Uncle Vince here at the orphanage.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And 'cause you're his partner now, we'll be rooting for you too! Give it your best shot, mister!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sinderella and Whambelina ride again! Talk about the luck of the draw! Now we're in the mix together, I just know we can win this thing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sinderella\cell Not that I'm saying it's a done deal. I mean, you got paired with last year's champ\f2\emdash\f1 you've gotta be in with a shot.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you're the one who got paired with the champ, huh? Well, that just gives us more reason to beat you down! You're in for some battles, kid.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell\par
Wot are you sayin'!? The Vince merch is almost sold out, but no one's buyin' any of the Underdigger stuff!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell\par
'Ang about... Oh, it's you\f2\emdash\f1 that little pipsqueak's pal. Feelin' all cocky now you've been paired wiv the champ, are ya?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell Well, that won't last long if you end up steppin' in the ring wiv me! You'll be feelin' bleedin' awful when I'm done wiv ya! Heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sinderella and Whambelina on the same team? Man, this is too much... I can't hardly take it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wanna go tell 'em I'll be rooting for them both...but I can't do it! I'm just too shy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I saw you at the draw! So you decided to try your luck in the tournament, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, quit it with the strong, silent act! You guys are all the same\f2\emdash\f1 the minute you sign up, you start acting all serious. Would it kill you to lighten up a little?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So some of the fighters have started disappearing again. Always happens right around the time of the draw.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My guess is they get paired with the wrong person, realise they're in for a whooping, and run off home to mommy. Can't say I blame 'em. Heh heh...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I worry about Vince down there in the orphanage. It's kinda out of the way. Someone could sneak up on him real easy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You didn't hear about what's been happening? It's awful! Fighters have been disappearing left and right!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And well, what with Vince being the champ and all, he's gotta be a target, right? I hope I'm wrong, but I've sure got a bad feeling about this...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We've been hearing rumours that somebody's been kidnapping fighters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But don't get yourself all bent outta shape about it\f2\emdash\f1 the tournament committee's keeping a close eye on all the competitors. You'll be fine. Just fine.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there, <pc>! It's almost time for the fighting to begin! Head on up to the dressing rooms when you're ready!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This elevator behind me will take you there. Good luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You wanna take the elevator to the dressing rooms, pal?<yesno>\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure thing. Just don't get in anybody's way up there, huh? The other fighters gotta get ready, just like you do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Okay. Just lemme know when you're ready to go up.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Hey, partner! It's time to get to it! You all set?<yesno>\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Nice! Let's go smash some heads!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Heh! You're one of them guys who's gotta have everything just so, huh? Hey, no sweat. Take your time, man.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Hey man, you feelin' alright? Listen, I got some good news\f2\emdash\f1 after you got knocked out, I managed to hold out for a tie. That means we got a rematch on our hands!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell But let's make sure we win this time, huh? Do what you gotta do, and let me know when you're ready.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You got a fight coming up, right? Well, if you need to get some rest beforehand, we got a bed you can use.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you need to say a pre-fight prayer? I'm actually an ordained priest. I know I don't look it, but hey. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: So I'll use my magic, like, ZAP! WHOOSH! Then you come in and whack 'em\f2\emdash\f1 BIFF! POW! Okay? You got it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zap, whoosh, biff pow... Got it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, did you hear about all the fighters going missing? I heard they all got kidnapped.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What kinda punk would pick on us like that, huh? Well, if the creep tries any of that stuff on me, he'll soon regret it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Congratulations! You made it through the first fight in one piece! I hope you're looking forward to the next one.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you must be exhausted. Why don't you call it a night, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: We're gettin' ready for the next fights right now. Sorry, pal\f2\emdash\f1 the arena and the dressing rooms are off limits.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Things'll get started just as soon as we're done preparing. I'd get myself patched up if I was you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! I saw you out there against the Underdigger and the Abominable Showman! Boy, you gave them a real whooping!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that I was surprised, though. Nah, I always knew you had something special. I'll be rooting for you in the next fight too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You did real good out there! You're the talk of the town!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before the fight, everybody was asking how Vince would cope with a rookie partner. Now they're saying you two can go all the way!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I guess you did good, winning your first fight.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that ain't nothing compared to what's coming. You're gonna be up against an even tougher team in the next round. Let's see how you deal with that...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You should probably go and have a word with Vince.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I underestimated you. You've got more potential than I thought.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you go far, but if you get drawn against us, it's all over. Me and my partner, we just...get each other. No one can compete with that.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Octagonia, y'all! This is where the world's best fighters come to duke it out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but you already know that, right? I mean, you won your first fight, and without hardly a hair outta place. Good luck in the next one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No way! You're Vince Vanquish's partner! Can I have your autograph?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Go, <pc>...! Zzz... Woo...! Sock it to 'em...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Underdigger's real tough, but he came up short again. Still, I guess he'll be back next year.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know what? I ain't seen him or the Abominable Showman since their fight finished. Maybe they just lit out for home after getting beat...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! You're that kid who got paired with the champ! Everybody's talking about you! They can't wait for your next fight!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're looking for Vince right now? He's probably headed home to the orphanage. You should go look for him there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You and the champ worked pretty good together\f2\emdash\f1 especially considering this is your debut. You might even have a shot at winning this thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Here ya go, pal\f2\emdash\f1 one ticket for the best seat in the house! Ya wanna buy this lucky charm too? These things work wonders with the Octagonian girls, trust me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey! Quit stickin' your nose in where it ain't wanted! This is a private conversation!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hm? You'd like a room? Oh, I'm sorry. We're not open at the moment. We're still getting all the rooms ready.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You'll have to come back again later. Make sure you do\f2\emdash\f1 you won't regret it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've become rather famous all of a sudden, what? Well done you! I doubt there's a soul in Octagonia who doesn't know who you are!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've half a mind to put you on my staff as a bodyguard, but the good lady will go positively doolally if I spend another penny.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Man, people here are sooo friendly! This dude just sold me a super cheap ticket, and now he's offering me a lucky charm too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm so glad I took my old ma's advice and tried to trust everybody I meet. It works out on the island, and it works here in the city too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're fighting in the tournament? Well, I hope you know you got no chance of winning. Uh-uh! Golden Boy's gonna beat all of you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whoa, it's you! Is this really your first time!? You should hear the things people are saying about you! You're a big hit!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I was awfully shocked to hear about all the fighters who've been disappearing. I do hope Vince will be alright.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
