\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Actually, Vince might well be a target too. Maybe he's seen someone suspicious around the place...\par
