\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho! This year's tournament's set to be a real doozy! It's sure got the best line-up of fighters we've had in a while!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, I'd say it's shaping up to be the best since the tenth anniversary blow-out we had, and that's saying something\f2\emdash\f1 Sir Hendrik himself took part that year!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Man, he was something else! He was up against some real tough customers, but he just breezed through 'em like they were nothing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, you kinda look like my husband did when he was your age. Back when he still had a little spark in him. Ahh, those were the days...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not usually much of a fan of MMA. Always seems to me like a bunch of meatheads wailing on each other to no purpose. But your fight was different. I kinda enjoyed it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll certainly be cheering you on in the next round. I mean, you're partners with Vince Vanquish\f2\emdash\f1 you've gotta have a pretty good chance, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tournament's a real doozy this year, huh? It's enough to make me forget about all the strange noises coming from upstairs...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought you were just a kid, but you're a heck of a fighter. Not that that'll matter if we ever tangle in the ring\f2\emdash\f1 you'll be crying for your mommy soon enough!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought you were the quiet, retiring type. Seems you're more like the strong, silent type. I like that. Here's hoping we get the chance to go up against each other one of these days!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there, kid! Nice work in that last bout! Everybody's talkin' about you! Pretty impressive for a first-timer!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're not the only first-timer who made an impression, though... That martial artist girl and the old guy\f2\emdash\f1 they're quite something! Yep, this year's tournament is gonna go down as a classic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, man. If you, like, win this thing, you'll totally be as famous as Sir Hendrik. Maybe then we'll write a song about you too.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Disappearing fighters? Yeah, I guess I do have a couple of regulars who suddenly stopped showing up.\par
