\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f6\u8810?\f1\lang9 07\f4\'83\'7d\'83\'8b\'83\'65\'83\'42\'83\'69\'82\'aa\'93\'a6\'82\'b0\'82\'bd\'8c\'e3\f6\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there, <pc>! Seems like the whole of Octagonia wants to shake your hand. Sure hope you're ready to be a celebrity!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: One, two, three, alright!\par
One, two, three, let's fight!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, hey man! I was just writin' a song about you. It's a real rockin' jam too\f2\emdash\f1 way better than the one about Sir Hendrik!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f6\u8810?\f1\lang9 07\f4\'83\'7d\'83\'8b\'83\'65\'83\'42\'83\'69\'82\'aa\'93\'a6\'82\'b0\'82\'bd\'8c\'e3\f6\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You won! And in your first-ever tournament! Amazing! I can't wait for the award ceremony!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, congratulations! That was some incredible stuff out there! Shame about what happened to Vince, though.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, they're saying he won't be out of action for too long. Guess all the years of fighting finally caught up with him...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Anyway, they're postponing the award ceremony till he's better. Looks like you'll be sticking around a little longer, champ!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tournament committee's arranged some free accommodation for you at the inn. Why not go rest up awhile?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're postponing the award ceremony till he's feeling better. Looks like you'll be sticking around a little longer, champ!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tournament committee's arranged some free accommodation for you at the inn. Why not go rest up awhile?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The elevator's out of action right now\f2\emdash\f1 the award ceremony's been postponed till Vince is feeling better, see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We should have known Vince was overdoing it. He must have had so much on his mind...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm real happy that you won the tournament and all...but I can't help thinking about those missing fighters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't wanna rain on your parade, but I just don't think I can celebrate until they've been found...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody's talking about you. It ain't fair, but I ain't gonna whine. Guess I better just accept that you're...good.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And, uh, hey... While you're here, could you sign this for me? It's for, uh...a friend of mine...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I turn my back for just one second, and Golden Boy is nowhere to be seen. Where could he have gone?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, he didn't really look himself when he was fighting either. It's all kinda worrying, don'tcha think?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No Sinderella, no Whambelina and no Jade! They're all gone! Who am I supposed to try and impress now, huh!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's one of the beds used by the orphans. Rest for a while?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Something's happening down in the courtyard. I think it's something bad...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hey, I meant to say earlier\f2\emdash\f1 if you're ever feeling tired, you're welcome to use one of the beds here. They're super comfy, I promise!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is bad, Mister <pc>! This is real bad! Uncle Vince ain't here! He's meant to be sleeping, but he's gone!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And something super weird's happened in the garden downstairs too...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I get it, you know. I know we're the reason Uncle Vince pushes himself so hard.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He must have so much to deal with, but he never lets it show. He never has anything but smiles for us kids.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And now he's disappeared, and there's nothing we can do about it. I... I feel so helpless...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mister <pc>, you gotta listen! When we realised Uncle Vince was missing, we searched the orphanage high and low.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But all we found was this\f2\emdash\f1 it's a staircase leading underground! None of us have seen it before.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: D'you think he mighta gone down there? Where do you think it leads?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: U-Uncle Vince... Wh-Where... Zzz... Are you...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I, I'm scared...(sniff)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince got tired of us and left, didn't he?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey... Zzz... Give Uncle Vince...back to us...! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sniff) Uncle Vince! (sniff) Come back... Waaaaaah!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't feel like chatting right now. Go talk to somebody else.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hnhmmm... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: U-Uncle Vince is gone! He was supposed to be in bed, but he ain't there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What if he ain't never comin' back!? What'll happen to us then!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That racket from upstairs has finally stopped. Gotta say...I kinda miss it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't sleep a wink now that noise from upstairs has stopped. It's just too darned quiet...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Wh-What!? Sinderella and Whambelina have disappeared!? Say it ain't so!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I... I gotta rescue 'em! Yeah! They're probably waiting for me to come save 'em right now! ...But how am I gonna do that?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The young ladies are no longer present, I see. That is...unfortunate.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My master had promised to teach the young warrior women of the ways of enlightenment, and yet, they have disappeared. Do they not know what great gifts they have forsaken?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We decided to postpone the award ceremony for a couple days till Vince is feeling better. Sorry to keep you waiting, but I'm sure it'll be worth it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Golden Boy\cell After the monster took me... When I was unconscious...I heard a voice... A soft, melodious voice... Sylvando's voice...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Golden Boy\cell He was only saying my name...but it sounded...like the most beautiful melody in the world... I always knew that he and I had a special connection!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Octagonia, y'all! This is where the world's best fighters come to duke it out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hey there, handsome! Well, the big day's finally here\f2\emdash\f1 it's award ceremony time! And you've done your hair all special, I see!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Woo yeah! It's finally time for the award ceremony! ...Uh, what's an award ceremony?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's time for your big moment at last, kid\f2\emdash\f1 hope you got a speech prepared. I'll be all ears!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm just glad we got all the missing fighters back before the ceremony. Now we can actually enjoy the show!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This was the best tournament we ever had! All the fighters were great\f2\emdash\f1 but you were the greatest of all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see how excited everybody is? That's all because of you! You're a star now!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Looks like Vince is okay now. I'm so happy. I just hope he takes it easy for a while. I don't know what I'd do if he...wasn't around...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every year I wind up thinking the same thing\f2\emdash\f1 these fighters are so cool... Maybe it's time I started training myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Only trouble is, I'm no good with pain. Heck, sometimes I stub my toe and I wind up thinking my leg's about to fall off!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Man, I must be gettin' soft in my old age! I was all set to squeeze this easy mark here for every penny he had, but he's just so damned...nice! My conscience can't take it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's kind and appreciative, and... Ugh! If I don't snap out of it, I'll wind up givin' him his dough back! What's gotten into me!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd heard the rumours, of course, but I had no idea that Octagonia was quite this much fun! I may have spent all our money, but golly, did I have fun spending it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, that's the tournament done for another year. I miss the sound of fist on jaw already...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was kinda worried about coming to the big city all by myself. It's so different from the island. But I didn't need to worry at all! Folks around here are super nice!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I spent all the money my old ma gave me, but she won't mind when she sees the cool stuff I bought with it. I sure was lucky to run into this guy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Golden Boy? More like Golden Bore! He ain't the man I thought he was! My days of rooting for that loser are ooo-ver!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Now I'm team <pc> all the way! You're the best! And if anyone wants to say different, they can say it to me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The first prize is the Rainbough, isn't it? Just the one? But there are two people in your team.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How are you going to share that? Are you going to have to snap it in two? I'm quite intrigued...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, what are you doing here? Did you oversleep or something?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, you'd better head up to the arena right away! The award ceremony's starting! Talk to the person at the desk under Sir Hendrik's statue\f2\emdash\f1 he'll show you the way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You know what I like about <pc>? He's, like, the strong silent type. He doesn't say much, but he's tough. A guy like me can admire that.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: H-Huh!? <pc>!? It's really you!? I, I'm a huge fan! Please, l-lemme shake your hand!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Looks like Sinderella and Whambelina are back\f2\emdash\f1 and in one piece too. That sure is a relief.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you imagine what their fans would have done if they hadn't made it home? My guess is they would have locked themselves in their bedrooms and cried for a month. Ahem...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, Mister <pc>! Aren't you going to the award ceremony?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince headed up to the arena already. You can't leave him hanging!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince came back! Is it true that you're the one who saved him, Mister <pc>?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is? Oh wow, thank you! We owe you big time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've gotta make something super tasty today\f2\emdash\f1 we're celebrating! Woop! \f3\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince told me everything that happened. How he made a deal with a monster so he could win at the tournament and all...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that he's back, we've gotta do what we can to help him. We're a family here, and that's what families do!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's kinda hard to know how to feel... I mean, I know Uncle Vince did a real bad thing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But he did it for us! ...Yeah! He's still our hero, no matter what!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: People have been talking about those fighters that went missing, and saying that Vince was somehow a part of it all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I don't believe it for one second. Vince Vanquish would never get involved in something like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're back! Whoever was making those noises upstairs, they've started again! I gotta say, I kinda missed it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sinderella\cell That big spider was all set to wring the life outta me and leave me looking like a big old prune.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sinderella\cell Thank goodness you came along! I don't know how to repay you... I guess you're not into puff-puffs, huh...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Whambelina\cell I can't believe I let that...thing get its creepy little hands on me. I need to train harder...starting next week!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abominable Showman\cell Shlurrrp... That monshter shucked shomething out of me... I've been eating and eating, but I can't sheem to replashe it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell\par
It don't make no sense! Why would <pc>'s merch sell like 'otcakes an' no one buy mine? What's that little runt got that I ain't\f2\emdash\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell\par
Oh! Champ! I, err, didn't see ya there... I bet everyone's well 'appy wiv you coz you \lquote rescued\rquote  me, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Underdigger\cell Well, just so ya know, I was about to give that Arachtagon a wallopin' and grab all that magic potion for meself! So fanks for nuffing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Please... Don't disturb my meditation. I've gotta learn to focus, or I'm gonna get kidnapped again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: No... NOOO...! The s-s-spider...! It's coming for me...! Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This year's tournament smashed all records. My profits went up by five hundred percent! I guess that's mostly down to you, huh? Thanks, kid!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: He came from nowhere with a thirst for fightin'! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
He beat up Jade and Rab, ooh, so excitin'! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
The rookie, the rookie! Rookie, rookie, rookie, yeah! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His style's original, his hair's amazin'! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
His smile's enough to set your heart a-blazin'! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
The rookie, the rookie! Rookie, rookie, rookie, yeah! \f3\u9834?\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: They're back! Sinderella and Whambelina came back, and life is beautiful again! It's like the whole world smells of roses!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ladies, I ain't never letting you outta my sight again! I'm your number one fan, and I'm gonna take care of you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Liu Za strolled back in here like he'd just popped out to the shops, and now he's started meditating again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't think he's moved a muscle since he's sat down. That's some pretty impressive concentration...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Mister Abominable Showman, I'm... I'm your number one fan!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you need someone to practise your moves on, just ask me! I'll gladly be your punchbag!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, <pc>! It's time for the ceremony! Vince is back on his feet and raring to go! He's in the arena already!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody's waiting for you. I'd better take you up there right away. If you'll follow me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey, <pc>. How's it goin'? Don't head up to the arena just yet\f2\emdash\f1 I'm gonna need you to speak to the guy at the registration desk first.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guess they wanna make sure you're all set for the award ceremony. You know where the desk is, right? Just behind the elevator there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is it, <pc>! You'd better go ahead and report to the registration desk. Everyone's waiting for you up in the arena!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The Rainbough sure is pretty, but does it seem kinda...useless to you? Guess you could use it to prop a door open...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hmm? Oh! Hey, <pc>! Looking forward to getting your hands on that Rainbough, huh? Man, I sure am jealous... Ahem.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The Rainbough starts to glow ever so gently!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Woohoo! Honey, we did it! We got the Purple Orb! And it's still in one piece, too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell If we carry on like this, we'll have the whole set before we know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Octagonia, y'all! This is where the world's best fighters come to duke it out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And speaking of the world's best fighters...it's our new champion! Good to see you again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know you! You're the champion! And I know what \lquote champion\rquote  means! It means the best, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you're not the best. My mommy is the best! My mommy's the champion!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey! It's the champ! Aww... Why do I gotta work on the day the champ comes to town?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I wanna do is head over to the tavern with you, grab a couple of cold ones and talk about fighting. Could just jack my job in, I guess...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Used to be there was a kingdom called Dundrasil not too far from here. That is until monsters came and smashed it to the ground...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that's where the old guy said he took the Rainbough, right? Why would he want you to meet him there?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I never believed the rumours about Vince only being champ because of that stuff he drinks...but I guess they were true...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I gotta say though, I ain't mad. He always puts on a good show, and I respect that.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So that's it, huh? Vince Vanquish has quit the fight game. It's kinda sad, knowing I won't get to see him in the ring ever again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I support his decision one hundred percent. He gave us everything he had. He'll always be my champion... (sniff)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Rab and Jade... Those were their names, weren't they? That pair of thieves who ran off with the Rainbough?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's odd, but I'm sure I've heard those names somewhere before. Can't for the life of me think where...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So Vince was cheating the whole time? That's a bit disappointing, isn't it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I suppose fans like me must take some of the blame. It can't be easy coping with all the pressure we put these fighters under.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So the Rainbough's been stolen? That's a bit of a disaster, isn't it? And they say the Yellow Orb's gone missing as well.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's obvious who the culprits are, though. It's that pair you beat in the final. The funny old man and the girl with the kicky legs.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The tournament's over, but the stories keep on coming. Vince retiring, the prize being stolen...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's only one story that really matters though, and that's yours! All hail the new champ!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Rab and Jade are just one big mystery, huh? Nobody knows where they came from, and now they've up and disappeared.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I'll tell you what I do know\f2\emdash\f1 and I say this as someone who's seen a whole bunch of fighters over the years.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Jade is something special. Just so...elegant, man. The old guy, not so much.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell Hey, partner. I guess maybe you heard\f2\emdash\f1 I decided to quit fightin' and come clean about what I've been doin' to win all these years.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell And you know what happened when I did? People forgave me, man! Octagonians might get on your back if you lose, but deep down, they're good people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Vince\cell That's why I'm gonna spend the rest of my days givin' somethin' back. After all, I owe these guys everythin' I have.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince said he's not gonna fight any more! He's gonna stay here with us the whole time!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, Mister <pc>! You looking for Uncle Vince? He's in the garden downstairs. And he looks pretty happy too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince told me he's gonna quit fighting and dedicate himself to the orphanage. He said he was a \lquote changed man\rquote .\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope that means he'll let me cook all his favourite food for him now! No more pre-tournament crash diets for us!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Vince ain't the champ no more...but he'll always be our hero!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All the kids here at the orphanage are real grateful to Uncle Vince.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We'll never forget everything he did for us! Not even when we're all grown-up!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew there was something special about you the moment I set eyes on you, kid. You're different to all the other fighters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd love for you to stay and become a real Octagonian legend, but you wanna know the truth? This town ain't big enough for you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nah, you need to get out there and change the world. There ain't no limit to what you can do! Just come back and say hi once in a while, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if it isn't the champ, come to see little old me. You're too kind to an old lady dear, really you are.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a tragedy what happened to Dundrasil back in the day. I mean, the King and Queen had just had a kid, and they were having a big party to celebrate.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And the monsters choose then to attack? That's just evil. And they trashed the place, man... That was years ago already, but thinking about it still makes me mad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everything I sell is exclusive! You can't get this stuff anyplace outside Octagonia\f2\emdash\f1 and that's a fact!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh!? Hey, it's you! The new champion! Hey, you got something you can give me? A sock or something? It's worth big bucks if it's got your sweat on it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That was a classy touch by Vince, challenging you to fight for the prize like that. The crowd really went wild for that one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
