*: Are you kidding me!? You think Sir Hendrik is tougher than the champ!? The champ would wipe the floor with that schmuck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: All I'm sayin' is, the champ's good, but he don't compare to Hendrik! That guy's in a different league!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
