\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: O-Oh! <pc>... I... Ahh... On behalf of the organising committee, allow me to offer you my heartfelt apologies.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your prize being stolen...it was our fault...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I say that, but we can't officially accept any responsibility, of course. That would open us up to all kinds of trouble.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, if you can track it down, it's all yours. The old guy mentioned Dundrasil, right? Maybe you should go look for it there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? Where is that? It's south-west of here. You can't miss it\f2\emdash\f1 scary old ruin, crawling with monsters. ...Ahem.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Rainbough being stolen...it was our fault... Well, I say that, but we can't officially accept any responsibility, of course. That would open us up to all kinds of trouble.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, if you can track it down, it's all yours. The old guy mentioned Dundrasil, right? Maybe you should go look for it there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? Where is that? It's south-west of here. You can't miss it\f2\emdash\f1 scary old ruin, crawling with monsters. ...Ahem.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Sorry, pal. I can't let you up there when there ain't no fights to get ready for\f2\emdash\f1 even if you are the champ.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You sure have been through a lot, huh? Your partner admits to cheating, then your prize gets stolen...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know what, though? It'll all help make you stronger. You're gonna have a good life, I just know it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I don't know why anybody would wanna steal the Rainbough. It looked like any old stick to me. Guess you could throw it for a dog or something...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Hm? Oh! Hey there, champ! I bet you're all cut up about the Rainbough being stolen, huh? ...Ahem.\par
\cell\row 
