\b\fs24 1.12 Puerto Valor\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This path leads to the top of Mount Pang Lai. No one's allowed up there at the moment, though. By order of Sir Jasper of Heliodor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's identified the monastery at its peak as a breeding ground for dissent, thanks to its historic links to the Darkspawn. Decent, law-abiding people have no reason to go there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The people who live up on Mount Pang Lai have a deep connection to the ruined kingdom of Dundrasil, and are hostile toward Heliodor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it's such a foolish stance to take. Heliodor is the mightiest kingdom in all Erdrea. Why would anyone choose to make us their enemy?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I don't understand why the people who live up here were so supportive of the Drasilian royal family.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Surely they wouldn't choose to make an enemy of Heliodor if they didn't have a very good reason...but I have no idea what that reason might be...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola. I am originally from Puerto Valor, to the south of here. The great Don Rodrigo trained me in the way of the sword, and I joined the Heliodorian army, like so many before me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes I miss my home. My hermanita\f2\emdash\f1 my little sister\f2\emdash\f1 she is still so young. I wish I had the time to go back and see her once in a while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This valley'll take ya all the way into the Champs Sauvage. Dunno if you've 'eard about it, but that place is surrounded by some proper 'igh mountains an' that.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Problem is, ya can't pass through 'ere right now. Nope, the only way yer gettin' into the ol' Champs is by sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola, se\'f1or. \'a1Bienvenido a Puerto Valor! Welcome!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our town is famous for its casino, and for the many tourists who come to gamble there. Maybe you should pay it a visit too, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no response. He's lost in the music.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are standing above the Valor-Sauvage Channel. It flows out of the city, across the Champs Sauvage, and out into the open sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is why it is known as the gateway to Erdrea. It grants ships from the inner kingdoms access to el oc\'e9ano\f2\emdash\f1 the ocean waves.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Puerto Valor, the city of blossoms and sea breeze! No one has bluer water or whiter sands than we do! \'a1No se\'f1or!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are looking for a merchant? One carrying a rainbow-coloured branch? \'a1S\'ed! I saw the man you are talking about, I think. He was headed for Don Rodrigo's villa.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The villa is at the bottom of these stairs on the left. It's the biggest building in town\f2\emdash\f1 you can't miss it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I want to be a great knight like Sir Hendrik, so I decided to come to Puerto Valor because I heard that this is where he trained...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I'm here now, so I'd better go through with it. I made a promise to my family, and a knight's word is his bond, after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The town of Puerto Valor has always had close ties with Heliodor\f2\emdash\f1 generations of young hombres from the big city have come here to train as knights.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don Rodrigo teaches them swordsmanship, chivalry, all that caballero stuff. And the ones who make the grade, they get to join the Heliodorian army.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! Do you want to hear something exciting? There is a se\'f1orita in the hotel who will give you rare treasures in exchange for mini medals! How about that, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay! I wish I had a mini medal... Do you know where I can find one?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Mi hermano... Dear brother... Come back safe, por favor... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I come from a snowy country in the far north, but I like it here so very much more! Everything is so fresh and clean! Ahh, I will never tire of it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just look at the ocean! Can you see it glittering in the sun? Can you feel the sea breeze on your face? This is just the most wonderful place!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I come from a snowy country in the far north, but I like it here so very much more! Everything is so fresh and clean! Ahh, I will never tire of it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just look at that girl dancing on the beach over there\f2\emdash\f1 she understands! The sea breeze in one's hair in the evening...it is simply bliss!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have come here on holiday from a snowy kingdom far to the north. We have always wanted to see the ocean before we got too old.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I am so glad that we did! My husband is getting excited at even the tiniest things! I have never seen him like this before\f2\emdash\f1 it is wonderful!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I saw Princess Jade once, back when I was a ni\'f1ita\f2\emdash\f1 a little girl. It was when we were visiting Heliodor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: La bonita... She was so adorable, like a little fairy. I thought she would surely grow to be more beautiful than the old queen, her mother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I heard she was killed back when Dundrasil fell. Ay ay ay... That poor family, they have seen so much tragedy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The mighty kingdom of Heliodor to the east of here was once home to a young princesa by the name of Jade.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas\f2\emdash\f1\'a1Ay de m\'ed!\f2\emdash\f1 she has not been seen for many years. Not since the day of the Colloquy of Kings, when Dundrasil was destroyed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone believes she was killed by the Luminary\f2\emdash\f1 or should I say the Darkspawn\f2\emdash\f1 but en realidad, nobody really knows what happened that day.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You must be a fellow traveller. We're just taking a breather here on our way north. I say, I don't suppose you've ever paid a visit to that awfully deep valley to the west of here, have you?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not surprising, I suppose\f2\emdash\f1 it is a bally tricky spot to get to.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have? Golly, you must be jolly experienced at this travelling lark if you managed to find it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hear that there's a really rather excellent boarding school for girls on the other side of it. We were thinking of sending our own beloved offspring there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must say, I really don't approve of this game my children are playing. I've tried to make them understand how terrifying the Darkspawn is, but it just doesn't seem to sink in.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank goodness! The children have finally decided to go to sleep! Perhaps now my dear husband and I can finally enjoy a moment of peace.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Save me, please! Hee hee! Sir Hendrik! Sir Jasper! Save me! The Darkspawn is coming!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
She seems to be fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grrrarrrgh! I am the Darkspawn! Heh heh! I will eat you alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
He seems to be fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You might not believe it, but we're actually Heliodorian soldiers. Hey, it's only right that we treat ourselves to a break from time to time\f2\emdash\f1 we deserve it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To be honest with you, I don't really want to go back to work. They'll only have us chasing the Darkspawn again. I wish I could just stay here...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that the Darkspawn turned up in Gondolia after running away from Heliodor. They're saying he managed to give Sir Jasper and his men the slip.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if old Jasper can't catch this chap, I really don't know who can. Not me, that's for sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Gosh... Look at her go! It's nights like this that make me glad to be alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've heard there's going to be a dance show on the beach tonight. I can't wait! It's going to be wonderful, I just know it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just look at her move! It's just wonderful! This trip to Puerto Valor was worth every penny!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm looking for pretty seashells to take back with me to Heliodor. That way I'll always have a reminder of this wonderful trip!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Deep blue sea, pure-white sands... Dancing to the beautiful music of a guitar... I really can't imagine anything more romantic!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Buenos d\'edas, se\'f1or. I am a dancer here in Puerto Valor. You have seen the guitarist on the bridge, s\'ed? In the evening, he accompanies me as I dance on the beach.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come watch me, and I promise I will charm you! You will fall in love with Puerto Valor, and will never want to leave! \'a1Je je je!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You want to dance with me, se\'f1or? \'a1Je je je!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lo siento\f2\emdash\f1 my apologies, se\'f1or. The villa is no longer for sale. The merchant who has agreed to purchase it will return just as soon as he has sold the colourful branch he had in his possession.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a shame for you, I think. The view of the sea is so wonderful. Of course, that is why it is so expensive. This branch must be very valuable, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: On the western side of the street in the centre of town\f2\emdash\f1 the side with the staircase\f2\emdash\f1 there is a villa that has been for sale for some time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Unfortunately, I cannot offer it to you any more. The merchant who has agreed to purchase it will return just as soon as he has sold the colourful branch he had in his possession.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a shame for you, I think. The view of the sea is so wonderful. Of course, that is why it is so expensive. This branch must be very valuable, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You think I am looking at the pretty girls on the beach? \'a1No se\'f1or! I am keeping an eye on the horizon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have received reports that a giant sea monster has been seen near Gondolia to the south. We are being extra watchful in case it makes its way here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay, el mar... The sea is so beautiful at night... But do not be deceived, se\'f1or\f2\emdash\f1 it is muy peligroso. Very dangerous indeed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When darkness descends, strange and horrible monsters rise up from the depths. S\'ed, you must be very, very careful...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've only gone an' lost every penny I 'ad at the bleedin' casino!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came 'ere all the way from 'Eliodor to see if I could turn me grubby ol' life around...but it's probably just gonna get even grubbier from now on... (sigh)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Buenos d\'edas, se\'f1or. Have you come to Puerto Valor to visit the hotel casino?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfNo? That is unusual. Most people who come here, they come to gamble.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, even if it is not the reason you came, I can still highly recommend it. The Slime Quest Slots are especially fun! \'a1Muy divertido!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1C\'f3mo no! Of course! Our casino is very popular. There is always a queue outside before it opens!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have many different games, but the Slime Quest Slots are the most fun for me. You must start queueing early to get a good machine, though. \'a1Buena suerte! Good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay! You are here for the casino? Lo siento\f2\emdash\f1 sorry\f2\emdash\f1 we are not open yet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if you wish to play the Slime Quest Slots, I suggest you start queueing now\f2\emdash\f1 the good ones go fast! Would you like to get in line, se\'f1or?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfNo? Bien. Let me know if you change your mind.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Muy bien. Wait here until we are open, por favor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Se\'f1or, wait! You are here for the casino? Lo siento\f2\emdash\f1 sorry\f2\emdash\f1 we are not open yet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Visit the casino and make your dreams come true! You can't win if you don't play! Maybe you will go home a millionaire!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Slots, poker, you name it\f2\emdash\f1 we have all your favourite games, se\'f1or! Head down the stairs and get ready to gamble!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: People queue up outside the casino before it opens because they have these extra-special Slime Quest Slot machines, and everybody wants the best ones, apparently.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They must be special if people are prepared to wait hours for a chance to play on one. Maybe I should give it a go...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I met a gentleman on the way into town who appeared to have very good taste. He said such nice things about my clothes!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's more, he even gave me a few fashion tips! I'm sure he'd do the same for you if you asked him nicely.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those people are queueing outside the casino before it opens because they have these extra-special Slime Quest Slot machines, and everybody wants the best ones, apparently.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They must be special if people are prepared to wait hours for a chance to play on one. Maybe I should give it a go...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The other hotel in Puerto Valor is much bigger than mine...but I have been here for years, and I do not give up so easily! Now then...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The city of Octagonia's way off to the north-east of here. They have these amazing fighting tournaments there. In fact, there should be one on right now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd enter if I thought I had any chance of winning, but the people who take part are all properly battle-hardened. They'd wipe the floor with the likes of me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many of Don Rodrigo's students buy their weapons from our shop. We are well known for our sharp edges! Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to Don Rodrigo, my boy became a caballero, and joined the Heliodorian army. He is on guard duty at Mount Pang Lai just now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Always he said he wanted to be a knight, ever since he was a little ni\'f1ito. S\'ed, we are all very proud of him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sea is filled with terrible monsters...but you have no need to worry! My armour will always keep you safe! Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are a traveller, s\'ed? Perhaps you have seen the huge mountain to the north of town?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfNo? Then you should go take a look, se\'f1or! It is called Mount Pang Lai. They say there are monks living at the summit who train people in martial arts.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is Mount Pang Lai. They say there are monks living at the summit. People go there to train in the martial arts.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote For an adventurer, every port is a new story waiting to be told...\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's an old saying, but a true one. You should never turn down the chance to explore new places. Who knows what incredible creatures you'll encounter, or what treasures you'll find?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola, se\'f1or. You came here by boat, s\'ed? Did you maybe see a strange column of light coming out of the ocean?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The column appears when the power of the sea deity cannot be contained. They say that it leads down into a hidden underwater kingdom...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are on holiday here, s\'ed? Perhaps I could interest you in a souvenir to take home?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A long time ago, a famous swordsman from Heliodor was sent here, and put in charge of the sea gates.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Other knights soon followed him, attracted by the proximity of the sea, and merchants followed after them. That is how Puerto Valor became the town it is today.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don Rodrigo is a direct descendant of that first knight. Of course, as befits his legacy, he is a swordsman without equal. Age has not dulled him at all. \'a1No, se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have heard about the fall of Dundrasil, s\'ed?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dundrasil was a mighty kingdom with a long history. And it was not destroyed on just any day\f2\emdash\f1 no, that was the day of the Colloquy of Kings, a very important meeting. Muy importante.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The whole kingdom was wiped out, just like that. Like a sandcastle caught in the tide. Now, only rubble remains.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And if the rumours are to be believed, the Darkspawn\f2\emdash\f1 the one who summoned the monsters that destroyed that great city\f2\emdash\f1 is at large once again. Ay de m\'ed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: C\'f3mo no. Of course, everybody knows that sorry tale. People here in Puerto Valor were very shocked when it happened.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say it was the Darkspawn who summoned the monsters that destroyed the city\f2\emdash\f1 the same Darkspawn that is now on the loose.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I believe them. The forces of darkness have grown more powerful with each day that has passed since his reappearance. I only hope they catch him soon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don Rodrigo may seem very macho and gruff, but really he is a very nice man. \'a1Muy amable! And of course, he is very moral. S\'ed, he is a true caballero. A knight among knights!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is because of him that Puerto Valor has become a peaceful and prosperous town. Gracias, Don Rodrigo...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh! It nearly slipped my mind! First-slime guests get a free mini medal! Ooze it wisely!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives a mini medal!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you goo and give it to the girl at the medal exchange right next to me, she'll probably swap it for something gooreat!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This hotel is the property of l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles! That's a posh school for goorls!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's oozually oozed for school trips, but sometimes regoolar people can stay here too! (slurp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's oozually oozed for school trips, but sometimes regoolar people can stay here too! (slurp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The se\'f1orita at the medal exchange, she told me she came here from all the way across the western mountains to collect mini medals.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... They must have some kind of special power if they can make a person do a thing like that. Seems totally loco to me...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This hotel, it is owned and operated by l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles. We don't usually allow members of the public to stay here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that doesn't mean we don't want you to have a wonderful stay. If there are any problems, just tell me, okay se\'f1or? Like, I don't know...if you see one of the maids slacking off or something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sea, it has been full of monsters lately. Es muy peligroso out there\f2\emdash\f1 very dangerous. I heard there was a super huge one down in Gondolia that means they can't even go out fishing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's all the Darkspawn's doing, I know it is. Somebody has to catch him, r\'e1pido!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We just got married, so we decided to come here on our honeymoon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must say, I think we made the right choice. The pace of life is so relaxed here. It wouldn't be a bad place to build a house, in fact.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know that you can get out into the open sea if you sail through the sea gates?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The gates aren't open at the moment, though. Isn't that a shame? I'd love to see what lies beyond them!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of the guests at our hotel, he is so elegant! \'a1Muy elegante! I don't think I have ever seen such style. He must be some kind of celebrity, I think...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have worked in this hotel for many years now, but still I am not tired of the sound of the waves. The sea sings a lullaby to me every day...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'a1Ay! I, I, I am only taking a teeny-tiny break! \'a1S\'f3lo un momento! Please, do not tell the head maid downstairs. She would... She would throw me into the sea!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well hello there, young man! I am LOVING your look! That's the kind of good taste you don't see every day\f2\emdash\f1 and I should know!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, since you're here, I've GOT to share this tip with you! There's all sorts of armour and accessories in the world, right? Right! Well, only some of them are stylish enough to change your look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And others won't change your look unless you wear the full set. They're difficult looks to pull off, but when you do... Oh my!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here, my book will tell you all you need to know. I'd read it right away if I were you\f2\emdash\f1 it'd be a tragedy to let your good taste go to waste.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives a book called \lquote The Girl's Guide to Looking Great\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell He reads it from cover to cover, and learns its incredible contents by heart! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dress your girlfriends up in the hats and outfits in there, and watch them transform before your very eyes!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The world's full of hidden fashion gems! All you have to do is dig them up! Who knows\f2\emdash\f1 maybe one day you'll even look as good as me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well hello there, young man! How I envy the adventures you're having in the world of fashion!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just remember, there's armour and accessories out there that can give people amazing new looks\f2\emdash\f1 but some of them will only work for you if you rock them as a set!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The world's full of hidden fashion gems! All you have to do is dig them up! Who knows\f2\emdash\f1 maybe one day you'll even look as good as me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have seen the hombre playing the guitar on the top of the sea gates, s\'ed? He is the best musician in all of Puerto Valor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In the evenings, he accompanies a dancer down on the beach. You must go and watch, amigo. There is no greater sight in this city.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She dances with so much passion. It is most enchanting\f2\emdash\f1 muy encantador!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it is the two performers working as one that is the key to the magic. Es muy impresionante. Very impressive indeed. We Valorians are very proud of them both.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nowadays, when people think of Puerto Valor, what do they think of? S\'ed\f2\emdash\f1 the casino. But this is only a recent addition to our town.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has changed everything. But not all for the bad\f2\emdash\f1 the turistas, they bring money, no? This is never a bad thing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mi hijo\f2\emdash\f1 my boy\f2\emdash\f1 he is taking the knightly training with Don Rodrigo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay, but I worry for him. Each night when he comes home, he is so exhausted, he goes straight to bed. Becoming a caballero is no easy path...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door won't budge.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the villa of Don Rodrigo. He is the most famous and honoured hombre in Puerto Valor. You may enter, but do not cause any trouble.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola se\'f1or. Did you know that Sir Hendrik is originally from Zwaardsrust, to the north-east of here? But that kingdom is now in ruins. Curse those monsters...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He lost his home, his family...todo\f2\emdash\f1 everything. He is lucky that the Heliodorians took him in and raised him.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ed, he has had a hard life. I cannot imagine... But perhaps this is what gives him his inner strength, mm?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfQu\'e9? A merchant carrying a colourful branch? Hmm... I saw a merchant come this way, but I did not see what he was carrying. Lo siento\f2\emdash\f1 sorry, friend.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I were you, I would ask Servantes. He is Don Rodrigo's butler. He knows everything that happens here in town.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come on! Don't start slacking just because Don Rodrigo isn't around! Harder! Put your backs into it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...What's that? You want me to train you? Ha! You wouldn't last five minutes, trust me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I used to be in the Heliodorian army, you know. I actually fought alongside Sir Hendrik himself, back when the monsters attacked Dundrasil.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It was already too late by the time we arrived on the scene, though. There was nothing we could do to stop them. So much was lost that day...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It left me feeling so empty... So when Don Rodrigo invited me here to become an instructor, I jumped at the chance.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are taking an evening stroll as well, s\'ed? I hear there is a dance performance taking place on the beach.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (pant) \'a1Uf! The training is hard, but I will do anything it takes to become a caballero like Sir Hendrik! I must become a knight! I must!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
He's fast asleep.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don Rodrigo was once married, you know. His wife was a kind and beautiful lady...but she died when she was still young. Such a tragedia...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And the fact that the son they had together has left Puerto Valor, and no one knows where he is... Ay, it only makes matters worse.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's a portrait hanging on the wall.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lo siento, se\'f1or. Forgive me, but Don Rodrigo is not in his chambers at the moment.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am afraid I will have to ask you to leave. Perhaps you can come back later?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the door to Don Rodrigo's chambers. Lo siento\f2\emdash\f1 I am sorry, but he is not present at the moment. Please speak with Servantes if you have urgent business.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don Rodrigo had a son\f2\emdash\f1 un hijo, s\'ed?\f2\emdash\f1 but he ran away from home a long, long time ago, before I started working here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say that Servantes was very upset when it happened. He was fond of the boy, it seems. It cannot be easy, not knowing where he is...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...A merchant with a colourful branch? S\'ed, he was here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He seemed keen on selling it and buying a villa with the proceeds.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But se\'f1or, I believe he has left town already. He said he was going to Octagonia to make his fortune\f2\emdash\f1 a journey that would involve a sea voyage to the east, toward the old kingdom of Zwaardsrust.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He did not seem like much, but to have one's heart so firmly fixed on making one's way in the world\f2\emdash\f1 this bespeaks a great determination indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The merchant with the colourful branch was here, s\'ed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But se\'f1or, I believe he has left town already. He said he was going to Octagonia to make his fortune\f2\emdash\f1 a journey that would involve a sea voyage to the east, toward the old kingdom of Zwaardsrust.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He did not seem like much, but to have one's heart so firmly fixed on making one's way in the world\f2\emdash\f1 this bespeaks a great determination indeed.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! Welcome to the one-token poker table! Just one little token for an exciting game of poker! How about that? Would you like to play?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfNo? Uf... Bien. Let me know if you change your mind. It's just one token to play, remember!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bf\'a1Qu\'e9!? But se\'f1or, you do not have any tokens! You cannot play poker without any tokens! You must visit the exchange counter at once!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! Welcome to the ten-token poker table! Just ten tokens for an exciting game of poker! Well? Would you like to play?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... That is a shame. Well, if you change your mind, I will be here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay ay ay! You do not have enough tokens, se\'f1or! Please purchase some at the exchange counter!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bf\'a1Qu\'e9!? Se\'f1or, you have no tokens! You will need to purchase some at the exchange counter before you can play!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Buenos d\'edas, se\'f1or. I am the official fortune teller of the casino. Would you like to know what your future holds?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... S\'ed... Sometimes it is better to believe that your destiny is in your own hands... \'a1Buena suerte, se\'f1or! Good luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'a1Je je je! I knew you would say that! Do not worry about the cost, chico. A man like you deserves his fortune told for free. Now, let me see...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hmmm... Hnnnggghhh... Unghhhhhh... \'a1S\'ed! \'a1S\'ed! The mists, they are clearing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Today you will experience great fortune on the slot machines! All the reels will match up for you today, se\'f1or! Just keep spinning, s\'ed?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Today you will experience great fortune on the Slime Quest Slots! You will win big for sure, se\'f1or!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Today you will experience great fortune at the poker table! Raise, raise, raise, and your courage will be richly rewarded!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, se\'f1or! You see that slime-topped tower? That is what we call the Jackpot Stack. And I am what we call the Jackpot Bunny.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Je je je! You look like you are new to all this, s\'ed? Would you like me to explain?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Je je je! Bien, let me tell you all about how jackpots work...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ohhh! Ni\'f1o, it's okay\f2\emdash\f1 you don't have to pretend you know everything to impress me! Why don't I explain it anyway? Just in case, s\'ed?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, you probably know this already, but a jackpot means a big win. One that gets you a huuuge pile of tokens.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: For example, if you are playing the slot machines, a row of sevens\f2\emdash\f1 77777\f2\emdash\f1 on a Silver Spin will get you the jackpot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, how big that jackpot will be depends on how many tokens have built up in the Jackpot Stack.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The more tokens there are, the more tokens you win! And how do tokens build up in the Stack? F\'e1cil\f2\emdash\f1 simple! More are added every day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But as soon as somebody wins a jackpot, the Stack goes back to where it began. So be watchful, se\'f1or, and don't let anybody sneak that Stack from behind your back!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And now for the part which makes you love me forever, cari\'f1o\f2\emdash\f1 I have a gift for knowing when a jackpot is going to come around! Maravilloso, right? All you need to do is ask!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think now you know everything you need to know about jackpots. So get out there and win one! \'a1Buena suerte, se\'f1or! Good luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! Would you like to hear all about jackpots one more time?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfNo? Then you must want to know how many tokens are in the jackpot tower, s\'ed? Vale. Let me check...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right now the maximum prize is... tokens! Remember, se\'f1or: the more you bet, the more you win!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Je je je! I've got a funny feeling that jackpot's going to be snatched up by somebody real soon!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay ay ay! I can feel it! I can feel it in my bones! There's a jackpot coming! It's just sitting there, waiting to be won!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola, amigo. You want a little tip for playing the Slime Quest Slots?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, hey\f2\emdash\f1 no need to be polite, uh? Let me give you my tip. It won't hurt to hear it, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1S\'ed! Of course you do! Bien, here it comes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The machines...they have...moods. Like a person, s\'ed? And naturalmente, it is easier to win if your machine is in a good mood.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And how do you know which machines are in the mood to pay out big, I hear you ask? Easy peasy! \'a1Muy f\'e1cil! You just ask me! I am here every day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's no response. It looks like this machine isn't ready just yet.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to the Casino Valor, where dreams come true!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will need tokens if you wish to play any of our games, se\'f1or. You can buy these at the counter downstairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfC\'f3mo est\'e1s, amigo? How is it going, friend? Are you winning big?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are on a roll, s\'ed? \'a1Magn\'edfico! Do not stop now! You must keep raising the stakes! \'a1Venga, venga!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1No hay problema, se\'f1or! It's okay\f2\emdash\f1 your luck will change soon enough. All you must do is keep gambling!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Always remember this, se\'f1or\f2\emdash\f1 it doesn't matter how many tokens you have, you cannot change them back into gold coins.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have seen plenty of customers spend their last dinero on tokens, but I would advise against it if you're short on gold coins. Never gamble more than you can afford to lose.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... Me 'ouse of cards is all finished... (snort) And it's me best one yet... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The hombre who is sleeping? Every day he builds a house of cards here, then he falls fast asleep.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And every day, somebody comes and knocks it over. He just starts right up again the next morning...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Gan\'e9! I won! \'a1Je je! I won big, and I cannot stop smiling! Once again, my prayers have been answered! \'a1Aleluya!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I must learn to quit while I am ahead... Once again, I lost everything I had won... Ay de m\'ed, I am cursed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ed, I won, and I won big! Now I must decide how to spend my tokens...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Say, se\'f1or...are you feeling lucky today? I like people who are lucky...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes if they are very lucky, I let them take me on a date...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: This next jackpot's got my name on it! Once I set my sights on something, I don't give up till it's mine\f2\emdash\f1 that's why they call me the Hunter back home!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: For goodness' sake! I've managed to spend all my money again! I suppose I'd better head to the bank. Better just have one more drink to fortify myself first...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...What's that? You'd like to know where the bank is? Why, it's right next to the entrance, of course! You really can't miss it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ere, you wanna know 'ow to win on the Slime Quest Slots? It's easy, mate\f2\emdash\f1 you just need to keep an eye on the little pictures spinnin' round, and time your pushin' just right.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Learn 'ow to do that, an' you're golden! Heh heh! ...Wot's the matter? Don't believe it can be done? Then 'ow d'you fink I make me livin', eh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This lady's going to tell me which table I need to be at in order to win big! Can you believe it!? I'm so excited!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay de m\'ed... Now what do I do!? I followed the fortune teller's advice, but I won nothing! \'a1Nada! And now all my money is gone...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a guard here. I look out for people trying to tamper with the slot machines. It happens more often than you would think.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ere, you wanna know somefink amazin' about these slot machines?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They ain't yer common or garden ones\f2\emdash\f1 they're special Slime Quest Slots! 'Ow's about that, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you wanna know wot's really special about 'em? It's up to you when to stop the reels!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I bet that's got yer button-pushin' finger twitchin', eh? Go on, give it a whirl! Just don't get too carried away, alright? Heh heh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pull the other one, mate! 'Course you do! So I'm gonna tell ya...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems that the three poker dealers are sisters...and I can't decide which one I like best!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's probably the one who's on the hundred-token table, though. I mean, she won't play with just anyone. There's something special about her!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola, cutie-pie! Why not play some poker with the youngest and cutest of the Delicious Dealer Sisters!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It will only cost you one token, so it's perfect if you are learning how to play! Just sit down and join in!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, se\'f1or! You must not look at the other players' cards, s\'ed? It is not fair!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why not sit down and play with us? It will only cost you ten tokens a hand.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are you interested in playing some real poker, se\'f1or? Then you should come play with the big boys\f2\emdash\f1 and the big sister! Each hand costs 100 tokens.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but to be honest, I think you are a little too young for such high stakes stuff.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps you should come back when you are a little bit older and wiser, no? I would not want to make you cry...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lo siento, se\'f1or. These machines have only just been installed. They are not ready to play yet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you should definitely come back when they have been set up! They are very special! \'a1Muy emocionante!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Puerto Valor, the city of blossoms and sea breeze! No one has bluer water or whiter sands than we do! \'a1No se\'f1or!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, we are also famous for our mighty sea gates. The sight of a grand vessel sailing through them and out into the open sea is truly magn\'edfico!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, se\'f1or! Do you want to hear something exciting? There is a se\'f1orita in the hotel who will give you rare treasures in exchange for mini medals! How about that, huh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I spoke to her before, and she told me she went to a special boarding school for girls somewhere near some mountains! I want to go there too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have come here on holiday from a snowy kingdom far to the north. We have always wanted to see the ocean before we got too old.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We come from Sniflheim, up in the far north. It is not a bad place at all. You should certainly visit if you have the chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: We come from Sniflheim, up in the far north. It's not a bad place at all. You should certainly visit if you have the chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Time really does flow more slowly here in Puerto Valor, I think. It must be nice for tourists to leave the city and come here to relax, no?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The ancient tales tell of six brightly coloured orbs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say that each was kept in its own kingdom. But now half of those kingdoms are no more...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you take the Valor-Sauvage Channel out to sea and then head north along the coast, you'll eventually come to a kingdom called Sniflheim. They do all sorts of magical research there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're also supposed to have an exceptionally beautiful queen. It'd be nice to visit one day...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've heard rumours about some ancient ruins near a mountain village to the west of here. It all sounds very exotic.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it's completely hemmed in by steep cliffs, apparently. You can't even get there by ship. I don't expect I'll be paying a visit any time soon, then...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bien. It is done. The villa has been sold! I am a little surprised, to be honest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has an estupendo view of the ocean, but the asking price was high\f2\emdash\f1 and yet the buyer did not even blink!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: On the western side of the street in the centre of town\f2\emdash\f1 the side with the staircase\f2\emdash\f1 there is a villa that was for sale...but I have sold it now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has an estupendo view of the ocean, but the asking price was high\f2\emdash\f1 and yet the buyer did not even blink!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You think I am looking at the pretty girls on the beach? \'a1No se\'f1or! I am keeping an eye on the horizon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must watch for the Darkspawn\f2\emdash\f1 if he made it to the ruins of Dundrasil, then nowhere is safe...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard the news from Octagonia? The pair that won this year's MMA tournament was made up of last year's champion and a total unknown!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's pretty impressive, isn't it? Most people couldn't hope to win on their first try, even with such a seasoned pro for a partner.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ed, our seafood is muy famous. \'bfPor qu\'e9? Because we only use the freshest fish, straight from the ocean!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are going on a journey soon, s\'ed? Caramba... Then I must warn you\f2\emdash\f1 if you hear a beautiful song out at sea, cover your ears immediately. \'a1Inmediatamente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have heard that there are creatures\f2\emdash\f1 half human, half fish\f2\emdash\f1 that sing sailors to sleep, and sink their ships. Be careful out there, amigo!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho! Come to have a look around my new villa, have you? Well, go right ahead. Fill your boots!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You wouldn't think I'd make enough profit off one little bit of wood to buy a place like this, would you?\par
*: But I bought this funny coloured branch in Gallopolis for next to nothing, and sold it in Octagonia for an absolute fortune!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Se\'f1or Hendrik, he trained here, but originally he is from Zwaardsrust, far to the north-east. That place is in ruins now, of course. Destroyed by monsters...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I have heard people talk about a beautiful purple sphere they used to have there. I wonder if is somewhere in the ruins...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... The Darkspawn has been seen among the ruins of Dundrasil... He has given Sir Hendrik the slip, and is still at large... This is bad... Muy mal...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First Sir Jasper, and now Sir Hendrik. If the finest knights of Heliodor cannot catch him, maybe no one can...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell I will open the sea gates for you. Board your ship and be ready to set sail, por favor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell Your ship is currently anchored on the Costa Valor, s\'ed? Bien. Once you have boarded, you must steer her hard to starboard.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This door leads to Don Rodrigo's chambers, but he is not present at the moment. He has gone to Heliodor to instruct the guards in the way of the sword.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, it is you. You are sailing out into the open ocean, s\'ed? Uf... The ocean is full of monsters, se\'f1or. Make sure you are well prepared before you depart.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Je je! You are sailing out onto the high seas, eh? Well, be sure not to become lost, se\'f1or! Consult the map before raising the anchor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, I have heard rumours of sailors venturing into certain parts of the ocean never to be seen again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Puerto Valor, the city of blossoms and sea breeze! No one has bluer water or whiter beaches than us. \'a1No se\'f1or!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, we are also famous for our mighty sea gates. The sight of a grand vessel sailing through the gates and out into the open sea is truly magnificent!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfQu\'e9? You will soon venture through the sea gates yourself! \'a1Ah, muy bien! I hope you have a wonderful adventure, se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Welcome to Puerto Valor, the city of blossoms and sea breeze! No one has bluer water or whiter sands than we do! \'a1No se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are standing above the Valor-Sauvage Channel. It flows out of the city, across the Champs Sauvage, and out into the open sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is why it is known as the gateway to Erdrea. It grants ships from the inner kingdoms access to the ocean waves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are heading for the open sea yourself? \'a1Magn\'edfico! I am very jealous, se\'f1or!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Buenos d\'edas, se\'f1or! Welcome to Puerto Valor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bf...Qu\'e9? You are sailing out into the open ocean? Bien. Just be sure to prepare well before you depart. Things are very different on the other side of the gates...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're sailing out into the open sea? Gosh... You're a lot braver than me\f2\emdash\f1 I've heard that the world out there is wild and uncivilised...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but I suppose that's precisely why it appeals to you, eh? Well, I hope you enjoy your adventure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know that you can get out into the open sea if you sail through the sea gates?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Se\'f1or Servantes has looked troubled ever since he opened the sea gates. He looks as if he has seen a ghost...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell\par
I saw him. On the ship... And yet\f2\emdash\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell\par
...Hm? Oh, it is you. Se\'f1or Roberto's friend, s\'ed? His ship is but a spot on the horizon by now, I am sure.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell That reminds me of a rumour I heard... About a place in the ocean where ships disappear... Some say they are transported to another world...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell Ay, I am sure it is just a story. But still, it is good to be careful out on the high seas.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell\par
Sailors often speak of a spot in the ocean...one that ships enter and yet never leave. Some say they are transported to another world...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Servantes\cell Ay, I am sure it is just a story. But still, it is good to be careful out on the high seas.\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs24\par
1.13 \cf0\f0 L'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles\cf1\b0\f1\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The statue is called \lquote La Collectrice\rquote . It depicts an elegant young lady picking up a gold medal in a distinctly dignified fashion. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bonjour, traveller, and welcome to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In zis school, ze daughters of ze finest families in all Erdrea assemble, and train to become young ladies extraordinaires.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bonsoir, traveller, and welcome to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In zis school, ze daughters of ze finest families in all Erdrea assemble, and train to become young ladies extraordinaires.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello there! Welcome to the Acad\'e9mie. Have you met Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9, the headmaster? He collects mini medals from all over the world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking for him, you should try his study. It's the little cottage just inside the main building. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aren't these flowers pretty? Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 likes the lilies of the valley best of all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He says the way their little white petals catch the eye reminds him of mini medals. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello there! Welcome to the Acad\'e9mie. Have you met Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9, the headmaster? He collects mini medals from all over the world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking for him, you should try his study. It's the little cottage just inside the main building. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The lilies of the valley might look pretty, but they hide a dark secret.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They're incredibly poisonous\f2\emdash\f1 if you accidentally ate even a single petal, you might not leave these gardens alive! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No matter what age they enrol at, young ladies must undergo seven years of rigorous training before they are allowed to graduate from the Acad\'e9mie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is my fifth year. When I first arrived, I was so homesick, I cried for my parents every night. Now, I can't imagine living anywhere else! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day, sir. We are the proud members of Les M\'e9damoiselles Magnifiques\f2\emdash\f1 an exclusive club for only the most dedicated disciples of grace and elegance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are currently practising the proper way to pick up a mini medal. No self-respecting lady would ever collect one any way but this! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good evening, sir. This table is reserved exclusively for the honourable members of Les M\'e9damoiselles Magnifiques.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Supper is a daily test of a lady's true elegance. When lifting the bread, one must always remember to keep one's little finger perfectly perpendicular! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've only just joined this school, so I don't really know what a M\'e9damoiselle is. It's some kind of cake, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I keep doing what the big girls say, do you think they'll let me have one? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, are you the new student everyone's talking about? Tee hee! I'm not the new girl any more\f2\emdash\f1 you are!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you ever have any problems, or if you're ever feeling homesick, come straight to me. I'll help you out till you settle in, don't worry! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've only just joined this school, so I don't really know what a M\'e9damoiselle is. It's some kind of cake, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All this posh food is nice and everything, but I'm starting to miss my mum's home cooking. What I wouldn't give for a nice bowl of hot, brown stew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you're the new student everyone's talking about, aren't you? It's such a shame you're not allowed to live in the dormitory with us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, you're a boy and all, and the rules are the rules, but still\f2\emdash\f1 the food they give us here is scrumptious! I expect you have to eat with the teachers or something? Eurgh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, I'm not a bad slime\f2\emdash\f1 I'm a goo slime! I'm practising how to pick up mini medals like a gooraceful lady!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: With my bouncy body, I can goorab them ten times faster than anyone else! Look at me goo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mum's the queen of the slimes, but she somehow finds the slime to write me a goojillion letters. Here, listen to this latest one...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote How are you, my little Squishikins? Mummy's bouncing along as well as ever, and the kingdom's gooing from strength to strength.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Yesterday, your daddy and I auditioned yet another gooroup of potential suitors, but none came close to being worthy of you. The hunt for Prince Charming continooze...\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Honestly, I've told her till I'm blue in the face\f2\emdash\f1 I'll find my own squidgenificant other! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Honestly, I do wish my mum would stop trying to find me a squidgenificant other\f2\emdash\f1 I'm gooing to look for one myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Come to think of it, you're goorgeous! I'll write and tell her the search is over! (slurp) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The ideal form that we seek to recreate is that of La Collectrice, the figure immortalised in bronze in the school gardens.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is based on the Acad\'e9mie's very first chef de classe, Lady Minette Maximilien. Ahh, if I could have but a fraction of her grace! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When my mother graduated from the Acad\'e9mie, she held the position of chef de classe\f2\emdash\f1 head girl, you might say\f2\emdash\f1 just like her own mother, and her mother's mother before her.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot be the one to tarnish my family's inestimable honour! I will become chef de classe if it is the last thing I do! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, missster! My name's Chantelle! Do you remember all the words to our ssschool sssong? Shall I give you a reminder? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Alright, get ready to sssing along! Here comes the official ssschool sssong of l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles! Ahem!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell 'Neath the branches of the birches \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Daffodils sssway and ssswiiing \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Here among the graceful gardens \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Budding young ladies sssiiing! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell We'll ssstride acrosss the wide, wide world \f3\u9834?\f1\par
And hunt for mini medals low and hiiigh \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell But our heartsss live forever in \f3\u9834?\f1\par
L'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Wow, you've remembered the whole sssong already? You're amazing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nothing complimentsss a deliciousss dinner better than sssome beautiful music! I, Chantelle the chanteussse, ssstand ready to sssing for your sssupper!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell What do you sssay? Would you like me to sssing a sssong for you? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Alright then! For my firssst piece, I will sssing a ballad we all know and love\f2\emdash\f1 the ssschool sssong! Ahem!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell 'Neath the branches of the birches \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Daffodils sssway and ssswiiing \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Here among the graceful gardens \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Budding young ladies sssiiing! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell We'll ssstride acrosss the wide, wide world \f3\u9834?\f1\par
And hunt for mini medals low and hiiigh \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell But our heartsss live forever in \f3\u9834?\f1\par
L'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Oh... Well, alright, then... But come back and lisssten to me sssoon, won't you? In the meantime, I'll keep practisssing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Chantelle has such a lovely singing voice.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even Monsieur Mangetout is moved! Look at the way he's moving his little nose up and down\f2\emdash\f1 he's obviously choking back the tears! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Don't tell anyone I told you this, Monsieur Mangetout, but Zazie hasn't been coming back to her room at night.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She'll get in so much trouble if the teachers find out. What in the world can she be doing out there? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say the Acad\'e9mie was founded by the king of a faraway country, but I don't think that's true.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All the kings I've read about live in enormous castles with vaults overflowing with gold, silver and jewels. Why would anyone as rich as that be interested in collecting mini medals? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Purscilla has been acting very strangely recently. I'm so worried about her, I can't get a wink of sleep.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's not paying any attention in class, and I sometimes hear her sobbing into her pillow at night. I've asked her what's wrong, but she won't tell me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She was such a cheery girl before, but now all she does is pout. Whatever could have happened to her? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Purscilla is such a nuisance. She used to keep me up all night with her sobbing, but now she's started talking in her sleep instead.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote I won't give up!\rquote , \lquote I still have a chance!\rquote , \lquote He will be mine!\rquote ... I haven't a clue what she's talking about, but I wish she'd give it a rest. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There are two things you need to become a master fisherperson: a never-say-die attitude......and patience.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's the same with collecting mini medals\f2\emdash\f1 though the road you tread may be dark and dangerous......it might also lead you to great treasures! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This school's a really nice place, but the best thing about it is......the food!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ......It's very good. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I, I wasn't running in the corridor, I swear! I was just walking really, really quickly! Can't you tell the difference? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Aha! You're HIM, aren't you? The very first honorary student in the history of the Acad\'e9mie! And you're a boy! What a shocker! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: There's a girl in the prep room who only appears at night. She said she wanted to play with me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I snuck out of my room to go and see her, but I got caught, and now I won't be able to keep my promise... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm afraid I'm something of a clean freak. I keep the corridors spick and span, but the library is so dark and dusty, I simply don't know where to begin!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure the books must be very valuable\f2\emdash\f1 our school is ever such a good one, after all\f2\emdash\f1 but they're all so musty and mouldy and...old!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I'm sure an adventurer like yourself would find them an absolute gold mine of useful information...if you could bear the pong. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Didn't I go with you just the other evening to get that book you forgot from the prep room? Well, there wasn't anyone there then, was there?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's because no one has any business being there after dark\f2\emdash\f1 including you! Whoever you think you saw, you must have dreamed her. Now stop roaming the halls and go to bed! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My grandma's a famous botanist\f2\emdash\f1 that means she studies plants. When she was a little girl, she came to the Acad\'e9mie too, just like me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She told me that this tree is a vessel for the memories of Yggdrasil, but I've never been able to work out what she meant.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before I graduate, I'm going to find out what's so special about it so I can be a botanist just like Grandma!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell Now to ze formalities. First of all, take zis\f2\emdash\f1 your very own album de m\'e9dailles!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell ...De quoi!? What is zis you are saying? You already 'ave an album de m\'e9dailles from ze miniature medal exchange in Puerto Valor?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell I knew it was a bonne id\'e9e to open zat office! I 'ave zem 'and out albums to able adventurers in ze 'opes of finding a medal collector maximal\f2\emdash\f1 and now, I 'ave found you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell Now zat you are enrolled as an honorary student of ze Acad\'e9mie, I can give you access to ze full package for elite medal detectors only! Allow me to upgrade your album to its maximum capacity! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Maxime adds more pages to <pc>'s album de m\'e9dailles! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell For each and every mini medal zat you bring to me, I will add a minuscule stamp to ze album!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell And ze more stamps you collect, ze more maximally magnificent your rewards will be!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell Now go, young man! Your quest to collect ze maximum number of mini medals 'as officially begun! Seek zem out, pick zem up and bring zem to me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell ...Now, to ze formalities. Firstly, take zis\f2\emdash\f1 it is an object of maximal importance! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the album de m\'e9dailles! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell Ze album is used to keep track of 'ow many mini medals a student collects during 'er\f2\emdash\f1 or in your case, 'is\f2\emdash\f1 time at ze Acad\'e9mie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell For each and every mini medal zat you bring to me, I will add a minuscule stamp to its pages.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell And ze more stamps you collect, ze more maximally magnificent your rewards will be!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Monsieur le Principal Maxime M\'e9daill\'e9\cell Now go, young man! Your quest to collect ze maximum number of mini medals 'as officially begun! Seek zem out, pick zem up and bring zem to me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie overflows with ze youthful exub\'e9rance of its students. Sometimes, zat spirit is so strong, a little is left behind even after a pupil departs zis world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alors, can you not feel it in zis very classroom? ...Ah, but forgive me, monsieur\f2\emdash\f1 I am forgetting my duties. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When ze world of ze living is fast asleep, zose 'oo are no longer living may return to walk among us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In ze dead of night, per'aps you too will chance upon a wayward spirit. But enough of zat for now\f2\emdash\f1 allow me to attend to your own eternal soul. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\'d6\'b1\'bd\'d3\'d4\'92\f4\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie overflows with ze youthful exub\'e9rance of its students. Sometimes, zat spirit is so strong, a little is left behind even after a pupil departs zis world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alors, can you not feel it in zis very classroom? ...Ah, but forgive me, monsieur\f2\emdash\f1 I am forgetting my duties. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes, when I am alone in zese rooms at night, I feel a strange sensation, as if I am being watched... Yet still I come 'ere. I find ze silence very...agr\'e9able.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zis classroom, particuli\'e8rement, is as quiet as ze grave... Ah, but you did not come here to talk of ze afterlife, hein? Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Monsieur, if you are trying to frighten me, it will not work. I 'ave ze gift. I can sense zat no ghosts or ghouls are 'ere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And if zey were, I would exorcise zem right away! It is my duty to keep zese 'alls free of mischievous spirits.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Listen to me, girls\f2\emdash\f1 you must never, ever set foot in ze Eerie Eyrie! Ze entire path to ze east is strictly interdit! It is forbidden to go zere!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zat valley is ruled over by a cruel and covetous elysium bird. If ever zat feathered fiend sees anything shiny, 'e seizes it in 'is talons and takes it 'ome to 'is nest!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If 'e should catch sight of ze twinkle of your beautiful eyes, girls\f2\emdash\f1 zose orbes brillants\f2\emdash\f1 'e would surely think them priceless jewels, and pluck zem from your 'eads!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you do not believe me about 'ow 'orrible zat place is, zere is a book in ze biblioth\'e8que zat will tell you all ze gruesome details. I advise you to read it from couverture to couverture! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Encore une fois! You must never, ever set foot in ze Eerie Eyrie! Ze entire path to ze east is strictly interdit! It is forbidden to go zere!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zat valley is ruled over by a cruel and covetous elysium bird. If ever zat feathered fiend sees anything shiny, 'e seizes it in 'is talons and takes it 'ome to 'is nest!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If 'e should catch sight of ze twinkle of your beautiful eyes, girls\f2\emdash\f1 zose orbes brillants\f2\emdash\f1 'e would surely think them priceless jewels, and pluck zem from your 'eads!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you do not believe me about 'ow 'orrible zat place is, zere is a book in ze biblioth\'e8que zat will tell you all ze gruesome details. I advise you to read it from couverture to couverture! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A child's curiosit\'e9 is a wonderful thing, but if left unchecked, it can lead to results dangereux. Zat is why we 'ave a strict curfew.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, ze Acad\'e9mie is but a stone's throw from ze Eerie Eyrie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zat valley is ruled over by a cruel and covetous elysium bird. If ever zat feathered fiend sees anything shiny, 'e seizes it in 'is talons and takes it 'ome to 'is nest!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To learn ze true horreur of zis beast, go to ze biblioth\'e8que\f2\emdash\f1 we 'ave a book zere zat will tell you all about 'im.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. I'm Candida, the chef de classe. It's my role to look after the other girls and keep them in line, but they really don't make it easy for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Take young Livvie, for instance\f2\emdash\f1 why, just the other day, she saw an elysium bird carrying a silver sphere in its claws, and decided to chase after it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell If she'd followed it all the way to the Eerie Eyrie, we might never have seen her again. Ooh, it gives me the shivers just thinking about it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\par
\lquote A mini medal's small and shiny,\par
The open ocean's big and briny,\par
But bigger isn't better all the time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\lquote I'd rather fill my pockets full,\par
With discs, small, gold and beautiful,\par
Than have to hang my trousers on the line!\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Whenever I read Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's poetry to a restless student, it sends them straight to sleep. He's a real lifesaver! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell I'm Clo\'e9, and this is my sister Cl\'e9o. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell If you ever have trouble telling us apart, there's an easy way to do it\f2\emdash\f1 just remember that Cl\'e9o's the clever one, and Clo\'e9's the clod! Or is it the other way around? Tee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell Now even I've forgotten which one is which! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell I'm Clo\'e9, and this is my sister Cl\'e9o. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell So you're the honorary student they told us about, are you? I love your hair. It looks so silky and smooth... Ooh, I want to run my fingers through it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell I expect my sister will say exactly the same thing. We're twins, after all. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell I'm Cl\'e9o, and this is my sister Clo\'e9. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell Did you know that twins have special powers? We can always tell what the other one is thinking without even saying a word.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell Mother says it's because we share the same leaf on Yggdrasil's branches. So however far apart we may be, our spirits are always together. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell I'm Cl\'e9o, and this is my sister Clo\'e9. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell So you're the honorary student they told us about, are you? Hmm... Well, your hair's nice and shiny, but other than that, I don't see what's so special about you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell I expect my sister will say exactly the same thing. We're twins, after all. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Madame Waloppe's lessons are SOOO boring! Every question she asks us is easy-peasy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I mustn't blame her, I suppose. Everything's easy for a genius like me. My first words were the entire text of the Song of Erdwin in ancient Erdrean!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, I was just a baby at the time, so I don't remember actually reciting it...or any of the Song itself...but it definitely happened! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Candida has such a pleasant voice. There's no one I'd rather have read me a book at bedtime.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not that she's picked a very good one today. It's a collection of Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's poetry, and it's so boring, I can barely...keep my eyes open... (yawn) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not naturally gifted like some of the other girls, but I worked really, really hard to get into this school.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, once I saw the uniform, nothing was going to stop me coming here! It's just so...chic! It was designed by the legendary Jean-Paul Coatier, don't you know!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After I graduate, I'm going to join his studio, study under the master himself and become the greatest fashion designer this world has ever seen! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not naturally gifted like some of the other girls, but I worked really, really hard to get into this school.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I'm so glad I did. Not only was the school uniform designed by the legendary Jean-Paul Coatier, but these nightdresses were too! Aren't they just divine?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After I graduate, I'm going to join his studio, study under the master himself and become the greatest fashion designer this world has ever seen! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm embroidering handkerchiefs for my little brothers back home.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The money they get for selling them pays for their food and clothes, so I can't go to sleep until I've finished at least twenty more... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc>'s nostrils are suddenly filled with an intensely flowery fragrance... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: BonJOOourgh, monsiEURGH! My nAME's MalODORine DElamoOORrrgue. Do yOU like MY perFUUUMe?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Malodorine Delamorgue\cell All mY FRIends in schOOL say I'm the pretTIEst-SMELLing wALKing cORpse thEY'Ve EVer mET! Tee HEe heeEGH!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc>'s nostrils are suddenly filled with an intensely flowery fragrance... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: BonSOOoirgh, monsiEURGH! My nAME's MalODORine DElamoOORrrgue. Do yOU like MY perFUUUMe?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Malodorine Delamorgue\cell All mY FRIends in schOOL say I'm the pretTIEst-SMELLing wALKing cORpse thEY'Ve EVer mET! Tee HEe heeEGH!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote All that Glitters Is Soon Gone \f2\endash\f1  A Tale of Condors and Criminality, by Davide Attenville.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Deep in the eastern reaches of the Champs Sauvage, a secluded valley sits high in the mountains. The locals call it the Eerie Eyrie, for it is the nesting place of that most infernal of flying fiends\f2\emdash\f1 the elysium bird.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Like many of its smaller avian cousins, the beast shows a compulsive interest in objects that twinkle and glisten, and will roam far and wide in search of such treasures.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote The most egregious example of this behaviour occurred quite recently, when a particularly aggressive individual attacked a nearby manor house.\par
\lquote The beast tore through the very roof of the building, and made away with a large silver orb\f2\emdash\f1 the most priceless heirloom of the noble family who dwelt there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote The monster was thought to have taken the orb back to the Eyrie, but a party sent to recover it never returned. It seems likely that both they and the treasure they sought will never be seen again...\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm the biggest bookworm in the Acad\'e9mie. I've read every single volume in this library from cover to cover.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking for an interesting read, I can highly recommend \lquote All That Glitters Is Soon Gone\rquote . It's all about the elysium bird that lives in the valley to the east.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All\'f4, ch\'e9ri! Zis is ze Acad\'e9mie dormitory, where all our lovely little ladies eat, sleep...and dream!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Normally ze bedrooms are strictly off limits for boys, but for you, I make an exception. ...Well? Will you be staying wiz us ce soir? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zen I will say bonne nuit. Sweet dreams, ch\'e9ri! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good morning! I 'ope you 'ad a restful night. Remember, zere is a bed for you 'ere whenever you need it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh l\'e0 l\'e0... Don't be so shy, ch\'e9ri!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know ch\'e9ri, you are ze first young man 'oo 'as ever been allowed to wander freely around ze Acad\'e9mie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Normalement, any boy 'oo attempts to enter is turned away at ze gates by Monsieur Gardinier, ze groundsman.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You must be someone tr\'e8s, tr\'e8s special for Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 to welcome you wiz open arms...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ave you met ma petite s\f7\u339?ur\f2\emdash\f7 my little sister? She runs ze miniature medal exchange in Puerto Valor. We look very alike, so people often confuse us for each other.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wah! I g-g-get so nervous when I speak to strangers, my tentacles won't stop wobbling...b-b-but I'll do my best. Here g-g-goos... (gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: P-P-Please, don't stand so close to me... You're m-m-making me goo all wobbly...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\'d6\'b1\'bd\'d3\'d4\'92\f4\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f7\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\f4\'83\'4a\'83\'45\'83\'93\'83\'5e\'81\'5b\'89\'7a\'82\'b5\'82\'c9\'98\'62\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f7\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...A-Are you still busy adventuring at this slime of night? I know\f2\emdash\f7 I'll cheer you on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Goo, goo, goo... Goo, goo, goo... Er... Ooze the gooreatest? <pc> is...! Umm, I hope that helped...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'96\'e9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\'d6\'b1\'bd\'d3\'d4\'92\f4\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f7\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Cooking for zese girls is a true test of endurance! You think zey are delicate little flowers, nibbling away on raindrops and sunbeams? Peh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Non, zey are ravenous monsters wiz bottomless pits where zeir stomachs should be! No matter 'ow much I pile on zeir plates, zey lick zem clean and beg for more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, \lquote you are what you eat\rquote , as zey say. Zese debutantes-to-be are lucky I use only ze finest ingredients! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You want to know what is on ze menu tonight, hein? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a culinary tour de force, even if I say so myself! Ze centrepiece will be my saucissons Dundrasillais\f2\emdash\f7 a r\f1\'e9imagination of an ancient Drasilian delicacy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Place one of zese sausages in a freshly baked bun made wiz ze finest Zwaardsrustian wheat, add some delicious oignons from ze mountainous 'eights of Pang Lai, et voil\'e0\f2\emdash\f1 ze All-Erdrean 'Ot Dog!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tonight's soup is ze cr\'e8me de l\'e9gumes, and for dessert, we 'ave g\'e2teau aux fraises from ze finest p\'e2tisserie in Gondolia, and exotic fruits fresh from Lonalulu!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Each and every item on ze menu is packed full of vitamins, minerals...et l'amour! Eat your fill, and you too may grow to be a lovely lady, just like my girls! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh...zen you 'ave come to 'elp me, per'aps? Merci, ch\'e9ri\f2\emdash\f1 thank you for ze kind offer, but I 'ave done all ze 'ard work already! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello! I'm Madeleine. I'm the head dinner monitor! Do you want to know what's on the menu tonight? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell Tee hee! Then I'll tell you! Madame Croque will be serving her speciality\f2\emdash\f1 Drasilian sausages!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell If you put one in a freshly baked bun made with Zwaardsrustian wheat and add some fried onions from Pang Lai, it makes an amazing hot dog!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell Tonight's soup is cream of vegetable, and for dessert, we have strawberry cake from the finest bakery in Gondolia, and exotic fruits fresh from Lonalulu!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell Tee hee hee! My mouth's watering just thinking about it! Dinner time can't come quickly enough!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell Whaaat!? You don't care what's for dinner!? What's wrong with you!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hello! It's me, Madeleine\f2\emdash\f1 the head dinner monitor! What do you think of tonight's spread? It's wonderful, isn't it? Ohhh, I'm so happy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your hair is just...gorgeous! And those big blue eyes... Swoon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd love to talk more, but my friend here would just get jealous. Maybe I'll see you around somewhere? Bye for now, handsome!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your hair is just...gorgeous! And those big blue eyes... Swoon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'd love to talk more, but my friend here would just get jealous. Maybe I'll see you around somewhere? Bye for now, handsome!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hey, guess what I'm thinking about. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Umm... Are you thinking about those fairies you saw at the bottom of the garden? Or maybe you're imagining what it would be like to dance at a Heliodorian ball? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Don't joke. You know that when I look into your eyes, I can't think of anything else... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Tee hee! Oh, you're such a silly billy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I don't want to go to sleep yet. Do you know why? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You're not scared of having a nightmare, are you? Honestly, sometimes it's like having a first year for a room-mate! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: No, that's not it. It's just that whenever I close my eyes...I miss you so much. I feel like my heart's going to burst. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Tee hee! Oh, you're such a silly billy! If you really want to, you can see me in your dreams! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm Bashtienne, editor-in-chief of the school newsletter, \lquote Le Mini Monde\rquote ...not that you'd know it from this big, blank-blank-blank space on the noticeboard.\par
*: I'd just finished tacking up this month's issue when it got caught-caught-caught by the breeze and blew out of the window!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell And to top-top-top it all off, it was an all new-new-new format! It even had the long-awaited \lquote Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie\rquote  column\f2\emdash\f1 advice for the lovelorn from Madame Ch\'e9rie herself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell I've already taken all the letters out of the tray thing for the printing press. It would take forever to put-put-put it all together again...\par
I suppose I'll just have to write-write-write this month's issue off and start work on the next one... Ohhh, but it was so good!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm Bashtienne, editor-in-chief of the school newsletter, \lquote Le Mini Monde\rquote ...not that you'd know it from this big, blank-blank-blank space on the noticeboard.\par
*: I'd just finished tacking up this month's issue when it got caught-caught-caught by the breeze and blew out of the window!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell And to top-top-top it all off, it was an all new-new-new format! It even had the long-awaited \lquote Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie\rquote  column\f2\emdash\f1 advice for the lovelorn from Madame Ch\'e9rie herself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell Were you hoping to get-get-get some advice yourself? I'm sorry, but it would take me far too long to reprint it. I've decided to write-write-write this issue off and start work on the next one instead.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell If you're absolutely desperate to read the Madame Ch\'e9rie column, you'll just have to hunt-hunt-hunt down the one and only copy. It looked like it blew-blew-blew off somewhere to the north.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hola, darling! I'm training to be just like my idol\f2\emdash\f1 an absolutely fabulous masked martial artist who goes by the name of Sterling Sylva!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can do a decent impression of the cool way he talks and all those dramatic gestures he does, but the one thing I haven't been able to replicate is his amazing physique\f2\emdash\f1 not yet, anyway!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't want to go to bed! Every second I spend lying down is time I could be spending training to be like my idol, the fabulous Sterling Sylva!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can do a decent impression of the cool way he talks and all those dramatic gestures he does, but the one thing I haven't been able to replicate is his amazing physique\f2\emdash\f1 not yet, anyway!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmph! You're a bold one, sneaking into the girls' dormitory after hours! I'm sure Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 would like to know just how honourable his new honorary student really is!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, one can't help but admire your gumption. If the dashing, daring Sterling Sylva were in your place, I expect he'd do the exact same thing! Tee hee! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pssst! Do you want to hear something that's gooing to blow your mind? This hut is actually the holiday home of a mini medal loving monarch!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He comes to stay here whenever he wants to get in touch with how a mini medal feels, hidden away in the shadooze!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Rich people have such silly ideas all the slime!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The Rainbough starts to glow. One of the Orbs must be nearby! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Caw! What are you doing here, humans? If you're thinking of feathering your nest with MY treasure, you've got another thing coming! CAAAW!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Yesss! We've finally got our hands on the Silver Orb! Whoever would have thought we'd find it all the way up here?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell But don't rest on your laurels just yet, <pc>\f2\emdash\f1 we can't stop searching till we've found all six!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The Rainbough starts to glow brighter than ever before! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'c9coutez-moi! Zis world may seem like a wonderful place to you\f2\emdash\f1 full of joy, laughter and pains au chocolat\f2\emdash\f1 but zat is just one of its many faces.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Where zere is light, zere must also be shadow\f2\emdash\f1 and where zere is 'appiness and beauty, zere must also be la m\'e9lancholie et la r\'e9pugnance!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are to make your way in zis world as ladies par excellence, you must look beneath ze mask, and see zat everything is not always 'ow it seems! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As a professeur of ze Acad\'e9mie, ze safety and s\'e9curit\'e9 of my pupils is my number one priorit\'e9! No one leaves zis building after dark!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aren't these flowers pretty? Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 likes the lilies of the valley best of all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He says the way their little white petals catch the eye reminds him of mini medals. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whatever's in that tub that Jarmima carries around with her, it's absolutely amazing! As soon as she sprinkles it on a wilting flower, it springs right back to life!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to her mystery mixture, the lilies of the valley are even more full of life than they were before. Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 will be ever so pleased! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Thanks for telling me about this place! If I'd spent any longer on my own in the Eerie Eyrie, I would have gone potty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell I've made a lot of friends already, and the teachers are all really nice\f2\emdash\f1 when they're not shouting at me for breaking the chairs, that is. I feel like I've hit the jackpot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Here, this is for you\f2\emdash\f1 you've more than urned it! Jeeble jarble joo! \par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell NOT USED\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Jeeble jarble joo! It wasn't just pot luck that you found me\f2\emdash\f1 it was all thanks to my mummy's happy-making spell!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell It's really powerful magic\f2\emdash\f1 whenever you're feeling sad, just say \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote , and you'll soon be happier than a tot in the tub!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell Jeeble jarble joo! It wasn't just pot luck that you found me\f2\emdash\f1 it was all thanks to my mummy's happy-making spell!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell It's really powerful magic\f2\emdash\f1 whenever you're feeling sad, just say \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote , and you'll soon be happier than a tot in the tub!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It used to be just me out here training to be tough, but since the World Tree fell, everyone's been at it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it's a bit selfish, but I'm glad I'm not doing it on my own any more. It makes it so much more fun!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I can have some company on my quest to outdo the one and only Sterling Sylva! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We M\'e9damoiselles Magnifiques have enlisted some help in training to be all that we can be!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In this ruined world, it is no longer enough to be simply beautiful and vivacious, and to have a keen knowledge of which cutlery to use when\f2\emdash\f1 one must also be tough!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So come along, ladies! We must train until we are trim and toned enough to take on even the toughest monster! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've only just joined this school, so I don't really know what a M\'e9damoiselle is.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know what a marathon is, though. Ever since the World Tree fell, they've been making me run one every day. (sniff) I don't like this place any more... I want to go home...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f6\u8810?\f1\lang9 01\f4\'96\'c5\'96\'53\'91\'4f\f6\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\f1\lang9 CS030\f4\'82\'f0\'8c\'a9\'82\'bd\'8c\'e3\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, I'm not a bad slime\f2\emdash\f1 I'm a goo slime! Really, really goo! At running! Well, bouncing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not quite as fast as my slooper-shiny metal cousins, though. Whenever anything spooks them, they scarper in record slime! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, I'm not a bad slime\f2\emdash\f1 I'm a goo slime! My mummy, on the other hand... Well, just listen to this letter she sent me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Dear Squishikins,\par
For too long have we slimes been trodden down by man! Our brothers and sisters squished beneath the gooman jackboot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote But no longer\f2\emdash\f1 I'm gooing off to fight with the Lord of Shadows! I'm so excited, I can't stop wobbling!\par
*: \lquote Hope to see you on the battlefield soon! And remember, my little Squishikins\f2\emdash\f1 you have nothing to looze but your chains!\par
Hugs and squishes, Mummy X O X O\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She always oozed to tell me that goomans and slimes should be friends... I wonder ooze been putting these silly ideas into her head...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a rumour gooing around that ever since Yggdrasil fell, a lot of nice monsters like me have gone bad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was hoping my mummy hadn't been affected, but sludging from that letter she wrote me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No matter what manner of obstacle stands in her way, a true lady must overcome it with poise, polish and perseverance!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even in these awful times, we must strive to replicate the eternal elegance of La Collectrice, who stands immortalised in bronze in the school gardens!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The statue is based on the Acad\'e9mie's very first chef de classe, Lady Minette Maximilien. Ahh, if I could have but a fraction of her grace! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This little river is absolutely teeming with......nothing. Ever since Yggdrasil fell, it's been too dangerous to go outside......so I'm stuck here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's still fun and all, but there's one big problem......something's really starting to stink. I hope whoever made the World Tree fall out of the sky hasn't poisoned this river too......\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This little river is absolutely teeming with......nothing. Ever since Yggdrasil fell, it's been too dangerous to go outside......so I'm stuck here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now that Malodorine's joined in......things have stopped stinking, at least. She smells......lovely. It's like being out in the flower garden again......\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I think you're the first boy who's ever been given permission to wander around the Acad\'e9mie willy-nilly like this. Were you friends with Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 before you enrolled or something? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see... I've only ever had girls as friends before, but now that you're here, you can be my very first boyf... Oh, err...friendboy! Here's to a long and fruitful relationship! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since the World Tree fell, the little ones haven't been their usual happy selves. They never used to cry in the night before, but now it happens all the time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They must be picking up on the fear and anxiety of their elders. It's up to us seniors to keep a stiff upper lip!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many people died when Yggdrasil fell... Now, zeir spirits roam ze land, incapable of returning to ze Tree of Life. Ze air is 'eavy with zeir m\'e9lancolie and regret...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alors, can you not feel it in zis very classroom? ...Ah, but forgive me, monsieur\f2\emdash\f1 I am forgetting my duties. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f6\u8810?\f1\lang9 01\f4\'96\'c5\'96\'53\'91\'4f\f6\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\'d6\'b1\'bd\'d3\'d4\'92\f4\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f6\u8810?\f1\lang9 01\f4\'96\'c5\'96\'53\'91\'4f\f6\u8811?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\'d6\'b1\'bd\'d3\'d4\'92\f4\'82\'b5\'82\'a9\'82\'af\'82\'bd\'8e\'9e\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\lang9\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since the World Tree fell, the teachers have been telling us we can't go outside unless we have a bad case of emergency.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm not sure how you catch one of those, but I think I'd rather stay indoors than find out! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been a bit down in the dumpsss lately... Chantelle the chanteuse? More like Chantelle the shiftlesss... Do you want me to sssing you a sssong? It probably won't be very good... <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell (sigh) Okay... If you're sure, I'll sssing you the ssschool sssong...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell 'Neath the branches of the birches...\par
Daffodils sssway and ssswiiing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Here among the graceful gardens...\par
Budding young ladiesss siiing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell We'll ssstride acrosss the wide, wide world...\par
And hunt for mini medalsss low and (sigh)...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell But our heartsss live forever in...\par
L'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre...des M\'e9dailles...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell I'm sssorry. That was terrible. I'll try to do better next time...if there is a next time...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell\par
I don't know where it'sss come from, but I've got a really ssspooky sssong ssstuck in my head... Do you want to hear it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Child of darknesss, child of night, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Child of shadows, child of blight, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Wake and shake the shackles from your heeeart! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell Your dark commander has arisen, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
To free you from thisss mortal prison, \f3\u9834?\f1\par
It'sss time to tear thisss hated world apaaart! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Chantelle\cell It'sss really ssscary, but I can't get it out of my head. And I find it ssstrangely...exciting... Makesss me feel like...gnashing my teeth at sssomeone...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should take everything Dasha says with a pinch of salt. She's a proper little mischief-maker.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's always making up silly stories to try and frighten people. I've given up trying to change her ways\f2\emdash\f1 now I just smile and nod, smile and nod...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm telling you, I saw her with my own eyes! There was a girl standing right next to this window in the middle of the night!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I said hello to her, and she smiled back, and said she wanted to play with me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I miss my mummy... (sniff) I miss my daddy... (sob) I want to go home... (gulp) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze fall of ze World Tree turned all Erdrea upside down. Many people lost zeir lives, yet some can still be saved. ...And zat is where you come in!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I 'ave a petit requ\'eate for you\f2\emdash\f1 if, on your travels, you should meet wiz any young girls 'oo 'ave been left alone\f2\emdash\f1 sans parents\f2\emdash\f1 I want you to tell zem about zis place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie 'as been spared ze worst of ze destruction, and we 'ave warm beds and 'ot food to spare. Our doors are always open to any jeune fille 'oo needs our 'elp in zese troubled times.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze entire facult\'e9 stands ready to welcome zem into our 'umble \'e9tablissement, and aid zem in any way we can!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bonjour, monsieur! Les jeunes filles zat you sent to us are already making zemselves at 'ome. It is so nice to see ze young ladies safe and well.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though ze scars on zeir 'earts may never fully 'eal, zose girls are brave beyond zeir years. Already, zey are putting ze past behind zem and focusing on ze future.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In time, zey will recover, and\f2\emdash\f1 wiz ze 'elp of all of us 'ere at l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles\f2\emdash\f1 zey will flourish!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I 'ave a petit requ\'eate for you\f2\emdash\f1 if, on your travels, you should meet wiz any young girls 'oo 'ave been left alone\f2\emdash\f1 sans parents\f2\emdash\f1 I want you to tell zem about zis place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ze Acad\'e9mie 'as been spared ze worst of ze destruction, and we 'ave warm beds and 'ot food to spare. Our doors are always open to any jeune fille 'oo needs our 'elp in zese troubled times.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'92\'a9\'82\'cc\'8f\'89\'89\'f1\'82\'cc\f5\'a1\'be\f4\'83\'5a\'81\'5b\'83\'56\'83\'46\'83\'8b\'82\'c6\'83\'69\'83\'5e\'81\'5b\'83\'56\'83\'83\'82\'f0\'93\'fc\'8a\'77\'82\'b3\'82\'b9\'82\'bd\'8c\'e3\f5\'a1\'bf\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. I'm Candida, the chef de classe. It's my role to look after the other girls and keep them in line, but they really don't make it easy for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Recently, it's Malodorine Delamorgue who's been giving me the biggest headache. She usually smells lovely, but ever since the Fall, she's really started to pong.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell None of the other girls really mind\f2\emdash\f1 she is a walking corpse, after all\f2\emdash\f1 but Malodorine's so upset about it, she's started bunking off lessons to avoid bothering anyone. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. I'm Candida, the chef de classe. It's my role to look after the other girls and keep them in line, but they really don't make it easy for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell At least I don't have to worry about Malodorine any more. I'm not sure what happened, but she seems to be back to her old sweet-smelling self\f2\emdash\f1 thank goodness.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Some kindly soul must have...helped her with her little situation. After all the headaches she gave me, I can't thank them enough! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\par
\lquote She opens wide her shining eyes and searches for her shiny prize!\par
The wide-eyed wanderer espies a medal of a tiny size!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell\lquote Take it, dear girl, come, realise the wonder that before you lies!\par
And on your way home, visualise your classmates' laudatory cries!\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell Whenever I read Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's poetry to a restless student, it sends them straight to sleep. He's a real lifesaver! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell This poor girl must have seen some terrible things. She always seems so cheery in class, but as soon as she's alone, she starts sobbing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Candida\cell It must be a real struggle for her to hold back the tears, but she stays strong to avoid upsetting the other girls... Such a thoughtful child...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell I'm Clo\'e9, and this is my sister Cl\'e9o. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell When Yggdrasil fell to earth and rocks started raining from the sky, we thought our time was up. That's when my sister made me promise her something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Clo\'e9\cell She made me swear that if she didn't make it but I did, I would change my name to Cl\'e9o so she'd never be forgotten. But then what happens to my name? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell I'm Cl\'e9o, and this is my sister Clo\'e9. We're identical twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell When Yggdrasil fell to earth and rocks started raining from the sky, we thought our time was up. That's when my sister made me promise her something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Cl\'e9o\cell She made me swear that if she didn't make it but I did, I would change my name to Clo\'e9 so she'd never be forgotten. But then what happens to my name? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm embroidering handkerchiefs for my little brothers back home.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I send them home so my brothers can sell them for food and clothes. But I haven't heard anything from them since the Fall, and all my letters come back marked \lquote Return to Sender\rquote .\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems like all the roads in and out of Sniflheim have been completely cut off. I hope they're alright... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello! It's lovely to see you again. Thank you so much for telling me about this place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm so happy to be living here with all the other girls. I don't feel like crying any more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is for you... For saving me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell NOT USED\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be a teacher just like Madame Waloppe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And whenever my students are feeling sad, I'll give them a great big hug to cheer them up, just like the one she gave me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be a teacher just like Madame Waloppe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And whenever my students are feeling sad, I'll give them a great big hug to cheer them up, just like the one she gave me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wiz all ze troubles in ze world, it 'as been very 'ard to get 'old of good ingredients lately. I've 'ad to work 'arder zan ever to make ze most of what I've got.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But no matter 'ow difficile it might be, ze meals I make must be nutritious and delicieux! Zese growing girls must eat!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You want to know what is on ze menu tonight, hein? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We 'ave ze 'olewheat bread from 'Eliodor\f2\emdash\f1 a little stale per'aps, but dip it in ze soupe de l\'e9gumes and it soaks up ze flavour like an \'e9ponge!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our centrepiece will be ze smoky bacon fresh from Gondolia. Best not to ask what animal it comes from, but ze taste? Magnifique!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It 'as been tr\'e8s difficile to get 'old of good ingredients lately\f2\emdash\f1 but I make ze best of what I 'ave.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh...zen you 'ave come to 'elp me, per'aps? Merci, ch\'e9ri\f2\emdash\f1 thank you for ze kind offer, but I 'ave done all ze 'ard work already!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Jarmima is a culinary g\'e9nie! A petit pinch of whatever she keeps in zat pot makes any meal I make taste fantastique!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If only she would reveal to me 'er secret recipe!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello. It's me, Madeleine\f2\emdash\f1 the head dinner monitor. Madame Croque's meals haven't been very tasty lately...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell It's just stale bread and funny-tasting bacon every single day! What happened to all the delicious food she used to make? The stuff that made my taste buds sing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Madeleine\cell\par
La la la la laaa! Yaaay! Madame Croque's back to her best! My taste buds are singing again! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Make sure you watch your manners around Madame Labouche\f2\emdash\f1 she's the deportment mistress, which means she's very fussy about appearance and behaviour.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's bad enough with us girls, so I can't even imagine how strict she'd be with a boy. You're not even supposed to be here! I'd be very, very careful around her if I were you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Make sure you watch your manners around Madame Labouche\f2\emdash\f1 she's the deportment mistress, which means she's very fussy about appearance and behaviour.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's bad enough with us girls, so I can't even imagine how strict she'd be with a boy. You're not even supposed to be here! I'd be very, very careful around her if I were you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bonsoir, fellow student! Isn't it a bit late for you to still be running around?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you ever get tired of all that adventuring, just talk to Madame Ch\'e9rie downstairs. I'm sure she'll let you stay the night in the dormitory. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever so sorry handsome, but I'm kind of in the middle of something right now. I'll speak to you later, okay?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm reading about the Acad\'e9mie's very first headmaster\f2\emdash\f1 a man who became known as the Acad\'e9mique de l'Amour.\par
*: He said that love is like a mini medal\f2\emdash\f1 not something that you force on other people, but something that you search for, and often find in the strangest places.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The one you love may seem far away, but as long as you have that love in your heart, you're sure to find them eventually. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I've been thinking\f2\emdash\f1 is it really alright for us to live here in peace and happiness when so many others are suffering? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Honestly, you're such a silly billy! We're still children! Even if you did want to help them, what in the world could you do? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I don't know... I don't know anything... Oh, I'm such a fool... I don't deserve to be happy... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Listen to me, darling\f2\emdash\f1 we'll be grown-ups soon enough. We don't need to rush anything. Just stay with me, and everything will be alright. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since Yggdrasil came crashing down, I've been feeling so low. Talking to people has felt like such a strain...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've hardly even spoken to my best friend recently\f2\emdash\f1 I'm not sure she even likes me any more... Oh, it's all gone wrong... I don't know what to do... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, I'm Jarmima. Do you want to know what \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote  means? It's a magic spell that makes you happy. My mummy taught it to me...before she passed away...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell When that big tree fell out of the sky, all of my old friends suddenly went potty and chased me out of my home... It was really jarring...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell I can't go back home any more... I'm all alone in the world... Everything's gone to pot...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, I'm Jarmima. Do you want to know what \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote  means? It's a magic spell that makes you happy. My mummy taught it to me...before she passed away...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell When that big tree fell out of the sky, all of my old friends suddenly went potty and chased me out of my home... It was really jarring...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell I can't go back home any more... I'm all alone in the world... Everything's gone to pot... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Jarmima is all on her own, and doesn't have anywhere to go. Tell her about l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell ...Jeeble jarble joo! If I go to that school, I won't be all alone any more! Thank you so much for telling me about it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell I'm going to go there right now! I'll pick up some nice, shiny apples for my new teachers on the way\f2\emdash\f1 and I'll get something for you too! You've urned it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jarmima\cell When you feel sad and lonely, just say \lquote jeeble jarble joo\rquote , and it'll put a smile on your face...eventually...\par
\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\fs24\par
1.14 Phnom Nonh\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\b0\fs22\cell\lquote Now we are buying more stock.\par
We will reopen soon.\par
Please come back later!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You have come from far, far away, yes? Welcome to Phnom Nonh, home of the beautiful lady in the mural! You have come to see the Nhou Wat ruins, I think so?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, the mural in the ruins is very, very popular with tourists\f2\emdash\f1 she brings them good luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you want to go there, you must climb the staircase in the centre of the village, and then down the other side of the hill. Do not go home without taking a look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Phnom Nonh is the home of the beautiful lady in the mural! She is famous for blessing people who go and see her, so she is very, very popular with tourists!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you want to go there, you must climb the staircase in the centre of the village, and then go down the other side of the hill. Do not go home without taking a look!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came here 'cause they said the mural would bring me a bit o' good luck, but I reckon I might grab meself a few souvenirs too while I'm about it. There's some bonzer stuff on these stalls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, look at this\f2\emdash\f1 says it's a lucky charm that'll make the fellas swoon. Strewth, could I ever do with somethin' like that!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, sir! We have the cheapest souvenirs in the village right here!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Did that sound believable? I am an apprentice merchant, and I am practising my sales technique.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I will be the best merchant in Phnom Nonh, so I can be very, very rich!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up I will be the best merchant in Phnom Nonh, and I will buy for my mother the best food from all over Erdrea!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am practising every day. But it is hard work and it makes me very, very hungry...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Because of the famous mural, many, many people come to Phnom Nonh, and they bring lots of money with them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are here to see the mural too, I think so? Then you must buy a souvenir before you go!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't worry, Grandpa... Zzz... I will work hard... I will make money for us... Zzz... You rest, Grandpa...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh. Here to get a bit of a boost off the mural too, are ya? Yeah, ya look like the type, mate.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, fair dinkum, but ya better get there quick, 'cause I'm hopin' to get me a ripper of a dose. She's gonna make me strong, and then I'm gonna teach every flamin' galah who ever doubted me a lesson!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Beds, a bar\f2\emdash\f1 we have everything you need right here, I think so! Ah, but we are not open yet. We are still preparing ingredients and so on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why not come back after you visit the ruins? By then, we will be ready to serve you the best food and drink Phnom Nonh has to offer! Hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell The others have gone to the ruins already. If we're going after them, we'll need to climb the stairs in the centre of the village to the other side of the hill.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell To be honest with you, I'm looking forward to getting out of here. I hate people trying to sell me things...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This drongo won't leave me alone! I'm on me way to the ruins, but he keeps pullin' on me arm tryin' to sell me stuff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need to rattle me dags\f2\emdash\f1 some other bloke'll get all the luck outta that mural otherwise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Why so much hurrying? The mural will not go anywhere, I think so. Why not look at Mony's selection of souvenirs first? They are the best in Phnom Nonh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell\par
Ah! Hello, sir! You are a visitor here too, yes? Then please come to me for anything you need! Hotels, restaurants, souvenirs\f2\emdash\f1 I can arrange it all!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a traveller, just like you. Roaming the world, searching for some meaning in life. I've been all over the place, and now I've ended up here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All I keep hearing about is this mural that makes wishes come true. I can't say I believe in such things, but I suppose it's worth a look...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Since they found the mural, people only talk about making money all the time. It is very, very boring.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mummy... (snort) I feel so lonely without you... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whatever you need, you have come to the right place! Nowhere in the village has more choice\f2\emdash\f1 or better prices!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am helping my mother in the shop. A girl has to work if she wants to eat, I think so!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you want to buy something, please talk to my mother. She is behind the counter. I hope you buy a lot!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, sir! We have everything you need here in our shop, from mural souvenirs to travel essentials!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Phnom Nonh has become a very, very lively place since they found that mural in the ruins. It is all thanks to the blessings of the mural lady!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The profit margin on this stuff must be bonkers! Reckon I could learn a thing or two about business from this lot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Look, sir! I have a lucky charm for all occasions! All of them are packed full with the mural's powers! Guaranteed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh heh... Thanks to our famous mural, people will buy any old rubbish if you say it will bring them good luck...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! Did I say that out loud? Please, do not listen to me, sir! Why not take a look at my selection of lucky charms instead?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good fortune is very, very nice, but you also need good weapons to keep you alive in battle, I think so! So, sir...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am in charge of this shop! My daddy said so! Please take a look at our special armours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have come all the way to Phnom Nonh sir, so you must make the most of it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Worry about the future when your holiday is over! For now, spend and play and enjoy the mural's gifts to all of us!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: (pant) How...many...more...steps...? (pant) I'm...bushed... These ruins can't be much further...can they...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Mustn't...give up... Phew! Nope, gotta pull meself together, get to that mural and get me a double helpin' o' the old good fortune!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One has only come here in order to pray for one's beloved daughter's good fortune in her school entrance exam, you know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The journey here was quite frightful. Still, if it helps one's little princess get the mark she deserves, it will all have been worth it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard of l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles? It's a simply wonderful school where they turn little girls into exquisite young ladies! It's off to the north of here somewhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One has always dreamed of going there. In fact, one has never wanted anything more! Which is why one was desperate to stay home and revise, but Papa insisted that we come here instead!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This isnae the easiest place to get around if yer legs aren't what they used to be.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Erik and the others have already gone ahead to the ruins. I'm just taking a wee rest here, then I'll catch up. You go on ahead.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everyone needs something to believe in, my friend. Something to cling to. I have my faith, of course. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To tell the truth, we do not have many visitors here at our church. Most people are too excited by the ruins and the mural, I think so. It is a little bit sad...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day, sir! It is always a pleasure to meet a visitor to our village! Tourists are so much more than sources of income to us\f2\emdash\f1 we like to think that you are people too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, you must pay a visit to the ruins of Nhou Wat before you leave! The lady in the mural is sure to bring good fortune to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have come to see the lady in the mural too, I think so? I do not understand why she is so popular with the city people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now they are coming here in big, big groups. The Mayor seems very, very happy about this, at least.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every day I am grateful that they found the mural in the ruins. She has changed our lives! She has made our village rich and prosperous!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lady in the mural is the reason I could buy this house for my family. Yes, she has certainly brought good fortune for me, I think so.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Yes... Good... My secret cache of money is becoming bigger and bigger! I\f2\emdash\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hm!? Oh! Y-You gave me a fright, sir!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You probably wonder why I keep my money hidden like this, I think so. Well, it is an old habit. Before they found the mural, we were all very, very poor, you see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, now we all have plenty of money. But I cannot change my ways. I still feel that I might lose it all at any moment...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tourists seem to love dishes that are made with local produce, so I am trying to create something that will be to their taste.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, it is because of the tourists that we all live in such comfort now. We should treat them with respect, I think so.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh... It smells good, yes? It is a real pleasure to be able to eat a hearty meal every day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We must give thanks to the lady in the mural and the tourists who come here to visit her!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This village used to be nothing. Nothing at all. The way it is now, with all the tourists and shops, this is a recent thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A few years ago, someone discovered the mural inside the ruins of Nhou Wat, and that changed everything. Almost overnight, the village became full with people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you see, everything before you is because of that mural. I give thanks to her every day. Every single day.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... Lady in the mural... Zzz... Thank you...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Mm? You have come to see the mural too, yes? Well, to tell the truth, I do not know much about it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, the village has changed a lot since it was discovered. But the old, quiet village was nicer, I think so.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... Yes... Nice and quiet... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have been making souvenirs here in Phnom Nonh for many, many years.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Always I could only just scrape by from selling my work, but after they found the mural, everything changed. My sales went through the roof!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I have enough money to live comfortably, and even to buy gifts for my grandaughter. And I owe it all to the lady of the mural.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Maybe you're sceptical about the mural's powers, but I'm telling you, she's the real deal! She's certainly brought me good fortune! Moving here was the best thing I ever did!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Honestly, if you want to live a happy life, just give up on all your adventures and settle down here\f2\emdash\f1 you won't regret it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm so glad I moved here. Now I dream of the mural every...single...night... Zzz... (snort)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband and I came to Phnom Nonh on our honeymoon. Once we'd seen the lady in the mural though, we just knew we had to stay.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can honestly say that we've been happy ever since. I know some people don't believe in the mural's blessings, but she's definitely brought us plenty of good fortune.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I look out on this village every evening, and I'm always struck by how beautiful it is. But I do wonder sometimes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did we really do the right thing, moving here just because of a mural we saw on our honeymoon?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, what am I saying\f2\emdash\f1 of course we did! The lady in the mural has brought us nothing but joy and good fortune! Every day is a blessing!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Urgh... I know that I drink too much... Hic! But since my wife died, I feel so...sad... (sniff)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are a tourist, I think so. There is nothing for you in this house. You probably want the mural, yes? It is in the ruins, up the stairs and over the hill.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Well, I can see the whole of Phnom Nonh from up here, but I can't see anybody who looks like they might be Dora's parents...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Will you go take a look in the ruins for me, honey? They're just over that hill near where Dora and I were speaking earlier.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I'll take one more look over the village, and then I'll catch up with you. Don't worry\f2\emdash\f1 you won't be without my scintillating company for long!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dora\cell Mother and Father said the mural could make them rich. Then they went somewhere, and didn't come back...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dora\cell Please help me! I want them back so badly!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you feel it? I certainly can! Yes... A mysterious force, emanating from the ruins... You develop an awareness of these things when you've seen as much of the world as I have.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh by the way, did you know that the person who discovered the mural in the ruins disappeared in mysterious circumstances? Heh. I thought that would get your attention.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're not interested in that? You want to help a little girl who's lost her parents? Pff. Ask someone else. I've got bigger fish to fry.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, well\f2\emdash\f1 a fellow scholar! Don't ask me how I know, it's just a gift I have. You're here to investigate these ruins as well, aren't you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But of course you are! Who could resist the chance to poke around among the mysteries of Nhou Wat? It's the last remaining relic of a long-lost kingdom, you know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And just how does something like that happen, I hear you ask? How does an entire kingdom fall into ruins? Well, that's what I'm here to find out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The door is locked from the inside.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Unearthly groans can be heard coming from within. It must be the people who've come to see the mural...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Honey, I've lost little Dora! First her parents and now her...what's going on in this crazy village...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Okay, new plan\f2\emdash\f1 we need to team up and look for her together. The village square is full of people. If she went that way, someone will have seen her.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Gah, I can't see her anywhere...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Maybe we should go ask that guy's wife at the inn he told us about. He said she knows about all the comings and goings in the village, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I thought this girl might be the one who'd lost her parents, but I was, err, wrong...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Anyway, Serena and the others have headed back toward the village square. You should probably go and help them look down there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Dora\rquote !? What a vulgar name! One is most certainly not Dora! And one knows exactly where one's parents are, thank you very much!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Being separated from your parents at that age is hard. And lonely.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I should know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Let's try and find her mother and father as quickly as we can, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Hey, <pc>. I was asking around about your little friend Dora, and then this girl came and tried to get me to go to the tavern. Now she won't leave me alone...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Anyway, still no sign, huh? Hmm... That's kind of worrying. I hope nothing's happened to her...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You must be tired after sightseeing, I think so! You should come to the tavern as soon as it is open! We have the best food in Phnom Nonh!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Look! It is the one you can see over there! Hee hee! Do not forget to come\f2\emdash\f1 I will give you a big discount!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I'm ever so sorry, <pc>. We haven't been able to find your friend Dora or her parents anywhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I thought these children might know her, but they say they've never even heard of her...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can I help you, sir?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...A girl called \lquote Dora\rquote ? I am sorry, sir. I have never heard that name before. Have a nice day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I like speaking with this lady! She is so warm and kind\f2\emdash\f1 not like the other tourists!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are looking for a little lost girl? Sorry. I have been here all day, but I have seen no little lost girls, I think so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I asked a few of the stallholders about our missing girl, but no one's seen anything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Where could she have got to, eh? I'm starting to get a wee bit worried about her...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell My wife's inn is right behind me! The reception is upstairs. You can stay any time you like!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to our inn! My husband has told me all about you. You will be staying tonight, I think so?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? A little girl who is lost? Err... Why are you asking me, please?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...My husband said what? That I know everything about everyone? Ha, he will say anything to attract customers, that one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I am sorry to disappoint you, but I do not know anything about your missing girl.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, do not be angry! I will let you stay one night for free! Then everything will be alright, I think so?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, I have a room that is ready for you right now! Would you like to use it?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Okay! Thank you very, very much! Right this way, please...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Well, the offer still stands. Maybe you will come back another time? I will be here waiting for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do not worry, sir\f2\emdash\f1 I have not forgotten my promise. I will still let you stay one night for free. Would you like to go to your room now?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Okay! Thank you very, very much! Right this way, please...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Well, the offer still stands. Maybe you will come back another time? I will be here waiting for you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are tired after your trip to see the mural, you should sit down and enjoy a freshly cooked meal!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you for choosing our inn, sir! The building is split into two levels. We have the tavern down here, and the rooms upstairs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is the perfect place to base yourself when visiting the Phnom Nonh area, I think so!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope you are enjoying yourself, sir! Everybody here in Phnom Nonh wants you to have a night to remember!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But if you are tired, it is okay too\f2\emdash\f1 we have rooms right upstairs!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've seen more mysterious ruins than you've had hot dinners, and this place is the real deal, I'm telling you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I think I can even feel some vibes coming off these souvenirs... Yeah... Just feel that... Wow...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, sir! We have the cheapest souvenirs in the village, right here! Please take a look. ...Please?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... There is something wrong all of a sudden... There are fewer tourists than usual, I think so...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Because of the famous mural, many, many people come to Phnom Nonh, and they bring lots of money with them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...But not right now. Something is different, suddenly. There are not so many tourists as usual.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you credit it!? The young people of this village have no interest in the incredible history that's right there on their doorstep\f2\emdash\f1 all they want to do is sell souvenirs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How can anyone resist the allure of Nhou Wat? The heady pull of that perfectly preserved relic of a long-lost kingdom? It's baffling. And, more to the point, a little sad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You enjoyed your stay at our inn, I think so? Please come back again any time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean it, you know! Some of our guests seem to get so lost in their sightseeing that they fail to return, even to fetch their belongings...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell You had a comfortable night in our inn, I think so? You are always welcome to stay with us again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell ...Hm? The little girl who is lost?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Ah, yes, of course. I am sorry, but I do not know anything. I am sure my wife can help you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Also, there is no need to worry\f2\emdash\f1 people become lost in Phnom Nonh every day.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Usually they can be found in the last place you saw them. People are strange like that, I think so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Please stay at our inn again! And do not worry about the lost girl! You will find her very, very soon, I am sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Usually people who become lost can be found in the last place you saw them. People are strange like that, I think so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you must be ever so quiet. One's little princess needs her rest\f2\emdash\f1 she has an awfully important school entrance exam coming up.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: For l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles, no less. It is a quite fabulous institution. Off to the north of here, don't you know. One does so hope the mural helps her chances...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good morning, sir! You slept well last night, I think so? Please, have a good day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, by the way\f2\emdash\f1 do you know a man named Bazza? He is also a guest here, but he did not return last night.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He was...very keen indeed to see the mural. I hope he did not injure himself in his haste to get there. You too must be careful, please.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell You had a comfortable night in our inn, I think so? You are always welcome to stay with us again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell ...Hm? Oh. You are still looking for the little girl?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Well...perhaps if she is so difficult to find, you should ask the mural for help?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell The lady of the painting will lead you straight to your missing friend, I think so! Ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell You are still looking for the little girl? Then you should ask the mural for help!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell She will lead you straight to your missing friend, I think so! Ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mural is glowing invitingly...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Cross over to the Other Side?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's something written on the stone. It seems to be a message from the person who discovered the mural...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have found a great fresco in the ruins near Phnom Nonh. It seems to be several centuries old.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote It has a strange power. At first I thought it was a power for good... That this was how people had been drawn here... How the town had grown great...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But now I see that it is evil. That it lures the greedy with promises of riches so that it might feast on their souls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote And those too pure of heart to tempt with greed, it lures through pity. Beware the little lost girl...she will lead you to your doom.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell ...That seems to be the end of the message.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The thorny tentacles are back that way. It's probably best to stay away.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Don't even think it, <pc>! We've spent quite enough time in that horrible place for one day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell We must hurry back to the village and tell everybody the truth about the mural!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The crack looks like it leads back to the outside world. Jump in?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell An eerie voice echoes from afar...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dora\cell Hya ha ha haaa! Ah, there you are! Such pretty little splashes of colour!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dora\cell And so kind of you to visit me in my world! Now that the canvas has been prepared, let the brutal artistry of battle commence!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dora\cell Hm hm hm! Hya ha ha haaa!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The crack looks like it leads back to the outside world. Jump in?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Where are ye going, laddie? We need to get out of here and head back to the village.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Did ye see that great crack back near where Dora was? Something tells me that might be our way out of here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mural is glowing invitingly...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Cross over to the Other Side?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome! You have come to see the lair of the infamous cursed mural monster, yes? You will have a thrilling experience, I think so!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell We have found a way to turn our terrible fortune to our advantage! My handcrafted replica murals are selling like the hot cakes! You should buy one or two, I think so!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell I cannot take all the credit for this success story, however\f2\emdash\f1 I got the idea for them from a little girl I met here in the village.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell Her name was Dora...but I have not seen her for a while now. It is a shame. I wanted to thank her for giving me such good advice...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell You can buy one of the replicas I made of the cursed mural at the item shop. It would be a nice reminder of your time here, I think so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mony\cell You know, I sold one just now, but then the customer disappeared very, very suddenly. I hope nothing...unfortunate has happened...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You enjoyed your stay at our inn, I think so. Please come back again any time\f2\emdash\f1 heroes like you are always welcome!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bazza\cell It's bonzer havin' a bit o' cash in yer pocket, but it ain't worth riskin' yer flamin' life for. That mural nearly did for me! No more mystical mumbo jumbo. From now on, it's just good, hard yakker for Bazza.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bazza\cell Oh by the way, here's a little tip for you to say thanks for savin' me bacon. That new magic key o' yours? I hear one o' the doors that thing opens is right here in the village.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You and yer mates got us out of that mural, didn't ya? Ta. You must've trained like billy-o to get that tough, eh?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I feel like a right drongo, gettin' sucked in like that... Well, it's me own fault for believin' I could cheat me way to bein' a hero...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should take a look at the new souvenirs they are selling in the item shop, sir. Quickly, before the other tourists snap them up!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard? They are selling replicas of the cursed mural in the item shop!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These nippers were just tellin' me they're selling replicas of the mural over in the item shop now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you believe that? Talk about true-blue troopers! Somethin' like that happens to 'em, and they turn it into a business oppo! These Phnom-Nonners are an inspiration!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard that you were the ones who rescued those people from inside the mural.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's pretty inspirational stuff. In fact, it's helped me decide what I want to do with my life\f2\emdash\f1 I want to be like you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The lady in the mural was a liar and a bad person, yes?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Well, I am not surprised she decided to come here. The people of this village are so easy to tempt. All they care about is money...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came here 'cause I heard the mural would bring me luck and buckets o' dosh. Instead, the flamin' thing nearly killed me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, I did meet you, you great big spunk, you! Guess I did get lucky after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have everything you need here at the item shop\f2\emdash\f1 including all-new replicas of the cursed mural!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And for a very, very reasonable price too! You should buy them for all your friends!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, sir! We have everything you need here in our shop, from local souvenirs to travel essentials! And we even have replicas of the mural now too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some people have taken to calling the mural \lquote cursed\rquote , but we must not forget that it is what made Phnom Nonh the phenomenon it is today!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, sir! I have something for everyone! Lucky charms, cursed relics...whatever takes your fancy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must change my line-up to suit the times, yes? And since the business with the mural, cursed items are all the rage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I do not mind tricking tourists...but what the lady in the mural did was possibly a little too much, I think so...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Oh, hello sir! Please, ignore me\f2\emdash\f1 I do not mean anything I say!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot believe the lady in the mural just...disappeared. But I suppose that there are some things in this world we are not meant to understand...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And besides, I cannot waste time thinking about women in paintings\f2\emdash\f1 I need to make a living!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One only came here in order to pray to the mural for one's beloved daughter's good fortune in her school entrance exam, you know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it seems the mural was no more than a trap to lure in unsuspecting seekers of fortune! Really, one is lucky to be alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, you must be ever so quiet. One's little princess needs her rest\f2\emdash\f1 she has an awfully important school entrance exam coming up.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: For l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles, no less. It is a quite fabulous institution. Off to the north of here, don't you know. Very exclusive, of course, but she'll have no problem getting in, I'm sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, lookin' down from up here, it makes a bloke realise how small it all is...all me problems...they're diddly-squat in the scheme o' things...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They may've pulled a swiftie with that whole mural thing, but that don't mean it wasn't worth comin'. Nah... She'll be right...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So the mural's gone...? I don't know how I feel about that, to be honest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, the vibes in that crazy world they're saying it led to must have been insane... Well, who knows\f2\emdash\f1 maybe I'll get my chance one day.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard you were the one who dealt with the cursed mural and freed all the people trapped inside. Gosh, what a hero! Now it's my turn to do something epic and start researching them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After all, when we understand the past, we know the present\f2\emdash\f1 and can predict the future. Ha! That heroic enough for you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Cross over to the Other Side?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We owe you very, very much, I think so! You saved Phnom Nonh from the curse of the mural!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Phnom Nonh, home of the ancient ruins of Nhou Wat, and the terrifying, shiver-inducing tale of the cursed mural!\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is good, yes? And very successful\f2\emdash\f1 now we have more tourists than ever, thanks to you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard of what you did, sir. Thank you very, very much. To tell the truth, thinking about those people trapped inside the mural still frightens me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But at least it has given the Mayor some new business ideas.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, the mural is gone, but people will still visit Phnom Nonh, I think so. Everyone likes to hear stories about curses and terrifying spirits, yes?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We must continue to give thanks to the lady of the mural\f2\emdash\f1 because she continues to make our village rich!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Yes... Good... My secret cache of money is becoming bigger and bigger! I\f2\emdash\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hm!? Oh! Y-You gave me a fright, sir!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The truth is, I come here to count my money every night. I find it comforting to know that it is always here, even if all else changes...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I remember when the mural was found inside the ruins of Nhou Wat. It was many, many years ago now. The village became a tourist destination overnight.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, no one imagined that the painting was cursed. That it would trap unsuspecting souls inside it... (shudder)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Zzz... The mural... She...She tricked us... Zzz...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have been making souvenirs here in Phnom Nonh for many, many years.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Always I could only just scrape by from selling my work, but after they found the mural, everything changed. My sales went through the roof!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So even if she was cursed, I will always be grateful for it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you believe it? We moved to this village just so we could be closer to the mural and its powers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it's gone and disappeared! What are we supposed to do now!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, lady of the mural... Please take us with you... Please don't leave us here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband and I first saw the mural on our honeymoon. It made such an impression on us, we decided to move here. And now they tell us that it was cursed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband's struggling to deal with the fact that it's gone, but I'm actually quite glad. If it was evil, we're better off without it, surely?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Phnom Nonh is still a beautiful place. And that's a beauty that isn't going anywhere fast.\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.15 The Strand\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Sorry honey, but I haven't a clue where we are. This island doesn't appear on any of my maps.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I want to wave bye-bye to this forsaken place as soon as possible, but so long as the Stallion's stuck on that sandbank, we're staying right here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Something's not right about this place. No wind, no waves\f2\emdash\f1 it almost feels like time's stopped altogether... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell What a pretty little island this is. It looks just like the one in the picture book I always used to read when I was little.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I always said to Veronica that I'd like to go there...and to meet the handsome prince who lived there too! Tee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell There's absolutely nothing here. Let's not waste any more time than we have to. As soon as the wind picks up, we're getting back on the hunt for the Orbs! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Fascinating... Judging by the shape of the prow and the state of the planks, I wouldnae be surprised if this boat was built long before even I was born...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I cannae help wondering if we've strayed into the Valorian Triangle, ye know. It's a bit of the sea where they say ships just up and disappear, never to be seen again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Sorry dollface, but the ship's stuck on a sandbar. We ain't goin' nowhere for the minute.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Me an' Sylv're gonna see if we can't push the old girl free. You lot just sit tight\f2\emdash\f1 everyfink'll be sorted in no time.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, travellers! Don't stop here\f2\emdash\f1 these waters are dangerous! Sail on, sail on! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell I 'ad a word wiv that Michelle\f2\emdash\f1 lovely girl\f2\emdash\f1 an' you ain't gonna believe this: she's only gone and used 'er mermaid powers to get the Stallion movin' again! We can leave whenever yer ready!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell My darling lives far, far away, it's quite a lengthy trip\f2\emdash\f1 south and east of Hotto, you can only get there by ship.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell To make sure that you don't get lost, I've marked it on your map. Please go to Lonalulu, friends\f2\emdash\f1 and bring me back my chap!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell There's one more thing I'd like to ask before you disappear\f2\emdash\f1 please don't tell anyone but Kai I'm waiting for him here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I'm not sure why, but lots of sailors seem to hate my kind. If you could keep our secret, it'd really ease my mind. \cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.16 Lonalulu\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The sound of a cannon firing from the clifftop announces the rising of the sun. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The sound of a cannon firing from the clifftop announces the setting of the sun. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Lonalulu, the seaside paradise of crystal waters and perfect pearls! We hope you enjoy your stay! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking to trade for pearls, I'm afraid you've come at a bad time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A nasty tentacular's been stirring up trouble in the seas south of here, and the men haven't been able to catch a thing. I'm sorry, but we're all sold out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: While the men are away fighting the tentacular, it's up to we women to roll up our sleeves and keep the village running without them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if they think we're gonna hang around here forever while they do it, they've got another thing coming! They need to hurry it up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came all the way to this far-flung backwater to buy some of their famous pearls, but it seems a certain giant squid has other ideas.\par
*: It's making a nuisance of itself off the coast and stopping the fishermen doing their job. Now they're completely out of stock!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you come here looking for pearls too? I'm afraid it looks like all we can do is pray that the locals finish off the horrible thing quickly so they can get back to work.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, speaking of praying, there's a little church behind the village elder's house at the top of these stairs if you ever need one. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello there. I've come to Lonalulu to get my hands on some of the finest pearls in all Erdrea. Is that what brings you here too? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I hate to be the bearer of bad news, but I'm afraid you're out of luck. A demon squid's been making a nuisance of itself out at sea and stopping the fisherman from bringing any back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those pearls are the only reason I came to this forsaken backwater, and now I can't get my hands on any... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You're looking for a man named Kai? Sorry, but I'm a visitor here myself. I don't know him. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're looking for Kai? I didn't know that boy had any friends.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should go see his ma\f2\emdash\f1 you'll usually find her up at the church.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: During the day, anyhow. As soon as the sun sets, she runs on home and refuses to come out till it's light again. They're kind of a weird family... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking for Kai, you should go see his ma\f2\emdash\f1 you'll usually find her up at the church.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: During the day, anyhow. As soon as the sun sets, she runs on home and refuses to come out till it's light again. They're kind of a weird family... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're looking for Kai? I didn't know that boy had any friends.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should go see his ma\f2\emdash\f1 you'll usually find her up at the church.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: During the day, anyhow. As soon as the sun sets, she runs on home and refuses to come out till it's light again. They're kind of a weird family... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There are these scary monsters called mermaids in the sea. They sing pretty songs to put people to sleep, then they eat 'em all up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't sleep... Whenever I hear the waves crashing on the beach, I get scared...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It makes me think of my pa, out there fighting the tentacular... (sigh) I hope he's okay... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some days ago, an enormous tentacular appeared in the sea nearby. We haven't been able to catch any fish or gather any pearls since.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All the able-bodied men have sailed out to drive the monster from our waters and protect our livelihoods.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As Kahuna of this village, I wish I could have sailed with them, but I'm too old and frail. I would only have gotten in their way. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a crazy woman who lives in our village\f2\emdash\f1 she's totally pupule! Every morning she goes up to the top of the cliff and fires a cannon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it's like\f2\emdash\f1 kani kanono! Boom, the day has begun! I don't know why she does it\f2\emdash\f1 guess she must have something against sleepyheads. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I only got married last month, and now my honey has gone away to fight the tentacular. I'm praying that he makes it back in one piece.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, I beg of you... Keep my husband safe... (whisper)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Please, I beg of you... Keep my husband safe... (whisper) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband sailed off to fight the tentacular and left me to run the store all by myself. He better come home soon, or there'll be trouble!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would you look at this kid? He says he'll help me with the store, then all he does is sleep! ...Heh heh. He's a waste of space, but I love him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kai's a really hard working guy. He's the envy of all the other fishermen, but he always seems so sad. It just breaks my heart to see it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mama's moe ma'i\f2\emdash\f1 she's not feeling too good. I'm looking after the inn for her. She told me exactly what to say. Here goes... Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm so lucky to have such good kids. Even when their mama's sick, I can rely on them to keep the business going.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know what I did to deserve them. I'm so thankful I could cry... (sniff) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't sleep... I'm too worried my husband's never gonna come back from fighting that tentacular...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How am I gonna raise two kids all on my own? I... I just want him home... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm looking after the bank until my papa gets back. I wanna be a banker when I grow up, so I've been practising what to say. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's been fifty long years since I started running this place, and now this... Maybe it's time to hang up my hat... Oh, sorry\f2\emdash\f1 didn't see you there, friend.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hate to complain, but it's just we got orders for pearls waiting from princesses and rich ladies and all kinds, but we got no pearls to send them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If we keep 'em waiting too long, they'll lose faith in Lonalulu and take their business someplace else...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kai and me? We don't really get along. Why's he always gotta try and be so serious? That guy needs to loosen up and let his hair down once in a while. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fishermen of Lonalulu are the life and soul of this village\f2\emdash\f1 and the lifeblood of this bar! I've known every one of them since they were little keikis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You're asking if I know Kai? Sure, I know him. Quiet kid...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To tell the truth, I never liked the idea of him sailing with the other men. If you ask me, that boy's trouble...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's nothing I love more than the sound of cannon fire! As far as I'm concerned, every day should start and end with a bang!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My late husband, rest his soul, made all the cannons you'll see dotted around the village. And he made 'em just for me! They're louder than anything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll fire this one again when the sun sinks beneath the horizon, so keep your ears open! Ho ho ho!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's nothing I love more than the sound of cannon fire! As far as I'm concerned, every day should start and end with a bang!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My late husband, rest his soul, made all the cannons you'll see dotted around the village. And he made 'em just for me! They're louder than anything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll be firing the one on the clifftop again when the sun peeks up over the horizon, so keep your ears open! Ho ho ho! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Once upon a time, a master fisherman lived in Lonalulu. He caught more fish and gathered more pearls than any of the other men in the village.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Mayor of Lonalulu, the Big Kahuna, was very fond of this fisherman, and offered him the hand of his beloved daughter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pretty good, eh? I've been learning Auntie's story by heart! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know the lady who tells the stories? My ma told me that Uncle Kai is her boy...but he's not a boy\f2\emdash\f1 he's a grown-up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: While my pa's away, my ma's taking care of his job down by the docks. She doesn't finish until pretty late, so I have to cook for myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always follow the recipes just like she shows me, but when I eat on my own, it never tastes so good. I can't figure out why...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
She appears to be fast asleep. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
She appears to be fast asleep. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ma said I could go play with my friends if I didn't goof off, but now she says I gotta work in the store again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's all that stupid squid's fault! That suckered sucker sucks!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
He appears to be fast asleep. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When dark clouds spread across the sea, so too do they fill the hearts of the people. These are not my words, but those of my predecessor's predecessor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are a seafarer, are you not? Beware the storm clouds\f2\emdash\f1 both above and within. Now, how can I help you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Is Kai okay? You saw him, right? Just tell me, quickly, please! (gasp) ...He's gone to fight a giant squid that's stirring up the seas!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell It must be a tentacular\f2\emdash\f1 a truly mighty foe! Don't let that monster hurt my Kai! Please hurry! Quickly\f2\emdash\f1 go! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Tentaculars are fearsome beasts\f2\emdash\f1 to them, a man's a snack! Don't let that monster hurt my Kai! You've got to bring him back!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell But still, it's strange the squid's gone mad\f2\emdash\f1 it really makes no sense. Normally, they only ever fight in self-defence... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha! How can I help you? ...Huh? You want to know about the mermaid's curse?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listen, friend\f2\emdash\f1 let me give you some advice: you're better off not knowing. This village has a lot of history with those...things. If you're wise, you won't mention them again. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're going to help the fishermen fight the tentacular? That's real kind of you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, why don't you go up to the cliff and ask the cannon lady if she'll lend you something to help you out?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tentaculars are real tough, you know\f2\emdash\f1 you better borrow a cannon, rest up at the inn and make sure you're ready for anything before you go and fight that thing. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're going to help the fishermen fight the tentacular? That's real kind of you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you should ask the cannon lady if she'll lend you something to help you out. She lives in the house under the cliff over on the east side\f2\emdash\f1 the one with all the guns in the yard.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tentaculars are real tough, you know\f2\emdash\f1 you better borrow a cannon, rest up at the inn and make sure you're ready for anything before you go and fight that thing. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't wanna go out on the boats any more. It's too scary. When I grow up, I'm not gonna be a fisherman... I'm gonna be a pirate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait... Pirates still have to ride on boats, huh? Maaan, I'm finished either way! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't sleep. Every time I close my eyes, I see mermaids. I'm gonna have nightmares, I just know it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If a human and a mermaid had a kid, would it have legs or a tail? Would it be able to run as fast as I can, or...(gulp)...faster...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that you say? You're going to help my men fight the demon squid? Mahalo, traveller! Thanks very much! You're a brave one, I'll give you that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I heard from somebody that tentaculars hate loud noises. Why don't you take one of our cannons with you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Go ask the cannon lady\f2\emdash\f1 she's usually at the top of the cliff over to the east there. Tell her the Kahuna sent you\f2\emdash\f1 she'll help you out. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that you say? You're going to help my men fight the demon squid? Mahalo, traveller! Thanks very much! You're a brave one, I'll give you that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, I heard from somebody that tentaculars hate loud noises. Why don't you take one of our cannons with you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Go ask the cannon lady\f2\emdash\f1 she lives under the cliff over to the east there. Tell her the Kahuna sent you\f2\emdash\f1 she'll help you out. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? Did I hear about the time a mermaid rescued a human? Who told you that!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You shouldn't listen to old stories. Most of them are just that\f2\emdash\f1 stories.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You wanna talk about that little picture show? Sorry friend, but I don't.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whenever a tragedy happens at sea, you can bet there's a mermaid behind it. I've been told that ever since I was a little girl.\par
*: Ach, but I shouldn't be thinking such things while our brave boys are out there fighting to save the town...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've told you friend, I don't want to talk about mermaids. Just hearing the word sends shivers down my spine.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All that stuff about the mermaid is baloney. It's just something grown-ups made up to scare us out of going too far out to sea alone. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids don't scare me, I... I just don't wanna be on my own right now. You couldn't stick around until I fall asleep, could you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, friend. Is there something I can do for you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells the cannon lady that he and his friends are going to help fight the tentacular. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well now, is that so? Want to borrow one of my beautiful cannons? Tentaculars hate loud noises, you know! When they hear \lquote kani kanono\rquote , they go pupule! Yeah, that boom drives them wild!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll let you have one, but on one condition: you gotta promise to take good care of it. These cannons are my babies. And they're all I have to remind me of my late husband... Well? Deal? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Shaka! That's what I like to hear! Alright friend, just this one time, I'll let you borrow the biggest, boldest, most ear-splitting piece in my collection! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the kanono cannon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just so you know, it doesn't actually fire anything\f2\emdash\f1 none of my babies do. I couldn't live with myself if they ever hurt anybody. Still, the noise should be more than enough to spook that squid!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a little big to be carrying around in your bag, so I'll have the villagers wheel it over to that ship of yours. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if that's your attitude, you're not laying a finger on any of my babies!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Take good care of that cannon, now. Go take my baby and give that stupid squid the shock of his slimy life! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally decided to see sense, huh? Well? Promise you'll take good care of my baby? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good. Then just this one time, I'll let you borrow the biggest, boldest, most ear-splitting piece in my collection! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the kanono cannon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just so you know, it doesn't actually fire anything\f2\emdash\f1 none of my babies do. I couldn't live with myself if they ever hurt anybody. Still, the noise should be more than enough to spook that squid!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a little big to be carrying around in your bag, so I'll have the villagers wheel it over to that ship of yours. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if that's your attitude, you're not laying a finger on any of my babies!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Take good care of that cannon, now. Go take my baby and give that stupid squid the shock of his slimy life! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes the men who come here to buy pearls ask us if we know where they can find mermaids too.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I heard one of them say something about their meat making you live forever. It's crazy talk, if you ask me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I asked my tutu\f2\emdash\f1 that means my grandpa\f2\emdash\f1 what mermaids look like, and this is what he said:\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They have rosy cheeks that shine like pearls, long tails covered in shiny scales, and eyes as deep and blue as the ocean...but!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Their mouths are filled with razor-sharp teeth, and they're so big they can gobble up little kids like me in a single bite! Hee hee! They must look so funny! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody in Lonalulu knows the story of the mermaid's curse\f2\emdash\f1 the one from Auntie's picture show.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids might look pretty, but underneath it all, they're super mean\f2\emdash\f1 it's all just an act to trick you into giving them the things you love the most. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The doors are firmly locked. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My boy Kainui sailed west with the rest of the men. They've gone to do something about the tentacular that's been attacking our ships.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're looking for him, that's where he'll be.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But be careful out there, traveller\f2\emdash\f1 there are scarier things than giant squid in the sea. If you spy a mermaid, steer well clear, or you'll be waving aloha 'oe to your souls!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Now the tentacular's taken care of, all the fishermen have come back to the village. One of them's gotta be the guy we're looking for.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Still, finding Kai can wait. We're the guests of honour here\f2\emdash\f1 for now, let's just kick back and enjoy the party!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I've gotten used to being run out of every town I roll through. Feels kinda funny having this whole place singing our praises. Heh heh...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Isn't this a wonderful party, darling? I'm making so many fabulous new friends!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Oh, and you simply must try the giant calamari! It's to die for!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I've asked around about Kai, but nobody around here has seen him. Seems he's not much of a party person.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Michelle's still waiting for us back on that island. We should try to track him down as soon as we can. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell It'sh sho much fun shailin' wiv Shylv on the Shalty Shtallion! 'E's my besht mate! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grrr! That Kai really grinds my gears! The whole village is here having fun, and he's nowhere to be seen! What's his problem!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't thank you enough, friend! If you hadn't bailed us out, I never would have made it back here to see my favourite girl shaking her stuff! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Woohoo! It feels so good to finally let our hair down after all those days of worry! Thank you, friend! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oof! These boys sure are keeping me busy tonight! I'm working wikiwiki just to keep up with them\f2\emdash\f1 but I wouldn't have it any other way!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it's all thanks to you, friend! You're the hero of Lonalulu! Now eat, drink and be merry!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your friend's a real cutie-pie\f2\emdash\f1 and strong too. He can whisk me off my feet any day of the week! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, friend! I think you have what it takes to be one heck of a fisherman! What do you say? When your adventure's over, wanna come ride the boats with us? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ha ha ha! You don't mess around, huh? But I know you got more important things to do. Maybe one day, huh? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here he is\f2\emdash\f1 the hero who triumphed over the monstrous squid! I must admit, I thought you rather a weak-kneed sort when I first laid eyes on you, but I'm glad I was wrong!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to you, the pearl trade will soon be up and running again, and I'm perfectly placed to profit from it! I can't thank you enough! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How are you enjoying the luau, friend? If it wasn't for you, we'd still be out fighting that squid\f2\emdash\f1 but instead we're back home having a whale of a time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, by the way\f2\emdash\f1 you were looking for Kai, right? That boy doesn't like to party, so you probably won't find him round here. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ohhh, I'm shtronger than the shtormy sheash, and shwifter than the ocean breeze! Catch me if you caaan, I'm a Lonalulu maaan! \f3\u9834?\f1  Hic! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You were amazing in the battle against the tentacular. In fact, I've composed a song to commemorate your victory. Would you care to hear it? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well. I call it...\lquote Aloha 'Oe, Tentacular\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha 'oe, ocean's daughter! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Stormy child of stormy waters! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
*: The heroes came, and bashed your brains! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We'll neeever see your like agaiiin! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...A masterpiece, wouldn't you agree? And to think, I wrote it in a single night! Sometimes I surprise even myself. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Oh. All that effort for nothing. Well, don't let me keep you\f2\emdash\f1 you clearly have more important things to be doing. Other masterpieces to ignore. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wheeey! I might have had a few tashty bevereragesh, but I can shtill shpeak with the shpiritsh! (burp) Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That stinking tentacular ripped a hole in the side of my ship, but Kai said he'd fix it up for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's a good kid. And a great fisherman. You can count on him for pretty much anything\f2\emdash\f1 except maybe cracking a smile! Heh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure you're keen to get going, but how could we let our heroes leave in such a shabby ship? After all you've done for us, it's the least we can do to give it a spring clean!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We'll work through the night if we have to! By the time we're done, it'll be shining like a well-oiled cannon! Why don't you go let your hair down until then, huh? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're a real hero\f2\emdash\f1 we could use more men like you in Lonalulu. Say, why don't you quit adventuring and come move in with me? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The mermaids used their wiles to make that scary squid attack us. My tutu told me so.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Umm... Do you know what a wile is? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tell me, traveller\f2\emdash\f1 have you seen my no-good, lolo husband? He said he was going to get his head examined, whatever that means. I should get mine looked at for marrying such a dope! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mahalo, traveller. Thanks so much for dealing with that demon squid. Now we're back to business as usual, the future of my store is safe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As long as I don't drink away all my gold at the bar, that is... Must...stay away... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here we are having the biggest luau in a generation, and Kai still won't join in. Made some excuse about having to go down to the dock to fix his friend's boat...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wooow! Auntie Serena's your friend, huh? You're so lucky!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's so nice and kind and pretty! I wish I could travel around the world with a lady like her! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Auntie Jade is sooo cool! I want her to teach me how to beat up monsters!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Veronica's nice too, but...she's kinda immature. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's way past my bedtime already, but tonight's a special night, so Ma says I can stay up as late as I want!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And Pa's home too! This is the best day ever! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Folks don't usually stop kids running around unless they have something super exciting to tell them. ...Well, do you? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You do, huh? Well, I kinda wanna hear it...but I also kinda wanna go back to running around. Tell me later, okay? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You don't? Then let me get back to having fun! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hey. You're the guys who beat the tentacular, right? We owe you one for that, for sure.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should get back to the luau\f2\emdash\f1 I'll bet the rest of the men will be missing their guests of honour already. ...Unless you got some business with me?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You're looking for a guy called Kai, huh? Sure, that's me\f2\emdash\f1 Kainui to my ma, but everybody else just calls me Kai. What do you want? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Remind Kai that Michelle is waiting for him? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell Nothing, huh? Then why are you looking for me? Guess you guys had too much fun at the party already... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell (sigh) You guys again? Look, if there's something you wanna say, spit it out already. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Remind Kai that Michelle is waiting for him? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell Look, I appreciate what you've done for us, but can you quit messing with me? I gotta get this boat fixed. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I'm helping to treat the wounded sailors, but something rather strange is going on\f2\emdash\f1 they keep coming back to me with new injuries.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I've been asking them all their names, by the way, but I haven't come across a Kai yet. I hope he isn't too badly hurt to come and see me or anything... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Serena's so kind and gentle. Why can't my wife be more like her? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It mighta been the demon squid's fault, but I still feel bad for leavin' my wife and kids alone for so long.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: From now on, every time I go out to sea, I'm gonna bring back a whole pile o' pearls to make up for it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pa's back and Ma's feeling better\f2\emdash\f1 that means I don't have to spend all day taking care of the inn any more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks, uncle. You're my hero! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As soon as I heard my husband was coming home, I felt a hundred times better. Turns out I wasn't ill\f2\emdash\f1 I was just sick with worry. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every once in a while, the lamplight reflecting on the water looks like a million little sparkly fishes leaping out of the sea... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Niao! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My little ones are so happy to have their pa back. They were so excited to see him, they completely wore themselves out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I had to see my kids again. That's what gave me courage to fight the tentacular. I couldn't let them down.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend. If it wasn't for you, I might never have seen them again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Papa... You came back... Zzz... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I stepped out from the party to take a breather, and the quiet of the night and the lapping of the waves put me in something of a reflective mood...\par
Thought I'd take a wee stroll around town to settle my thoughts when I bumped into Kainui's mother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell She tells me her boy's down at the dock. Maybe you should go and have a word.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I'm going to stay here and chat a while longer. You go on without me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mahalo, travellers. You defeated the demon squid and saved the village. I can't thank you enough.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And to top it all, my boy made it home safe. He's down at the dock fixing a friend's boat, by the way.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He takes after me, you know\f2\emdash\f1 I don't like parties either. That's why I came up here where it's quiet. But you're the guests of honour\f2\emdash\f1 you should go have some fun with the other young people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Are you sure it's my Kainui you're looking for? He's never had any visitors before.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's always been such a serious boy. Even when he was little, he hardly ever played with the other children. I hope you can be a good friend to him.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell You found Kai? That's great news! Now we're one step closer to finding out if that pearl that sank to the bottom of the ocean was really one of the Orbs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell We better head back and tell that mermaid\f2\emdash\f1 after we've filled up on calamari! Seriously, the food here is incredible! I'm sure Michelle can wait a little while longer. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, friend! Are you shtill having fun? This party'sh aaall for you\f2\emdash\f1 forget about your worriesh and enjoy yourshelf! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Honestly, if it's not one thing with that boy, it's another! Kai just ran up to the church with a face like thunder! What in the world's gotten into him now? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell A fisherman ran up to the church just now\f2\emdash\f1 he looked very upset. I do hope it's not another injury...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell\par
Oh, was that Kai? How strange. I thought he'd be pleased to hear that Michelle was still thinking about him, but he looked rather gloomy... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell If you're looking for Kai, you've just missed him. He was here a moment ago, but he ran straight through that door without even saying hello.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell The poor lad looked a bit upset. Has something happened?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My son just passed through here. He's always been a quiet boy, but he looked like he was biting his lip more than ever...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That door leads to Saikiki Beach. It's home to the village graveyard, where the souls of the departed are returned to the ocean.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kainui always hated that place. Why would he go there now?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The gravestone is old and worn, and the inscription is too faded to read. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Hello again, my friend! I'm so, so happy you've returned! It's been so long since you went off, I got a bit concerned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I worried that your ship had sunk, or Kai had gone away. That's why I'm singing happy songs\f2\emdash\f1 to keep my tears at bay.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell ...But you don't need to know that! Seriously, shut up, Shell! The only thing that matters now is that you're safe and well.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell ...So tell me, did you find my Kai? Is he as well as ever? Is he on his way to meet me here, so we can be together? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Lie to Michelle and tell her that Kai is coming to meet her?<yesno 2>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Kai told you he was coming? Wait, but if that's really true...why are you here all on your own? Why isn't he with you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Keep lying to Michelle?<yesno 2>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> makes up a story to explain away Kai's absence. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells Michelle the truth. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell ...My Kai is dead? That can't be true! I don't believe a word! It's ludicrous! Ridiculous! Preposterous! Absurd!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Hold on a minute\f2\emdash\f1 what's that thing you're holding in your hand? A net of pearls and seashells on a pretty coral band... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> gives Michelle the lovers' veil. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell You say my Kai made me this veil to wear when we were wed, and clutched it as he passed away... You're saying that he's...dead?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell No! Please, no! It can't be so! I know he'd never break that promise that he made to me\f2\emdash\f1 there must be some mistake!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell How can my Kai have passed away? I nursed him back to health! I simply won't believe it...till I've found out for myself...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I need to meet the Kai you met, and hear it straight from him. Take me to Lonalulu\f2\emdash\f1 you can sail, and I can swim.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell ...What's that? Why don't I come aboard? Oh, thanks\f2\emdash\f1 you're very kind. But there's a lot to think about. I'll follow on behind. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Is my darling on his way or not? I have to know! Hurry up and spill the beans\f2\emdash\f1 stop torturing me so! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell Alright, you. I 'ear you managed to find that Kai bloke. Nice one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Dave\cell The rest o' the gang are back on board an' ready to get sailin'. Let's 'ead to the Strand an' let that mermaid know wot's 'appened to 'er bloke, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know, I like Pa a whole lot more since he came home. Thanks for bringing him back! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pa's still playing music at the luau. Doesn't he ever get tired? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey uncle, listen to this\f2\emdash\f1 I've decided that when I grow up, I'm gonna be a traveller just like you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: First thing I'll need is super-straight traveller hair. How do you get it like that? Come on, what's the secret? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My wife's mad with me for looking at another girl... She won't let me back in the house...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guess I owe you something for stopping that squid, huh? Hey, how about I teach you the secret of a happy marriage?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's simple: whenever your wife gets mad, just bite your lip, look super sad and say \lquote I'm sorry\rquote , like, a thousand times.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
