\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... Not one of my best, huh? I feel like it's missing something\f2\emdash\f1 maybe if I segued into a whole other song? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
