\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ohhh, sho you've found that fisherman you were looking for, eh? Hmm! He'sh quite the catch! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ooh...the way you move, baby... It'sh got me in a shpin... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell He's talking in his sleep. It sounds like he's having a pleasant dream. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
