\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ha! I shoulda known! You're a smart one huh, friend? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? \lquote Mermaid's tears\rquote , that's what.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say that they're made when a mermaid cries in the moonlight. I didn't even think the heartless things could cry... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Zzz... Just light the fuse, and... (SNORT) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell She's talking in her sleep. It seems like she's having an exciting dream. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Niao... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The beach behind the church may seem like a sad and lonesome place, but it's very special to us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: From there, the spirits of the deceased enter the ocean and swim all the way back to the World Tree to be reborn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's why we put the graves so close to the sea\f2\emdash\f1 so that our dear, departed friends don't lose their way. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, traveller. You're looking for Kai again, huh? When did that kid get so popular?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, he won't be out at sea at this time of night. Have you tried his house? It's the last one on the right when you head outta the village. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Aloha, Kai. Hey, wanna hang? Moon's out, and everything's real pretty. We could shoot the breeze, you know, like old times...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're too busy for all that stuff? Pah! You think you're too good for it, you mean! Fine! Be like that! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, friend. Out for a walk, huh? Well, it's getting late\f2\emdash\f1 be careful you don't trip over in the darkness.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (chomp munch guzzle) Mmm! Nothing beats my wife's cooking! She's a genius! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell If the locals see a mermaid, it'll fill their hearts with fear. I'll hide on this abandoned beach and wait for Kai right here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I'm sorry to keep asking, but this is my final plea: would you please find that man you met and bring him back to me? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell If only I could walk on land without harming my health, I'd run up to the village and seek out that boy myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I'm sorry to keep asking you to do these things for me, but please find Kai and bring him here. This is my final plea. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Wait a minute, <pc>. Kai seemed pretty upset back there. I know he's not the friendliest person, but I think he probably needs some company right now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Let's check on him before we head back to the village. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> acquires Lorelei's harp! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's a note at the bottom of the chest. <pc> takes it out and begins to read...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Dear friend, if you are reading this, it means I've gone away. If what you said to me is true, I don't think I can stay.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Thanks for all you've done for me, and please don't feel too sad\f2\emdash\f1 after my Kai, you're the kindest friend I ever had.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I promised that I'd take you to the mermaids' seabed town, and though I can't come with you now, this harp will take you down.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote You'll find a shining whirlpool far inside the inland sea. Sail over it and strum that harp to meet Her Majesty.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Please tell the Queen I'm happy now, and there's no need to cry. I'm finally reunited with my dear, darling Kai.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Perhaps one day we'll meet again, but for now, farewell. You'll be my friend until the end.\par
Yours sincerely, Shell.\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, you've been to Saikiki Beach, huh? And by the look in your eye, I'm thinking you learned the truth behind the tale of the mermaid's curse.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you did friend, can I ask that you don't tell the rest of the villagers what really happened?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's nobody left who was around when it was all going on, so it's not like anyone needs to know. And I'd rather people kept on being scared of mermaids\f2\emdash\f1 nothing ever ends well where they're concerned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please friend, forget about it. I don't want any more of my fellow villagers to have to suffer like Kainoa did.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that the tentacular's out of the way, my stall is back in business! If anything catches your eye, just let me know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that the tentacular's out of the way, my stall is back in business! If anything catches your eye, just let me know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of the guests at the inn told me a secret\f2\emdash\f1 he said that there's a magic painting in a village far to the west of here that can bring you good luck!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, to tell the truth, he said it was \lquote far to the wesht of here\rquote ... But then, he also said I was his \lquote besht mate\rquote ... Maybe he just imagined the whole thing... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of my merchant friends has recently gone missing. I must admit, it's got me quite concerned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Last I heard, he was on his way west to visit Phnom Nonh and see the famous fresco that can make a man a millionaire. Nobody has seen him since...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of my merchant friends has recently gone misshing. I musht admit, it'sh got me quite concerned... Hic!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lasht I heard, he was on his way wesht to visit Phnom Nonh and shee the famoush freshco that can make a man a millionaire. Nobody has sheen him shince... Hic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So friend, where to next? ...Huh? You're going to the bottom of the sea to see the mermaid queen? Ha ha ha! You're a funny guy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Owau. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kai showed you inside his tutu's cabin, eh? It's been a while since anybody outside the family's been in there. So, how did you like my old home?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always thought that place was so lonely and quiet, but my pa\f2\emdash\f1 he saw something I couldn't. His pictures prove that... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't know what's happened between you and my Kai, but he seems to trust you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since he was a little boy, he's always had a hard time opening up to other people. You're the first real friend he's made. Be nice to him, won't you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I never would have believed it, but Kai's started skipping work\f2\emdash\f1 word is he's got himself a girlfriend! People sure can change when they fall in love...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, traveller. You're friends with Kai, right? He's usually the first one out in the morning, but not today. I've never known him to miss work before... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Kai's usually such a hard-working guy, but he didn't show his face at the harbour all day. I wonder what's gotten into him... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Have I heard the one about the mermaid's curse? Have I ever! My ma told it to me when I was just a little girl, and I've been scared of the sea ever since!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which is a good thing\f2\emdash\f1 the ocean's a dangerous place. Who knows how many lives have been saved by the fear that story inspired in our people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought this cat was trying to get his sneaky paws on my catch, but he was chasing off a rat who was doing just that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I know the truth, me and him are best buds!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a rumour going around that Kai's started skipping work.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's been going over to Saikiki Beach and staring out over the ocean for hours... I'm kinda worried about him... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How do you like our beds, friend? ...Huh? The sheets are too thin and the wind blows right through them? All the better to keep you cool! So...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody's talking about Kai missing work. It's never happened before. What in the world's gotten into the boy? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My girl's like a she-slime\f2\emdash\f1 she looks like a pushover, but she's actually pretty tough. And if you make her angry, you're in for a world of pain!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But when she flashes me that sweet little smile of hers, my heart just melts. (sigh) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Mermaids' tears are the same as human ones? Ha ha ha! You're a funny one, friend! Everybody knows mermaids cry pearls! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uncle Kai's gone to Saikiki Beach! He's so brave going there all on his own\f2\emdash\f1 if the mermaids don't get him, the ghosts sure will! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, uncle! What are you doing back in Lonalulu? Well, whatever it is, you're welcome any time! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, my poor child\f2\emdash\f1 you seem a little down today. Is something wrong? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see... Well, I shall pray that the source of your anguish ceases to torment you. Now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, I'm sorry. That was awfully presumptuous of me. Ahem...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell I'm sorry for making you do all that stuff for me and my family, but...thanks. Because of you, my eyes are finally open.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell In my heart of hearts, I think I hated my grandpa more than I hated the mermaid who cursed him. I was...ashamed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell But now I know the truth. He wasn't cursed\f2\emdash\f1 he was in love.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's a painting of a beautiful mermaid wearing the lovers' veil. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> strums briefly on Lorelei's harp.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell An enormous bubble surrounds the Salty Stallion and drags it down into the whirlpool! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Queen Marina's such a dear, there's really no one kinder. But finding her's not easy\f2\emdash\f1 do you need a quick reminder? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Just sail into the inland sea and park above the glow, then strum the harp I gave you and you'll soon be pulled below!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I'll stay right here, although I know my darling's running late. A mermaid lives five hundred years\f2\emdash\f1 I have the time to wait.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell If Queen Marina asks for me, please tell her that I'm well\f2\emdash\f1 and next time that she sees me, she should call me Mrs Shell! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell You know the way? Okay, I hope you find the dear old place. I'll wait right here till Kai decides to show his handsome face.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Don't worry about me, I won't be lonely on my own. As long as Kai is in my heart, I'll never be alone. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Queen Marina's such a dear, there's really no one kinder. But finding her's not easy\f2\emdash\f1 do you need a quick reminder? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell Just sail into the inland sea and park above the glow, then strum the harp I gave you and you'll soon be pulled below!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell I'll stay right here, although I know my darling's running late. A mermaid lives five hundred years\f2\emdash\f1 I have the time to wait.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell If Queen Marina asks for me, please tell her that I'm well\f2\emdash\f1 and the next time that she sees me, she should call me Mrs Shell! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Michelle\cell You know the way? Okay, I hope you find the dear old place. I'll wait right here till Kai decides to show his handsome face. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: People tell many tales, but only one version of a story can be true. You should not believe everything you hear. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, you've been to Saikiki Beach, huh? And by the look in your eye, I'm thinking you learned the truth behind the tale of the mermaid's curse.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you did friend, can I ask that you don't tell the rest of the villagers what really happened?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's nobody left who was around when it was all going on, so it's not like anyone needs to know. And I'd rather people kept on being scared of mermaids\f2\emdash\f1 nothing ever ends well where they're concerned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please friend, forget about it. I don't want any more of my fellow villagers to have to suffer like Kainoa did. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My boy's been acting very strangely of late. He used to stay well away from Saikiki Beach, but now he never leaves the place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His grandpa spent most of his life in the cabin overlooking that beach. Kai's always hated visiting...until now... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see a lot of weird things out on the ocean. Why, just the other day, I saw a huge pillar of light rising from the middle of the inland sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Huh? You're telling me that's a magic whirlpool that leads to the home of the mermaids? Wah hah hah hah! Oh, friend! I never knew you had such a wild imagination! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Something changed the night of the luau... I used to think Kai was a sullen stick-in-the-mud, but now he seems so mysterious. I can't stop thinking about him... Ugh, I hate it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a rumour going around the village that the Darkspawn has been sighted just off the coast\f2\emdash\f1 walking on the top of the waves, no less.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say he's the one who made the tentacular go all pupule and attack our ships. If you know what's good for you friend, you'll stay well away. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you ask me, this Darkspawn's no stranger to our village. I think he's been living here all along. In fact, I think I know who he is... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell You know, it's funny. The moment I gave you that veil, it was like a weight was lifted from my heart.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell This village may not be perfect, but it's my home. I'm not like my grandpa. I want to make a life here. Raise a family...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell Thank you, friend. You've really opened my eyes. May the wind always fill your sails, and guide you wherever you need to go.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell When I stare out over the sea, the only thing I see is that mermaid's face staring back at me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell I wish I could go back to that night. If I could, I never would have let go of her hand...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Kainui\cell Now I know how my grandpa felt... He was...in love...\par
\cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.17 Nautica\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\b0\fs22\cell The Rainbough starts to glow. One of the Orbs must be nearby! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? What am I doing? Why, I'm fishing for fish fit for a dish to put before the Queen! I'm the official maker of Her Majesty's meals, don't you know!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What are you looking at me like that for? You humans fish for fish too, don't you? Why can't we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Queen Marina's orders are the cause of some disquiet. When she told us we must welcome you, it nearly caused a riot.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Know this, human beings: if you mean to harm our realm, I'll take this fork and split you from your heel to your helm!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm sorry! Please don't hurt me! Please don't eat me! Please don't bish and bash and beat me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In all my two-score and twenty-ten years, I've never talked to a human till today. You must be the guests Queen Marina mentioned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's Her Majesty's magic that lets you breathe below the water\f2\emdash\f1 a special service for our guests of honour! Without it, you'd be goners!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She awaits you in her pearly palace at the pinnacle of the prominence. I speak, of course, of the tower at the top of the hill.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The music of the mermaids has the power to ease your pain. Are you in some discomfort? Shall I sing a soothing strain? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if you're sure you're feeling fine...but please don't push yourself. Come back at any time and I will sing you back to health.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mermaid sings a mystical melody that drifts pleasantly through the water around you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The party's HP and MP are completely restored!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, all, to Nautica, the realm beneath the foam. You're Queen Marina's honoured guests\f2\emdash\f1 so make yourselves at home! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: No gills! No fins! A pair of limbs just where his tail should be! My goodness! It's a human being, underneath the sea!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've hoped to meet a human ever since I was in school! And now there's one in front of me\f2\emdash\f1 wow, this is really cool! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When it comes to humans, many mermen are wary\f2\emdash\f1 they think they're scary. But compared to my little brother, you lot are like lovely little lambs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear, I fear I've said too much. Please forget the words you just heard.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a family matter. Nothing to do with you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pardon me for publicly proclaiming my problems. It's a family matter. Nothing to do with you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: H-H-Humans! What are you doing down here!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you eat us, we won't give you eternal life! All you'll get is eternal strife!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You're looking for an enormous, orb-like pearl? I don't know what you mean\f2\emdash\f1 but my wits aren't that keen. If you want someone keener, go and see Queen Marina! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to the seabed realm, o humans from on high. It has been many centuries since last your kind dropped by.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should miss the air above, just tell me and I'll send you. I have the power to summon bubbles, one of which I'll lend you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, travellers? What say you? Shall I put my plans in motion, and send you and your ship back to the surface of the ocean? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If ever you should wish to visit Nautica again, just sail over our entranceway and strum that sweet refrain. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're staying, then? In that case, Nautica is through that cave. I hope you have a fine time in the land beneath the waves!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It doesn't matter what you are: fish, squid, mermaid or man\f2\emdash\f1 all I care is that you buy as much stuff as you can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've come a long way, human, just to nose around my store. But that's okay\f2\emdash\f1 please, nose away! Then nose away some more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
There's no reply. It doesn't seem to understand what <pc> is saying.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm keeping this house tidy while the owner is away. She said she'd be back shortly, but it seems there's some delay.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, this is super secret, but I think you can be trusted\f2\emdash\f1 after all, you're human\f2\emdash\f1 our kind might well be disgusted.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You might have noticed there's an extra pillow on the bed\f2\emdash\f1 Michelle has met a human, and they're going to be wed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm somewhat scared of humans, but I'm sure this one is nice. Michelle's a connoisseur\f2\emdash\f1 only the finest will suffice!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to the palace of the Queen Beneath the Sea. Her Majesty awaits you in the throne room presently.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, the hall is high above, and we do not use stairs. But if you will permit me, I will carry you up there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just take my hand, I'll take you up\f2\emdash\f1 as simple as can be. So tell me: are you all prepared to meet Her Majesty? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well then, hold on tight\f2\emdash\f1 we don't want you to fall! A moment's swim and we'll be in the Queen's audience hall! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well then. When you're ready, come and talk to me. I'll take you up top in a flash\f2\emdash\f1 I swim wonderfully! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty awaits in the throne room, keen for an audience with you. Shall I go ahead and take you up, so you can tell her what is new? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well then, hold on tight\f2\emdash\f1 we don't want you to fall! A moment's swim and we'll be in the Queen's audience hall! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well then. When you're ready, come and talk to me. I'll take you up top in a flash\f2\emdash\f1 I swim wonderfully! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a priestess of the Sunken Spirit With No Name. Though our gods differ, let us pray together all the same...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you met the Queen and found out all you need to know? Do you require my services in going back below? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well, then\f2\emdash\f1 take my hand, just like you did before. I'll make sure you get down safely to the lower floor. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Very well, just say the word when you would like to go back to where our trip began\f2\emdash\f1 the entrance hall below. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I don't have much to give, but if you let me live, I'll tell you a super special secret!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Okay, here goes... You know that swirling, shining whirlpool you went through to get here? Well, it's not the only one! There are more! I'm sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Each one takes you to a different place\f2\emdash\f1 one even leads to a large lake in the wild, wild west! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm just like you, traveller\f2\emdash\f1 I like travelling too! When I go walking, my favourite place to pace is the snowy sea around Sniflheim.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's a weird whirlpool there that exudes icy water and a bright, blue light. On a sweltering summer's day, it's the perfect spot for a swim! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: P-P-Please, stop staring at me. You're scaring me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you eat me, I won't give you eternal life. All you'll get is eternal strife!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The Rainbough starts to glow brighter than ever before! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell It was not chance that brought you here, it was the World Tree's will. No doubt She has some further fate in store for us two still...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell So set sail on the tide of time, that flows ceaselessly on, and if Yggdrasil wills it, we shall meet again anon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Remember, though the paths we walk are filled with twists and turns, all roads lead from the Tree of Life, and to the Tree return. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Greetings, Luminary. Pray, what brings you back to me? Do you require the counsel of the Queen Beneath the Sea? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm hm. I thought so. If you're happy to be led, allow me to advise you on the path that lies ahead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell In the western reaches, through a shining whirlpool's swirls, there lies a fine academy for graceful little girls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The master's an eccentric sort, you might think him quite mad, but if you were to visit him, I'm sure he'd make you glad.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell This is all the vision granted unto me did show. Go forth, my child, and find this place. The World Tree wills it so. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm hm. I thought so. If you're happy to be led, allow me to advise you on the path that lies ahead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Far, far to the west of here, where light floats on the seas, a village stands in ancient lands, and ruins in the trees.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell If ever you discover that your path ahead is blocked, these ruins may provide the key to opening that lock...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell This is all the vision granted unto me did show. Go forth, my child, and find this place. The World Tree wills it so. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm hm. I thought so. If you're happy to be led, allow me to advise you on the path that lies ahead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell To the north-east of this city there's a field of golden wheat where a long-established inn sits like a pillow on a sheet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell The people there will tell you of a kingdom long since done where what was thought lost to the world may once again be won.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell This is all the vision granted unto me did show. Go forth, my child, and find this place. The World Tree wills it so. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm hm. I thought so. If you're happy to be led, allow me to advise you on the path that lies ahead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell There's a frozen northern kingdom, where a wicked woman wreaks a reign of icy terror\f2\emdash\f1 you shall find there what you seek.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell This is all the vision granted unto me did show. Go forth, my child, and find this place. The World Tree wills it so.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Hm hm hm. I thought so. If you're happy to be led, allow me to advise you on the path that lies ahead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Your journey's almost over\f2\emdash\f1 only Yggdrasil awaits. Go to the First Forest, child, and meet your final fate!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Remember, though the paths we walk are filled with twists and turns, all roads lead from the Tree of Life, and to the Tree return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Then all is well. But if you're ever unsure where to go, pray come back here and speak with me\f2\emdash\f1 I'll tell you all I know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell I have a certain second sight which grants me clouded visions of things that yet await you, which may help you make decisions.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Marina\cell Remember, though the paths we walk are filled with twists and turns, all roads lead from the Tree of Life, and to the Tree return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When Queen Marina was a little mer-girl, she used to swim to the surface, pull gulls' legs and come back peppered with pecks...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's good for a girl to want to see the world, but as Her Majesty's personal protector, I'm so glad she learned to forsake it\f2\emdash\f1 my poor heart couldn't take it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Humans live on land, mermaids swim the sea, and that's the way it'll always be. Still, in Queen Marina's eyes, we're all equal.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty's a magnanimous monarch. Firm, but fair. We could all learn a thing or two from her.\par
\cell\row 
