\b\fs24 1.18 Viking Hideout\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\b0\fs22\cell *: Welcome, traveller! You are either brave or stupid to sail into our hideout so brazenly! We are the Vikings, dreaded scourge of the northern seas!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What business do you have with us? If it is Sniflheim you seek, you're in the wrong place\f2\emdash\f1 raise your anchor and sail around the cape to the east! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whatever needs doing around here, I'm the one who's gotta do it. I fix up their ship, shift their cargo...they even make me pour their drinks...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's all because I'm the new guy. Ever since I joined, these Vikings have been working me to the bone... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Me an' the boysh were drinkin' to celebrate the haul we got on the lasht raid... I guessh I hit the firewater a bit too hard...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (yawn) I'm gonna go and shleep it off... Shweet dreamsh, shtranger... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're a long way from home, world-walker. I'm the Chief of the Vikings, and this is my hideout. What do you think you're doing here?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Well, if you ain't here to cause trouble, you can stick around. So long as I've got the wind in my sails, gold in my hold and a flagon full of mead, I'm happy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The world might be going to rack and ruin all around us, but that don't mean nothing to me! Graaah hah hah! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm the Chief's personal bodyguard. At first, I just did it for the gold, but now I'm a fully fledged member of the gang.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would ask how you fit in here, but it's pretty plain that you don't. If there's somewhere you've gotta be, I'd recommend you get going. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, world-walker! Well met! You got a lot of guts, sailing all the way across the stormy northern seas!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our younglings could do with taking a leaf out of your book. The Viking life ain't easy, but some of them find it so hard they turn tail and run! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All the treasure in this room belongs to us Vikings...well, it does now, anyway!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure, it might not all be mine, but seeing all this gold and silver still gives me the giggles. Just look how shiny it is! Geh heh heh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
