*: The snowstorms that plague this forest make it very treacherous indeed\f2\emdash\f1 I've lost contact with my squad thanks to the latest one. I'd advise you to leave before the same happens to you and your friends. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have travelled all the way from Heliodor to come to Sniflheim's aid. The witch who froze the city is somewhere in this forest. If we can cut her down, it may break her spell.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Unfortunately, our squad has become separated in this blasted blizzard, and the Commander is nowhere to be found. He is a knight beyond compare, but like all men of Heliodor, he feels the cold... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: If the Commander were to encounter the witch alone... And if her monstrous protector were with her... (gulp)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He may be the finest knight in all Heliodor, but in this climate, I fear they might have the edge over him. We must find him, and fast! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) Why must I be dragged to these bleak backwaters? I am the scion of one of the most noble houses of Heliodor! I knew it was a mistake joining the army.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If only I'd ignored everyone's advice and followed in the footsteps of my rake of a father. I could be sitting on a beach in Puerto Valor right now, watching the girls go by... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So...c-c-cold... My squad were c-c-caught in a snowstorm, and b-b-before I knew it, I was all on my own... I hope they f-f-find me before that wicked witch does... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I know you, don't I? I'm sure I've seen your face before...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes... Something about you is very familiar indeed...but I can't quite place it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, never mind. I have more important matters to be attending to at present\f2\emdash\f1 like finding the Commander, post-haste! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It's the bed that <pc> was just sleeping in. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Isn't this snowstorm awful, <pc>? When I woke up this morning, all I could see was white. I wonder why it has worsened so suddenly...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell ...What? You say that you found the witch, but she escaped? Oh no\f2\emdash\f1 this must be her doing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell If that wicked woman has her way, my kingdom will never see summer again. But how will we ever defeat her? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell If that wicked witch has her way, my kingdom will never see summer again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell But if she escaped from the Hekswood, goodness knows where she will be hiding now. How can we possibly find her? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Goodness gracious! Where in the world did this blizzard come from? I came to this country to pick up a few bargains, but I never bargained for this! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some soldiers from 'Eliodor came through 'ere the other day an' sailed off, quick as you like.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The feller in charge looked familiar\f2\emdash\f1 a big unit wiv a face like thunder an' a natty little beard. Reckon 'e's some kind of bigwig in the 'Eliodorian army. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aaagh, what is wrong with the weather in this kingdom!? If it gets any colder, even the fieriest fandango won't be enough to keep me warm!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if I stop now, I'll freeze for sure...so I suppose I'll just have to keep on dancing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feel free to watch\f2\emdash\f1 my moves are guaranteed to get your blood pumping! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I stop dancing now, I'll freeze for sure...so I suppose I'll just have to keep going!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feel free to watch\f2\emdash\f1 my moves are guaranteed to get your blood pumping! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Brr... I have never known such cold. This is more than a Gallopolitan can take. I so wished to see the Crystal Kingdom, but now I am thinking I ought to cut my trip short... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why does this country have to be so cold? As if my luck wasn't bad enough! I was following Sir Hendrik and the others back to the city when we were caught in a blizzard, you see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The others must have thought me lost for good, because they've sailed away and left me. Honestly, it never rains but it snows! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This building's like a puzzle box\f2\emdash\f1 when you press the goolowing switches, the walls and staircases spin around, and you can goo to different places.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But first you've got to press this big, gooreen button next to me\f2\emdash\f1 that will activate the switches so you can actually ooze them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Once you've pressed this button, keep your eyes peeled for the other goolowing gooreen switches\f2\emdash\f1 there's one on this level that will open a way upstairs! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This library was built a long, long slime agoo, before the Age of Heroes. That was when the goolorious master of monsters fought against the evil Luminary.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Over the years, more and more books have been added, and now there's a goojillion of them. It's a goldmine of oozeful information. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Krystalinda's bonfire is burning brightly. <pc> feels his toes begin to thaw. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The castle is closed to visitors after dark, I am afraid. If you wish to go in, you will have to come back during the day. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Cosying up to royals isn't exactly my style. I'll wait out here\f2\emdash\f1 you go see Queen Frysabel without me. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the stars! It is Krystalinda! The wicked witch who terrorised Sniflheim in the Age of Heroes has returned!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hold on\f2\emdash\f1 where has she gone? I am sure she was here just a moment ago... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many centuries ago, this city was besieged by a wicked witch who commanded the powers of ice and snow. Her name was Krystalinda.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: For some years now, she has been the primary subject of my research. I thought that I had finally found her...but it seems I was mistaken. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Waaah! I, I'm shaking like a leaf! ...Wait, why am I shaking again?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... I suppose that is just what happens when you get to my age... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why in the world am I shaking so? I suppose that is just what happens when you get to my age... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, wanderer, to the Crystal Kingdom of Sniflheim\f2\emdash\f1 the jewel of the north!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It might be a little colder than you are used to up here, but do not worry\f2\emdash\f1 you won't freeze! Ha ha ha! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wh-Wh-Who are you!? Actually, that does not matter right now\f2\emdash\f1 we must get out of here, fast!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You are asking why? Is it not obvious? Because... Err... Hmm. Why was I running again? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm sure there was something terrifying that I had to escape from, but for the life of me, I cannot remember what it was... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, honey! Why don't you come on in and have some fun? I'll make sure you go home happy! \f3\u9829?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aaagh, AGH! Aaagh, AGH! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We come from the land of the snow and ice, where the\f2\emdash\f1  (COUGH COUGH COUGH)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Urrrgh... I can't stop shivering, and my throat feels so sore. I think I must be coming down with a cold.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ooh, now you have made me angry! Take this! And this! Aaand...THIS! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hehe! You could not hit a barn door with the back of a snow shovel! Throw properly, will you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heave-ho! Heave-ho! \f3\u9834?\f1  I am the snow-shovelling specialist of Sniflheim! Every day I'm shovelling!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My job won't be done till every road in the city is one hundred percent flake-free\f2\emdash\f1 so I guess I better get back to work! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! \f3\u9834?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What time do you call this!? You were supposed to meet me here ages ago! What have you been doing all this time!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What? This is the time we arranged to meet? Don't make me laugh! Have you got any idea what day it is!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This fellow's always been a bit unreliable, but this time he's really taken the cake! Honestly, doing business with unpunctual people is so frustrating! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What the 'eck's goin' on? This 'ole place 'as been frozen for ages, but everyone's goin' about their business like nuffink's 'appened!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been tryin' to tell 'em they were all 'uman icicles till five minutes ago, but no one believes me! Either they've all gone bonkers, or I 'ave... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I saw her with my own eyes, yet I still cannot quite believe it... Tell me, wanderer\f2\emdash\f1 is the witch from the ancient legends among us once more? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So it really was Krystalinda that I saw. She was floating in the sky above the city, smiling sweetly... (shudder)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought she had come to attack us, just as she did so many centuries ago. But at the very moment she was about to unleash her magic, she disappeared. I wonder why... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are right, of course. The legend of the witch is centuries old\f2\emdash\f1 how could she possibly still be alive? I must be seeing things. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Krystalinda... Were you really here, or were you just an illusion...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh! Forgive me, wanderer\f2\emdash\f1 I did not see you there. The castle is closed to visitors after dark, I am afraid. If you wish to see the Queen, you will have to come back in the morning. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hei traveller, listen to this\f2\emdash\f1 my captain here says he saw a witch flying through the sky! He still believes in faerie stories!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At his age, he should know the difference between fantasy and reality! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It makes no sense. I had a pot of delicious fiskesuppe simmering away over the cook-fire, but when I came to check on it, it was frozen solid...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I shall just have to buy some more fishes and cook up another pot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Only a short time ago, this whole city was as silent as the grave, but now it is positively humming with life. What in the world can have happened?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My horse is such a handful. If I do not take her out for a walk every single day, she gets in a very bad mood.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She was just the same when she was a little foal. I thought she might have settled down by now, but sadly no.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, when I see the way that her little eyes light up when she looks out at the ocean, I can almost forget about my frozen toes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You would not believe how much I have bought today! The stallholder offered me such fantastic discounts, I simply could not resist!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a fine fellow he is to put the joy he brings to his customers before his own profit! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of my regular customers is a rich noblewoman. She stopped by this morning and practically bought the whole stall!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And not only that, she paid the full price for everything! ...This is just between you and me, but when I see her coming, I pencil another zero on the end of every price!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And still she says how wonderfully inexpensive everything is! Agh, I wish I had her riches... Well, I mean...more of them than I already do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Roll up, roll up! Come and get the finest fruit and veggies in all of Sniflheim! Everything freshly picked today!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Or at least, I thought it was. All of my stock is frozen solid! I cannot sell this\f2\emdash\f1 if somebody cracked a tooth on one of my apples, I would never hear the end of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just saw my old friend Snorri trotting off to the castle with a big smile on his face.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It was only the other day that he told me he was going to stay in his cabin in the Sn\'e6rfelt, and that he might be gone for some time. I wonder why he is back so soon...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) This merchant will not stop going on about me being late for our appointment.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, sure, I might not be the most punctual person, but I am here now, aren't I? What does a minute or two either way matter, hm? Some people are such sticklers... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come on now, stop being silly. You know that people cannot fly. It must have been a bird, or a cloud or a trick of the light. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It was a lady, Mamma, I am sure it was! She was flying in the air right above the fountain! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, I do so love to take a stroll around the town and see the sights of Sniflheim. These buildings are simply beautiful, are they not?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The stained glass! The intricate latticework! The dramatic pitched roofs that remind one of the mountains! It is enough to make one want to sing! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I deal in the finest herbs and spices from all over Erdrea. Would you care to take a look?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This yellow powder, for instance, comes all the way from the desert kingdom of Gallopolis. It might look like ordinary meal or flour, but it is worth its weight in gold!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, wanderer! Hello, hello! You must have sailed a very long way to get here. Before you leave, you must go and see Queen Frysabel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty is very interested in broadening her horizons. I am sure she would be thrilled to speak with a well travelled fellow such as you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The witch! Flying in the sky, as plain as day! You must have seen her! She was right there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait... You have been \lquote resting your eyes\rquote  again, haven't you? Curse your laziness! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I usually spend my days deep in prayer inside the church, but I had a sudden urge to see the faces of my fellow Sniflheimers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am glad to see that everyone is in good cheer. I pray that their shining smiles may never fade.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot understand it. I have only just finished re-planking the jetty, but half the wood has gone rotten already.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It must have been a bad batch, I suppose. Some of these boards look as if they have been out here for months... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I could have sworn that there were a lot more ships in the harbour just a moment ago.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why did they all sail away so suddenly? Maybe they knew something that we don't... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm stopping off in Sniflheim on my way to see the World Tree. Quick shufti round town, then it's onwards and upwards to Arboria.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope the last leg of the journey isn't as bad as the first\f2\emdash\f1 I'm still getting used to not being seasick all the time. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems our skald's throat is hurting. Just the other day, the minstrel's voice was as clear as a sandpiper, but now it's more like sandpaper. It must be something serious to affect him so suddenly.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mister Minstrel's got a sore throat. But I don't mind waiting. He's sure to get through a song sooner or later.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I got such a surprise when the ice covering the castle suddenly melted away. Does this mean the witch is no more?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If someone really did defeat her, they must have been as strong as anything\f2\emdash\f1 after all, not even Sir Hendrik himself was able to put a stop to her antics! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, my child. What brings you to the land of ice and snow?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Make sure you wrap up warm\f2\emdash\f1 the cold can be more dangerous than any monster, especially for those who are not used to it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are a strange one, friend. Most of my customers come to the front of the counter rather than sneaking around to the back. If you want to buy something, please\f2\emdash\f1 you will have to go around.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's cold outside, wanderer. I expect you will be wanting to buy some nice, new armour to keep yourself warm, hm? Come around to the front and I will see what I can do.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came in here to get out of the cold, but it's just as chilly as it was out there! Honestly, I don't know how the locals dress like this and survive! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know that Sniflheim is famous for the study of the arcane arts? Our scholars are particularly skilled in the field of magical craftsmanship.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many of the weapons and suits of armour available in our shops are enhanced with magical enchantments that make them more powerful.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There are many dangerous monsters lurking in the Sn\'e6rfelt. If you intend to travel through it, I would advise you to purchase some Sniflheim specials before you go! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, dear\f2\emdash\f1 the medicinal herbs have gone all soggy. I was sure I had dried them out properly... Well, I suppose I will just have to hang them out over the fire again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bounty hunter, and I always get my man. They say the Darkspawn's come to Sniflheim. Now I'm here, well...let's just say that he won't be leaving. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Cold out today, isn't it? Why don't you take a break at my inn\f2\emdash\f1 I'll make you a nice, hot meal to warm you up.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Sn\'e6rfelt is home to many dangerous monsters. If you are planning to cross it, you would do well to leave your money with us first.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Finally, I can feel my toes again! I thought I was going to freeze to death in that snowstorm, but I made it out alive somehow.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's strange, the way all that ice suddenly melted away. I wonder what caused it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just around the cape to the west, there is a little cave where the Vikings live. I can always rely on them to buy my mead by the kegful.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If it was not for them, I fear this place might go out of business.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lovely lady outside told me to come in and have a drink, so here I am...again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My wife is going to be terribly angry with me, but it's not my fault... That bunny girl has such tremendous...powers... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am the head of one of the most storied houses of Sniflheim. My life is one of uninterrupted comfort and pleasure\f2\emdash\f1 my only worry is what to spend my vast riches on next! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am training to be an astrologer. Everything to do with stars and planets has fascinated me ever since I was a girl.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many centuries ago, our ancestors stared up into the sea of stars and saw the very same images that we do today. Isn't that a romantic thought? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to the Crystal Kingdom of Sniflheim! Are you here to take a tour of the city and see all of its wonderful architecture? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it! Our beautiful buildings are the envy of all Erdrea!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And Sniflheim Castle is the jewel in the crown, so to speak! Designed in the Age of Heroes by the legendary Gunnar Bilder Borg, it is a must-see for every discerning traveller!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Then perhaps you came to spend some time trekking through the stunning snowfields, enjoying all the natural miracles that our kingdom has to offer? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it! The icy air! The blistering blizzards! Nowhere else in Erdrea can one experience such things!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There is a lake deep in the Sn\'e6rfelt that has remained frozen for many thousands of years. If natural wonders are what you seek, it is not to be missed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Then perhaps you are here to sample some of the culinary delights of which our nation is so rightfully proud? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it! Animals and vegetables grow slowly in these cold climes, but they taste all the better for it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would particularly recommend the fiskesuppe. It is so tasty, you will eat bowl after bowl! Be careful that your belly doesn't burst!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Then are you here to meet the Vikings, perhaps? Those rowdy raiders who are rougher and tougher even than the seas on which they ply their villainous trade?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They are not bad people at heart perhaps, but they are rude and rambunctious, and make trouble wherever they go.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If hearing this about them has made you decide that you would rather not get mixed up in their mischief, you will steer clear of that inlet to the north-west!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, this is strange... The book that Master Snorri asked me to bring him is soaking wet...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) The master is always so strict about the proper storage of ancient tomes. If I take it to him like this, he will be furious... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Master Snorri is a very kindly man, but he can be quite the disciplinarian when it comes to scholarly matters. As his student, one has to be on one's toes at all times! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The throne room is just beyond these doors. Her Majesty is expecting you. Please, proceed inside. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As you can see, it is my duty to guard the doors to the throne room. It is a hard job, having to stand at attention all day.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But whenever I hold the door open for Her Majesty, and she smiles and says \lquote thank you\rquote , it makes it all worthwhile! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It is hard being a guard, but when I tell myself that everything I do is for Queen Frysabel, it gives me the strength to carry on. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Have you heard that long, long ago, a wicked witch used her magical powers to freeze Sniflheim solid?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If ever she returned, she might try to do the same thing again! What a terrifying thought! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: A wicked witch, you say? And she froze the whole city with a single spell? Surely not...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if there is any truth to the tale, the witch's return is a frightening prospect indeed. We should make a plan for how to deal with such an eventuality\f2\emdash\f1 better safe than sorry! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Queen Frysabel and I grew up together. We have been like sisters ever since we were little girls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nobody in this whole castle understands Her Majesty better than I do. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, you must be Her Majesty's honoured guests. The Queen awaits you in the throne room at the top of the stairs. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The walls of this castle are built from thick stone, and they usually do a good job of keeping out the cold.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But today, it is absolutely freezing! It feels like the whole building has been encased in ice! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Queen Frysabel takes such good care of her kingdom. I wish I could say the same about her bedroom.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whenever she goes to bed, she just throws her dirty clothes onto the floor. If it was not for me, this room would be knee-deep in smelly socks! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty awaits you in the throne room, wanderer. It is the grand chamber toward the rear of the palace. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: These doors lead to the lift. If you want to try riding it downstairs, I won't stop you, but there is nothing down there but storerooms and cells... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are here to see Queen Frysabel? Then you should head upstairs to the throne room. You can take the lift back up. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sniflheim is a peaceful place, but every so often, somebody will break that peace, and we must punish them for their crimes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is where we imprison such people until they pledge to change their ways\f2\emdash\f1 and they nearly always do. It is almost like magic! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Thank you, my friend. If not for you, Sniflheim may have remained frozen forever.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Her Majesty is eager to offer you her own personal thanks\f2\emdash\f1 and your reward, of course. You will find her up the stairs here. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell\par
Krystalinda's disguise was flawless. I have been Her Majesty's tutor since she was a little girl, yet even I was fooled.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell I have learned my lesson\f2\emdash\f1 from now on, I must be more wary. Never again will I be hoodwinked by such base trickery! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It might be my imagination, but Her Majesty does not seem herself today. She is a little more...menacing than usual... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, you're the one who saved the Queen, are you? You have our thanks.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But taking care of Her Majesty is our job. The next time something like this happens, we will deal with it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty may have the common touch, but do not forget that she is our queen. If you should offend her in any way, I will be forced to take your head. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, you must be the ones who came to the aid of Her Majesty. Master Snorri told me the whole story.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are honourable indeed to lend your strength to a kingdom that is not your own. Sniflheim owes you a debt of gratitude. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You can't leave at a time like this! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You can't leave at a time like this! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
What are you doing...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell Why would Her Majesty protect the witch who tried to destroy her kingdom? Could she be under Krystalinda's control?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell But her eyes are clear and lucid, and she seems to be in her right mind... Well, there is only one way to find out\f2\emdash\f1 let us hear what she has to say. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Her Majesty turns into a wicked witch, then the real Queen Frysabel jumps out of a book!? What in the world is going on here!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I knew Her Majesty was acting strangely\f2\emdash\f1 it was Krystalinda all along! If the witch harms a hair on that girl's head, she will have me to answer to! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Helv\'edti! Curse that witch! We need to take her down, but we cannot risk Queen Frysabel getting caught up in the melee! Get out of the way, Your Majesty! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Every entrance to the castle is guarded night and day\f2\emdash\f1 how did Krystalinda manage to slip through undetected? Stand back, Your Majesty! We will deal with the witch! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Your Majesty, what are you doing!? Why are you protecting the witch!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I heard a commotion and came running\f2\emdash\f1 what in the world is happening in here!? Is that really the wicked witch from the legends? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Hear this, witch! As long as I draw breath, you shall not harm the Queen! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I feel so happy when you say you love me, but there are four little words that would make me even happier...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Honestly, how long are you going to keep me waiting, my love? Every day is like a dagger in my heart! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Do not worry, darling\f2\emdash\f1 I will say the words you long to hear soon enough, but there are things that we must do first. We have not even met each other's parents yet.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And besides, there is no need to hurry. Or do you not trust me, perhaps? Hm hm! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is prophesied that Krystalinda, the wicked witch who laid siege to Sniflheim in the Age of Heroes, will one day return.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you know anything of this fiend, wanderer? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What!? The witch is in the castle!? You say that she has made friends with Queen Frysabel and renounced her evil ways!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the raven's soot-black beak! Does this mean that this...creature is to live alongside us as a fellow Sniflheimer? I can hardly believe it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is to be expected, I suppose. Even the scholars themselves do not know her current whereabouts. But until she is finally laid low, this kingdom will never know true peace.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should learn anything about her\f2\emdash\f1 even the vaguest of rumours\f2\emdash\f1 please, you must let me know. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, traveller! Well met! How did you enjoy your stay in Sniflheim? I hope that you will visit us again. Until the next time, far vel! Goodbye now! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hrmmm... I am sure that I was running away from something absolutely terrifying...but for the life of me, I cannot remember what it was... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1  La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We come from the land of the snow and ice,\par
where the cold winds blow and the food is nice! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
*: Hurra! I got through a whole line without coughing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As the resident skald of Sniflheim\f2\emdash\f1 this is a kind of a minstrel\f2\emdash\f1 it is my duty to fill the streets with song each and every day. Thank goodness that the frog has finally hopped out of my throat! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These poor little animals were shivering with cold, but I took them on a brisk walk around town to warm them up, and now they're back to their spirited selves again. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I wasn't here to shovel this stuff, the streets would be submerged in snow! I'm the saviour of Sniflheim!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heave-ho! Heave-ho! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Far vel, snow! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
Away you go! \f3\u9834?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't get it... Everyone's goin' about their business like nuffink's 'appened...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Cor blimey! I clean forgot I've got me own business to take care of\f2\emdash\f1 I've gotta get that letter to the priest! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There is a young man with blue hair loitering by the city gates. I wonder what he is doing there... Waiting for somebody, maybe? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Captain is telling anyone who will listen that there is a witch in the castle. He usually takes himself so seriously. I suppose the stress has finally gotten to him... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come on, Sleepnir! Move your lazy behind! You are blocking the door! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am sorry, but my lazy lump of a horse just will not budge. If you want to head out of the city, I would suggest that you use the main gates.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Honestly, I do wish my boy would stop talking about wanting to fly. Nobody can fly! That is just a fact! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you have to hear this! I like walking around town looking out for pretty boys\f2\emdash\f1 I suppose you might call it my hobby.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, I just spotted a very fine specimen over by the gates! Spiky blue hair, a knife at his belt, an air of danger... He was just my type! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The handsome boy by the gates looks a little moody, but if you ask me, that is just because of the secret sadness he is holding in his heart. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...What!? The wicked witch has made friends with Queen Frysabel, and has moved into the castle!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew that it was her that I saw! By the snows... The ancient enemy of Sniflheim, living among us... I wonder how this will turn out... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a beautiful tone he has... I am glad to hear our skald's singing voice back to its normal loveliness. I could listen to that magical minstrel all day\f2\emdash\f1 in fact, I think I will!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When Mister Minstrel sings about shining snowfields or stormy seas, it makes you feel like you are really there! When I grow up, I want to sing songs just like him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came to this kingdom to join the Sniflheimian army. I'm going to have an interview with Queen Frysabel herself. To tell you the truth, I'm a bit nervous... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bounty hunter, and I always get my man. I came here to catch the Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I reckon it's about time for the hunt to begin. Heh heh heh... I'm coming for you, Darkspawn! Enjoy your freedom while it lasts! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Cold out today, isn't it? Why don't you take a break at my inn\f2\emdash\f1 I'll make you a nice, hot meal to warm you up.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Sn\'e6rfelt is home to many dangerous monsters. If you are planning to cross it, you would do well to leave your money with us first.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every time that lovely lady outside gives me her sales pitch, I end up coming in here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I try to control myself, but when she waggles those ears at me, I feel like I have to do whatever she tells me... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you know Erdwin's Lantern, the bright red star? Legend has it that the Luminary turned himself into this heavenly body so that he might watch over Erdrea for all eternity.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, I do not know if there is any truth to the tale, but for our ancestors to pass down such a story proves what a kind and trusted protector Erdwin must have been. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This tome tells the history of the Royal Library, that ancient archive of esoteric texts that rises high above the Sn\'e6rfelt.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A repository of forgotten knowledge from a bygone age... Does the mere idea of it not make your heart leap with wonder? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It does? Splendid, splendid! You have the soul of a scholar! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ha ha. You are not a reader then, I take it? For a bookworm such as I, a place like that would be paradise! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It is my dream to one day visit the Royal Library. I doubt I would eat or sleep for at least the first three days, I would be so engrossed in its treasures! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder what that awful racket in the throne room was all about...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, but I do not have the time to stand around pontificating! I must prepare Her Majesty's supper! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So Krystalinda is here on the invitation of the Queen? I do wish she had told us beforehand. It would have saved a lot of bother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I saw the witch in the throne room, I thought she had returned to reduce our realm to rubble! Her Majesty has a wider circle of friends than I knew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always thought the wicked witch was...well, wicked...but it seems that she is friends with Queen Frysabel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps if I were on good terms with Krystalinda, I could make friends with Her Majesty too... I must introduce myself! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The Heliodorian army are scouring the world for the Darkspawn. It seems their forces are on the alert all across Erdrea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our kingdom has remained neutral until now, but if they were to request our assistance directly, it would be very difficult to turn them down. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What manner of demon must this Darkspawn be to have an entire army hunting him down?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I fear that it is only a matter of time before Sniflheim is forced to aid in this search. I pray that our soldiers are not exposed to too much danger... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Velkominn to Sniflheim Castle, official residence of the noble Queen Frysabel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, feel free to look around. Many say that this is the handsomest palace in all Erdrea\f2\emdash\f1 and that our ruler is the most beautiful too. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Phew! It feels like the castle has finally warmed up again. There must be a nice warm blaze going in all the fireplaces. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lift beyond these doors will take you down to the basement. There is little down there but storerooms and cells, but you are welcome to take a look. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What are you doing down here, wanderer? If you came to see the castle, the chambers upstairs are of far more interest. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The Rainbough starts to glow brighter than ever before! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Thank you, <pc>. You and your friends have saved my kingdom. If it was not for you, my people might have stayed frozen forever.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell You are on a very important quest, are you not? One on which the fate of the world may depend? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell I thought so. When I look into your eyes, I can see just how determined you are to achieve your goal.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell You should know that not only I, but all the people of Sniflheim stand ready to aid you in your quest. I will pray that you prevail. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell You do not need to hide it. I can see the fire in your eyes. A heavy responsibility rests on your shoulders\f2\emdash\f1 one that you are determined to fulfil.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell You should know that not only I, but all the people of Sniflheim stand ready to aid you in your quest. I will pray that you prevail. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell As long as I am beside her, Frysabel has nothing to fear. She saved my life. Keeping her safe is the least I can do in return.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell And perhaps I can do something to ease her troubled mind too. Poor little Fryssy has so many worries, she needs somebody to talk to\f2\emdash\f1 why not a witch? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Don't look so frightened! I'm not going to freeze you again. Even if I wanted to, I simply don't have the power any more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell But that's not to say I've lost all my magic\f2\emdash\f1 I can still send a shiver down your spine, I'm sure! Hm hm hm! \f3\u9829?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell I never thought I would see the day when the Queen would be receiving her counsel from a witch! It just goes to show, you can never tell what the future holds.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell And as long as Krystalinda swears that she will never turn against Sniflheim again, I don't see the harm in allowing her to stay here in the castle. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell I can hardly believe that Krystalinda tricked me twice. What kind of tutor is unable to recognise his own pupil? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am still not entirely sure what happened, but it seems that everything is settled now. Thank you, wanderers, for...err...whatever it was that you did. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If Her Majesty was worried about her royal responsibilities, why did she not talk with me about it? Does she not trust me, her most faithful advisor?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I had no idea... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The legends talk of Krystalinda as a creature of unfathomable malice, with a heart as black as a raven's beak. Can she really be trusted? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am not sure about the witch. Still, Her Majesty seems to trust her, so she cannot be all bad, I suppose.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So long as Queen Frysabel is safe and well, our kingdom has nothing to fear. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My thanks, wanderers. If it were not for you, the wicked witch might still be sitting on the throne, and not our beloved queen.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sniflheim is in your debt. I do not know where your adventure will take you next, but you will always be welcome here. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Krystalinda's evil deeds were the stuff of legend, and yet Queen Frysabel managed to make her change her ways.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty's kindness is so great that she melted even that frostiest of hearts. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you see the shining sphere at the top of the fountain? We call it the \'c6steinn. Its everlasting light serves as a symbol of eternal peace.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If a couple pledge their love before the \'c6steinn, they will never be parted...or so the legend goes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My girlfriend asked me to come with her to swear our love before the \'c6steinn. It is a load of old mumbo jumbo if you ask me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After more than a decade of painstaking study, I came to the conclusion that the wicked witch would one day return to wreak vengeance upon Sniflheim.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now I understand that she is living happily at the castle! There must have been some flaw in my research...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In a single stroke, the fruit of my life's work has been proven false. Ha ha! The study of the arcane arts is full of surprises! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Waaah! P-P-Please, spare my life! Think of my children!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Oh wait, it is you. Please, you must not scare me like that. For a moment, I thought you were the wicked witch, escaped from the castle, and come to gnaw on my bones!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Everybody else seems to have forgiven Krystalinda, but personally, I would rather be safe than sorry. I will not be visiting the castle any time soon. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always thought that I was the most bewitching of them all, but now that I've seen Krystalinda, I have had to think again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Compared to her, I am about as seductive as Snorri! (sigh) I suppose I'll just have to learn to live with being second best...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: But I won't give up! One of these days, I'll be the Queen of Comeliness again! I'll just have to turn on the charm even more than before!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hei there, handsome. \f3\u9829?\f1  Say, do you think I'm more alluring than Krystalinda? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Really!? Oh, you big flirt! \f3\u9829?\f1  I know you're just flattering me, but thanks all the same! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I guess you're right... But just you wait, honey\f2\emdash\f1 one of these days, I'll be more bewitching than the witch herself! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1  La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We come from the land of the snow and ice,\par
where the cold winds blow and the food is nice! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We've a queen, fair and wise, ruler of us all! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
With the witch by her side she will never fall! \f3\u9834?\f1  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I composed a new verse to celebrate the witch taking up residence at the castle. Not bad, eh? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1  La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We come from the land of the snow and ice,\par
where the cold winds blow and the food is nice! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Myself and this lovely young lady have joined forces to put on a performance of song and dance. It seems to be attracting quite the crowd.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me, but I must return to the show. I cannot disappoint my public! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
J\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
J\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you like my song? My mamma taught it to me. She says the same song was once roared by a magical beast! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
J\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! J\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
J\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6r j\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6\'f6r! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder if that is really what the magical beast sounds like. I would like to meet it one day and find out! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mamma makes the best fiskesuppe in Sniflheim! It's full of fresh fish and vegetables!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She is the greatest cook in the whole wide world! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My cow is such a nuisance. She is always running away from the pen and getting lost.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Where has she run off to this time? Well, wherever she is, she is not getting any hay today! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My cow is a nuisance, but that just makes me love her all the more. I suppose it is the same with animals as it is with people. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What are you doing all the way over here? If I have told you once, I have told you a thousand times\f2\emdash\f1 you are not supposed to leave your pen!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No hay for you tonight, missy! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Honestly Fjola, you could at least have the decency to look a little upset. Whenever I scold you, you just stare back at me and smile.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You might have everybody else fooled, but I know you understand every word I say! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: No, no, that's far too much! You could at least give me a discount for keeping me waiting so long!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What do you mean you didn't keep me waiting!? Oh, come on! You're not still trying to sell me that story, are you? You were late\f2\emdash\f1 admit it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I finally 'anded over that letter to the priest. Bish bosh, job done! Now it's on to Arboria!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which means I'll 'ave to traipse all the way over that snowfield, then up into the 'ighlands... I just 'ope me poor old knees can 'andle it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's my dream to master every dance in the world, so I'm travelling all over Erdrea to seek them out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The people of Sniflheim are so kind. I asked them to teach me the traditional dance of their kingdom, and they were more than happy to oblige!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've teamed up with a local musician to put on a performance. Come over to the bonfire by the city gates later on and see the show! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tee hee! Isn't this music wonderful? It's a traditional Sniflheimian dancing song. That kind of energetic rhythm is sure to keep folks warm in these cold climes, don't you think?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can't you feel yourself just starting to sway with the beat? Come on, why don't you join me? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bounty hunter, and I always get my man. I came here to catch the Darkspawn.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say a hundred soldiers couldn't stop him escaping from Heliodor. He cut them all down, one after another.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're tough, Darkspawn, but are you tough enough to take me on? Heh heh heh. I can't wait to find out... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm a bounty hunter, and I always get my man. I came here to catch the Darkspawn, but the trail's gone cold.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He's definitely somewhere close, though\f2\emdash\f1 I can smell it. If you see anyone suspicious, let me know. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it was not just my imagination! I did see that witch! And now she is living in the castle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She was much more...angry-looking when I saw her, though. I wonder what Her Majesty did to calm her down... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The castle is closed to visitors after dark, I am afraid. If you wish to go in, you will have to come back during the day. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Helv\'edti! Curses! I take my eyes off our new recruit for one minute, and he is sleeping at his post again! If the Captain catches him, there will be trouble for sure. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When the Captain said he had seen a witch, I took him for a fool\f2\emdash\f1 but now she has appeared in the castle! Looks like it was me who was the fool... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The guard is fast asleep. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: One of these, please...and one of those...oh, and a sackful of that over there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Dear me, my little girl is growing up so fast! She is eating me out of house and home! At this rate, my nest egg will be gone before I know it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She just cannot get enough of my fiskesuppe. Surely once a week is enough, but she wants it for dinner every day! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Brrr... I was taking a look around the town, and before I knew it, I couldn't stop shivering! Thank goodness for this bonfire\f2\emdash\f1 I can finally get some heat back in my bones.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think that this fire must be enchanted\f2\emdash\f1 it is always burning brightly, though no one ever stokes it. Whoever lit it must have been a powerful magician indeed. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1  La la laaa, la! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
We come from the land of the snow and ice,\par
where the cold winds blow and the food is nice! \f3\u9834?\f1\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I was younger, I dreamt of becoming a minstrel. Sadly, I did not have the talent.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But even though I abandoned that dream, my love for music remains. Whenever I hear a minstrel play, I cannot help but sing along.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My horse loves the sea. She is never happier than when she is looking out over the ocean with the salty wind ruffling her mane.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She has always been like this, ever since she was a foal. I thought she would have grown out of it by now, but it seems she just cannot get enough!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I raised this horse from a foal. She is like a daughter to me, and I do my very best to be a good father.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tee hee! I am ready for another grand shopping spree! Money is no object! Come along, shopkeep, let me see your wares!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This lady is my very best customer. She is always so generous when it comes to splashing her cash.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If it was not for her, I do not think that I would ever turn a profit. Most of the money that I make comes straight out of her purse!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Come and get your fruit and vegetables, fresh from the snowfields of Sniflheim! They're the cheapest in town!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Plants have to be strong to survive in this cold climate. This means that my vegetables are packed full of nutrients. And if they are strong, you will be too!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are looking for the finest produce in Sniflheim, any time of the day or night, I'm your man! My vegetables are the best in town\f2\emdash\f1 and cheap too!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Throw some of my hearty potatoes into a pot with a nice piece of fish, and you'll soon have yourself a fiskesuppe that is sure to warm your cockles!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Can I interest you in this fine specimen? ...I can? And that one...and the other one too!? My word, you must be hungry!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you for your custom! I am sure you will make a feast fit for Queen Frysabel herself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I met my old friend Snorri for the first time in forever the other day. He was staying at his cabin in the Sn\'e6rfelt, but he is back now.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He said some very strange things\f2\emdash\f1 like that he was glad to see I had survived being frozen solid. I hope he is not going soft in the head in his old age... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Are you trying to ruin me? There is no way I can sell to you at that price! ...What? You want an extra discount for being kept waiting!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How many times do I have to tell you!? I may have made you wait before, but this time, it was not me who was late\f2\emdash\f1 it was you who were early! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will never believe this\f2\emdash\f1 the witch who lives in the castle can actually fly! I have never heard of a person being able to fly before!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: My boy wants to make friends with the witch. He thinks she will teach him how to fly. I don't mind the flying, but I worry what else he might learn from a woman like that...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Krystalinda certainly has her charms. She is very popular with the townsfolk\f2\emdash\f1 especially the men\f2\emdash\f1 but I do worry that she might not have completely renounced her wicked ways.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I am sure that I am being silly. Yes, I am worrying over nothing. Ignore me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Krystalinda says she can teach me how to fly, but not until I am older.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I am going to learn how to fly, and then I will zoom through the sky like a bird! It is going to be amaaazing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, Krystalinda is going to teach me how to fly, but I cannot wait that long! I want to fly right now! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Did you know that the whole of the city of Sniflheim, including our famous castle, was designed by the legendary architect Gunnar Bilder Borg?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He built many buildings all over Erdrea, but very few are still standing. Sniflheim is the only place where one can see the true beauty of his original vision. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Because of the strangely shaped domes that top the towers, some people call Sniflheim Castle the \lquote Onion Palace\rquote . Ha ha ha! I bet you did not know that! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There was a handsome boy with spiky blue hair hanging around by the gates, but he has gone now. Such a shame\f2\emdash\f1 he was so easy on the eye... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: So the bunny girl lured you into the mead-hall again, did she? Honestly, when are you going to learn your lesson!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My husband is such a fool. I do not know why I ever married him! If only I had said \lquote I don't\rquote , I could be in the arms of that handsome young man who was by the gates instead...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When the witch first appeared, I was sure that she meant to do us harm, but now it seems that she is firm friends with Queen Frysabel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is a welcome development, but still, I cannot help feeling a little ashamed that she was able to slip into the castle undetected... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: After the sun sets, the monsters come out in force. It is my duty to make sure not a single one of them sets foot inside the city.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sniflheim is a prosperous kingdom, but that wealth is not shared by everyone. While some live lives of luxury, others struggle to survive.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, just a few years ago, two young children lived in a makeshift shack beyond the city walls\f2\emdash\f1 a brother and a sister whose only family was each other.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though they were poor and hungry, they refused to accept their fate, and steadfastly struggled on together through thick and thin.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I joined the church to aid just such suffering souls...but sometimes I wonder whether I am making any difference at all...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, have you seen Queen Frysabel's friend? What a beauty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And I think she likes me! I've decided to go over there and ask if she wants to join me for a drink\f2\emdash\f1 I just need to pluck up the courage first... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There is a band of Vikings who live just around the coast\f2\emdash\f1 expert sailors, every one. They are not bad guys, but they can be a bit rough and ready sometimes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are planning on taking a trip to their hideout, you had better make sure to tread carefully. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't do it, my friend. Krystalinda is a witch\f2\emdash\f1 she may have lost most of her powers, but I'm sure she still has some magic left.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you go over there and make a fool of yourself, she might get angry and turn you into a snowman! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was planning to head up into the Arborian Highlands to get a closer look at Yggdrasil, but I wasn't counting on it being quite this chilly here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You're heading up there yourself? Well, the trail goes from the south-east corner of the Sn\'e6rfelt, but it's no pleasant country stroll, I'm warning you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The monsters in those mountains are some of the most vicious brutes in the whole of Erdrea. You'll want to keep your wits about you\f2\emdash\f1 and get yourself some decent equipment to boot. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The skald and the dancer may have only recently met, but already their performances complement each other perfectly.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If they were to tour the world together, I am sure they would attract great crowds wherever they went.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That dancer is really good. She never misses a beat! When I grow up, I want to be able to dance like her. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It doesn't look like Sir Hendrik and the others are coming back. They just sailed off into the sunset and left me behind.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You don't think they've forgotten about me, do you? It would be funny if it wasn't so tragic... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you met Queen Frysabel? She's so nice! I told her that I wanted to join the Sniflheimian army, and she welcomed me with open arms!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty's army isn't so much of a boys' club as some of the other nations' forces, so I should be able to fit right in. I knew it was a good idea to come here! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: This whole city was designed by one man? Well, he did a good job, I'll give him that. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty is quite the connoisseur. She is always asking me to order fine wines and exotic spirits from all over the world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps one day, she will invite me to set up a mead-hall in the castle itself. With all those rich nobles around, I would make a killing for sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The witch who has moved into the castle is absolutely captivating. I think she might be even more beautiful than the lovely lady who stands outside.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But no matter how wonderful she may be, my heart will always belong to my beautiful bunny girl!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She stole it some years ago, when she first tempted me to spend all day drinking in the mead-hall...and I've been in her thrall ever since... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sob) I couldn't help myshelf... She has magical powersh, I tell you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Urk! (gulp) Urrrgh... I feel shick to my shtomach... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Since prehistoric times, people have watched the stars.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems that our distant ancestors were able to compile an accurate calendar by observing their movements, just as we do now. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I have heard that in the deserts of Gallopolis, there lie the remains of an ancient observatory, built in a time before the Age of Heroes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As a student of the astronomical arts, I should very much like to pay it a visit one day. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, and I am sure every visitor to Sniflheim will be very interested in meeting Krystalinda, the not-so-wicked witch!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As this kingdom's tourist information officer-in-chief, I must remember to write a pamphlet telling tourists all about our latest attraction!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I spend every day cooped up in my room, poring over musty old manuscripts. It is nice to come outside every so often and have some fun.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listening to this beautiful music and watching this beautiful lady dance... Ahh, it really blows away the cobwebs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you heard the news? Queen Frysabel has made friends with the wicked witch Krystalinda!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Just imagine... Making friends with the legendary Mistress of Misery\f2\emdash\f1 the Queen of Cruelty\f2\emdash\f1 the Scourge of Sniflheim! If you ask me, Her Majesty is almost too kind. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty spends nearly every day in court receiving visitors and hearing the petitions of her people. As yet, we soldiers have had no reason to intervene.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But we must remain vigilant! It is our duty to protect Queen Frysabel from every danger, whether it be an invading army, or an assassin's dagger. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whenever Her Majesty smiles at me, I forget that I am nothing more than a lowly guard\f2\emdash\f1 for I feel like a prince!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I know that it is just a fantasy... A dream that will never come true... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I wonder what kind of man Her Majesty will marry... One of the princes of the great nations, I suppose... (sigh) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: The wicked witch who froze Sniflheim so many centuries ago has come back to life, and she is living in the castle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At first, I thought she was here to wreak revenge on us all, but she is actually very friendly! People are just full of surprises, are they not? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I have seen her at last! Krystalinda, the wicked witch, in the flesh! The legends said that she was possessed of a savage beauty, but she is even more breathtaking than I had imagined!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those ice-blue eyes of hers... Ooh, they sent a shiver down my spine\f2\emdash\f1 in a good way, of course. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They say that Krystalinda is already firm friends with Her Majesty. I wonder how she did it\f2\emdash\f1 Frysabel is usually so shy around strangers...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even though we grew up together, it was years before we grew close\f2\emdash\f1 and now that witch has done the same thing in a matter of days! Where does that leave me, hm!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Velkominn to Sniflheim Castle, official residence of the noble Queen Frysabel.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nowadays, it is also home to Krystalinda, the only woman in all Erdrea whose beauty rivals that of Her Majesty! Please, feel free to look around. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Krystalinda showed me some of the things she could do with what remains of her powers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She froze a rose, and when I touched it, it shattered into dust. It was a very impressive little trick. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since Her Majesty made friends with the witch, she has started to smile again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is good that she has found a new friend. After her father died, I was worried that she would never overcome the awful slump she fell into. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lift down to the dungeon was constructed many centuries ago. We believe that it is powered by magic, but the details of its workings have been lost to time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our ancestors must have been very advanced indeed to be able to construct something that has continued to work so well for all these years. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: My grandfather told me that the same technology that keeps the lift afloat could be used to raise whole villages into the sky.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But then again, he always was one for tall tales. It is an interesting idea though, no? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you seen how much dust has piled up behind the barrels? This room looks as if it has not been cleaned for months.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They are supposed to come down here every day! I shall have to give one of the maids a piece of my mind! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell Hello! How wonderful it is to see you again! If there is anything troubling you, please do let me know.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell I don't know if I can be of any real help, but since you saved my kingdom, I shall try to aid you in whatever way I can. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell\par
Krystalinda seems to have settled into her new life in the castle already.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell But don't worry\f2\emdash\f1 if she should ever even think of turning on Sniflheim again, I shall give her a jolly good telling off! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
By the way, Fryssy, how did it go with that guard? You know, the pretty little thing you said you had a crush on? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell\par
Err... Well, I... Ahem... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
Ugh, you mean you haven't told him you like him yet!? You'd better tell him soon, or some other girl will come along and snap him up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell\par
B-But...what if he doesn't... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
Oh, honestly! You're rich, you're pretty\f2\emdash\f1 you could have any man you wanted! Have a little more confidence in yourself, will you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Ever since I came here, I've been observing how everyone lives. It's fascinating to see all the little things they do... What they think... What they say...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell It's funny\f2\emdash\f1 I've never had the slightest bit of interest in the lives of humans until now. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
I feel bad about having you maul that poor monster who was suppressing my powers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell Well, when I meet him in the next world, I'll be sure to say sorry. We witches live for centuries, so I'll have plenty of time to perfect my apology. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
By the way, Fryssy, how did it go with that guard? You know, the pretty little thing you said you had a crush on? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell\par
Err... Well, I... Ahem... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
Ugh, you mean you haven't told him you like him yet!? You'd better tell him soon, or some other girl will come along and snap him up! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Queen Frysabel\cell\par
B-But...what if he doesn't... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Krystalinda\cell\par
Oh, honestly! You're rich, you're pretty\f2\emdash\f1 you could have any man you wanted! Have a little more confidence in yourself, will you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell The townspeople are unaware that Krystalinda froze the city, and I think it best that they stay that way. Ignorance is bliss, as they say.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell But fear not, <pc>\f2\emdash\f1 Krystalinda, Queen Frysabel and I know that you are the true heroes of this kingdom, and we will never forget it. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Snorri\cell\par
When I was in my cabin, I would often hear strange groaning sounds at night. It must have been J\'f6rmun. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The King of Heliodor has mobilised his entire army to hunt for the Darkspawn. Sniflheim has remained neutral in the matter so far.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is Her Majesty's policy to watch and wait\f2\emdash\f1 only if it is confirmed that the Luminary is truly a danger to the world will we involve ourselves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Queen Frysabel comes from a long line of wise and conscientious rulers. She will not be moved to rash action by baseless rumour. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Krystalinda taught me all about how to put on make-up the other day. I was very wary of her at first, but it seems my fears were unfounded.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As a warrior, I have never had any interest in such things, but she assures me it will be highly effective against attackers\f2\emdash\f1 with smoky eyes like hers, I will knock them dead, apparently! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Now that I think about it, Her Majesty has been looking a little more glamorous than usual lately. Could that be Krystalinda's doing? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Queen Frysabel is as beautiful as she is kind. Everybody in the kingdom loves her.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps I am wrong, but it seems there is one who loves her more than others\f2\emdash\f1 one who wants to make Her Majesty HIS Majesty. If you ask me, he's got ideas above his station. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You're pretty friendly with Her Majesty too, aren't you? Don't even think about getting any friendlier, if you know what I mean.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A lady as noble as Queen Frysabel is not going to run away with any old Thor, Dag or Harald. But if you were the prince of a great nation, it would be a different story! Ha ha ha! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty is a congenial soul, and will meet with anyone who desires an audience, however suspicious they may be.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is why we soldiers stay close by, ever-ready to deal with any danger. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Her Majesty's manner of speaking reminds me of her father, King Gustaf.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I hear those little turns of phrase, it takes me back to the days when His Majesty was still with us... (sniff) Forgive me, I am getting a little choked up just thinking about it... \cell\row 
\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\par
\b\fs24 1.20 Arboria\b0\fs22\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benedictus\cell When you offer up the six sacred orbs to the altar in the First Forest, the path to Yggdrasil shall be revealed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benedictus\cell Go, my child, and seek out the Orbs. When you have all six in your possession, return to me, and I will guide you to your destiny. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Benedictus\cell Splendid! You have all six Orbs in your possession! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This path leads to the top of the mountain. It is a sacred place, where none may set foot without the Holy Father's permission. Forgive me, but I must ask that you turn back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to Arboria, the sacred sanctuary beneath Yggdrasil's all-embracing boughs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We Keepers have dwelt here for many generations, watching over the World Tree and keeping the legend of the Luminary alive. I am sure everyone will be delighted to meet you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I had imagined the Luminary to be some manner of grizzled warrior, but you are simply adorable! Why, if I was ten years younger, I would gobble you up!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We are blessed with soil of a most wondrous richness, from which spring forth some of Erdrea's most fragrant herbs and delicious vegetables. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome, child, to Arboria, the home of the Keepers. We have waited many years for your coming.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should wish to learn more of the Age of Heroes and the Luminary of Legend, we have many books that relate these ancient tales in detail. You may read them at your leisure. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, Luminary. I hear that you came here to visit the Tree of Life Herself, is that so?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then you must needs journey through the First Forest. It is a sacred wood that lies beyond the village. From the peak of the hill at its centre, Yggdrasil is so close that one can almost touch Her roots. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The sigil on your hand is known in the legends as the Mark of Light. It is said to symbolise the bond between the Luminary and the World Tree.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you were to visit Her holy Heart and offer up the Mark, I do not doubt that mighty Yggdrasil would make Her will known to you. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you lift up your eyes to the night sky and gaze upon the constellations glinting above you, have you perchance spied a solitary star shining with a rich, red light? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then you must seek it out when next the heavens darken. The star I speak of is none other than Erdwin's Lantern, the flame-red beacon we Keepers have prayed to since time immemorial.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The star is known as Erdwin's Lantern, for it symbolises our saviour, the Luminary of Legend. We Keepers have prayed to it since time immemorial.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you gaze up into the night sky, have you perchance spied a solitary star shining with a rich, red light? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then you must seek it out. The star I speak of is none other than Erdwin's Lantern, the flame-red beacon we Keepers have prayed to since time immemorial.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The star is known as Erdwin's Lantern, for it symbolises our saviour, the Luminary of Legend. We Keepers have prayed to it since time immemorial.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The great figure carved into the mountain above us represents the holy sage who fought the Dark One alongside the Luminary of Legend.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It may be naught but a figment of my imagination, but She seems to be smiling today... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My wife and I have been happily married for many years. Alas, Yggdrasil did not bless us with a child. I had almost given up hope that I would ever be a father.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But at long last, the World Tree has answered my prayers and delivered unto us a beautiful baby boy! I am so very happy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To think that the Luminary himself should be present at my son's baptism... Truly, the World Tree must have great things in store for this boy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Before Veronica and Serena were born, it was prophesied that Alma's child would be the reincarnation of the holy sage. Imagine our surprise when she gave birth to twins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It seems they still inherited Serenica's soul\f2\emdash\f1 it was simply divided between them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Father Benedictus knew this as soon as he saw them. That is why he sent them to search for the Luminary\f2\emdash\f1 as the scions of Serenica, he knew that they would surely recognise him on sight. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hurrah! The Luminary's here! I'm so, so happy to meet you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're amazing! Looking into your face is like staring into the sun! I'm blinded by your heroism! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ah-phew... Ah-phew... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Woof! Arf, arf! Aooo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ao-ao-aooo! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This path leads to a small copse. There is little there save an abiding aura of serenity, but this is no bad thing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When we were children, Veronica, Serena and I would often go there to play. Ahh, such happy memories... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As with people, so with plants\f2\emdash\f1 it is all in the upbringing. If one gives even the tiniest, frailest seedling enough love and attention, it will one day grow into a mighty oak.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see a great strength in you, Luminary. You may have lost your kingdom and your home, but you should be grateful to those who raised you\f2\emdash\f1 it is evident that they cared for you very much.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These stairs lead to the terrace. When Serena was young, she would often go there to practise the harp under the old oak. I should very much like to hear her play again. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I heard all those years ago that the Luminary had been slain by the monsters who destroyed Dundrasil, I feared that all was lost...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every false sighting, every baseless rumour of your survival, was like a dagger thrust into my heart... But now you stand before me, alive and well! Prithee, tell me I am not dreaming! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some years ago, on an evening just like this one, we saw the World Tree bathed in a beautiful light. The Holy Father told us that it signified the rebirth of the Luminary.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since then, I have offered up a prayer to almighty Yggdrasil each night to ask that She watch over you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To we Keepers, you are as sacred even as our beloved children. May Her divine light keep you always from harm. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There was once a famous sage who lived in this village. She taught us how to use magic, and would sing songs of love and longing as she strummed her harp.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whether it was told by her or about her, almost every one of our legends relates to that sage in one way or another. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Father Benedictus and I are the same age, you know. I have lost count of the number of baptisms I have seen him perform.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The ceremony welcomes the child into the fold, marking them out as a beloved son or daughter of Arboria. And all of them I love as though they were my own. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Brr... I am chilled to the very bone. But a nice, warm cup of tea will soon see to that. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have seen many a baptism in my day, but the pleasure of welcoming another child into our midst never lessens.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And how much greater the pleasure when it is accompanied by your coming, Luminary\f2\emdash\f1 another gift sent to us by almighty Yggdrasil! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This path leads to the top of the mountain. It is a sacred place, where none may set foot without the Holy Father's permission. Forgive me, but I must ask that you turn back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We of Arboria worship almighty Yggdrasil. Oft have I prayed that She would watch over you, Chosen One. And now at last we may pray together...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oho! The day has finally come! The Luminary stands on the threshold of my humble inn! Step inside, I prithee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you and your friends were to stay the night, this establishment would surely go down in legend! I shall rename it the Hostelry of Heroes, and it will be celebrated for generations to come!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the house that your friends Veronica and Serena grew up in.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Their honoured parents, Fidelus and Alma, still live here. I am sure they will be overjoyed to learn that their daughters succeeded in finding the Luminary. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Father Benedictus is blessed with a most wondrous gift. When events of great importance are afoot, the World Tree will grant him a premonition. The visions come to him in his sleep.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Indeed, only a few nights before your birth, the Holy Father woke the entire village to announce that the Luminary was to be born anew.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, and he has asked me to tell you that you are welcome to come and go freely from his home here as you please. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Why, if it isn't the Luminary! It would be an honour to have you stay at our humble establishment! Well, then\f2\emdash\f1 to business...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We do not get many visitors all the way up here, but still I change the sheets and fluff the pillows every morning. After all, who knows\f2\emdash\f1 the Luminary himself might stop by!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'8d\'73\'93\'ae\'92\'86\f5\'a3\'ba\'b3\'f5\'bb\'d8\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must admit, I am a little nervous about being entrusted with the Luminary's life savings...but if you so desire, I shall guard your gold as if it were my own!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The people of Arboria are only interested in matters of the soul or of the intellect\f2\emdash\f1 they have no interest whatsoever in financial affairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But at least they do not fritter away their gold on gaudy trinkets and loose living. After all, if one does not nurture one's nest egg, it will never hatch!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'8d\'73\'93\'ae\'92\'86\f5\'a3\'ba\'b3\'f5\'bb\'d8\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is every Keeper's duty to defend the village in times of crisis. But all that huffing and puffing and swinging swords around is a terrible bore.\par
*: This is why I am studying healing magic instead\f2\emdash\f1 if monsters should attack, I will simply stand at the back and cast a few spells. Then, when the dust settles, I will be alive and well to bask in the adulation!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is a shame I do not have Serena's talent\f2\emdash\f1 then I would not even have to study very hard to achieve my noble aim! Agh, I am so very jealous! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A horrible, dirty rat just scuttled across the floor! I will not be able to sleep now until I know it is gone for good.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) If only I had not been neglecting my studies, I could Whack it and Thwack it to kingdom come! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be just like Veronica! That's why I'm studying magic\f2\emdash\f1 so I can sling fireballs just like she showed me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm training to be a mage. I just learned how to cast Frizz\f2\emdash\f1 I can't do it very well yet, but it's good enough to make toast! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Luminary himself! What an unexpected honour! Can I interest you in any of my wares? Let us see now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Trees grow very slowly up here in the highlands, but this makes their wood wonderfully dense. It may be difficult to work with, but it can be used to make some terrific weapons and armour.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\f3\u9670?\f4\'8d\'73\'93\'ae\'92\'86\f5\'a3\'ba\'b3\'f5\'bb\'d8\f4\'82\'c6\'93\'af\'82\'b6\f1\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was very sorry to hear of what happened to Dundrasil and Cobblestone. You have my deepest condolences.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should find yourself without a home to return to when your adventure is over, you must come and live in Arboria. We would be thrilled to have the Luminary living among us. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, Luminary! Welcome to Arboria! I am Fidelus, proud father of Veronica and Serena.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Fidelus\cell I always knew that my little angels would find you\f2\emdash\f1 I only hope that they have not been causing you too much trouble! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you are the Luminary... You are younger than I expected. Ah, but forgive me\f2\emdash\f1 I have not introduced myself. I am Alma, Veronica and Serena's mother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Alma\cell The responsibilities of your role no doubt weigh heavily upon your shoulders. I trust that my daughters will do all they can to lighten that burden. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, so you are the Luminary, are you? You do not look much like a legendary hero to me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In fact, you look more like a heroine! Just look at that hair! It is even silkier and straighter than mine! Almost...annoyingly so... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1362\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
